Infinite Conjurer","gender":"Male","titles":"Wild Card","subrace":"Half-Genie","summary":"Zafir is a Half-Genie and Half-Human Sunspear whose impossible birth was made possible by his mother''s Great Wish. His father''s entire Genie essence was woven into Zafir''s soul to sustain his existence. Charismatic, theatrical, and effortlessly confident, Zafir travels with Kaelen''s crew while searching for the Lamp of the First Djinn and a way to separate his father''s essence from his own.","heritage":"Sunspear","homeland":"Shifting Sands","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Conjurer","affiliation":"Kaelen''s Crew","apparentAge":"Early 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Extreme magical versatility\nAerial mobility\nMatter alteration\nPhysical evasion\nTangible conjuration\nDesert navigation\nSocial manipulation","weaknesses":"Severe post-wish exhaustion\nVulnerability after granting wishes","combatStyle":["Aerial combat","Sunspear combat","Reality manipulation","Transmutation","Conjured weapons","Evasive combat"],"limitations":["One wish per person per lifetime","Cannot grant his own wishes","Wish granting drains Chronoessence"],"powerSource":["Genie essence","Internal Chronoessence"],"abilityNotes":"Zafir''s magic is internal rather than drawn from an external Chronoessence source. His conjurations emerge through mint-blue mist accompanied by the scent of jasmine and ozone. His One-Wish Rule allows him to grant one wish to each person during that person''s lifetime, but fulfilling a wish severely depletes his Chronoessence and can leave him vulnerable for several days.","combatProfile":"Zafir fights from the air whenever possible, using mobility and unpredictability rather than remaining in direct exchanges. He alters matter, creates tangible phantasms, and shifts into mist to evade attacks. His Sunspear training gives him a grounded combat foundation when magic is unavailable.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Mist Form\nMiniature Form\nShapeshifted Forms","primaryAbilities":"Conjuration\nTransmutation\nMaterial Manipulation\nPhantasm Creation\nIntangibility\nFlight","secondaryAbilities":"Shapeshifting\nMiniaturization\nMist Transformation\nDesert Hazard Sensing\nTemporal Dust Detection","signatureTechniques":"One-Wish Rule\nHard-Light Conjuration\nMist Form\nMiniature Form","transformationDetails":"Zafir can dissolve his physical body into a gaseous mist capable of bypassing barriers and physical attacks. He can also transmute himself into animals, other people, or a miniature version of himself while retaining his personality and magical nature."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Short","Lean","Athletic"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"5''4\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Golden amber"],"grooming":"Well-groomed","skinTone":["Warm bronze"],"wardrobe":"Sleeveless embroidered vests\nHarem pants\nRoyal Sunspear silks\nFlowing waist fabrics","hairColor":["Mint-blue"],"hairStyle":"Voluminous gravity-defying waves","accessories":"Gold bangles\nJeweled waist-cinch\nSapphire earring\nGold necklace","faceDetails":["Sharp features","Handsome face","Almond-shaped eyes"],"hairTexture":["Thick"],"colorPalette":"Mint Blue\nCerulean\nSilver\nTeal\nGold\nWarm Bronze","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Teal\nGold\nBlack\nWhite","alternateForm":["Mist Form","Miniature Form"],"clothingStyle":"Opulent Sunspear clothing designed for unrestricted movement and aerial poses. Open-chested garments deliberately leave his Genie markings visible.","appearanceNotes":"Zafir''s blue markings extend from the crown of his head to the soles of his feet and pulse when he channels magic. His hair and loose fabrics subtly drift as though suspended underwater. He commonly hovers several inches above the ground, making his short stature less immediately apparent.","outfitMaterials":["Silk","Gold embroidery","Sheer fabric"],"postureMovement":["Persistent hovering","Fluid movement","Weightless movement","Relaxed floating poses"],"signatureOutfit":"A short sleeveless embroidered vest worn over a bare chest with high-waisted teal harem pants, gold jewelry, and flowing Sunspear fabrics.","distinguishingFeatures":["Glowing blue Genie markings"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:24:34.742151+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:27:12.7841+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing his father permanently","Being exploited as an artifact","Losing his identity","Having his wishes abused"],"goals":["Find the Lamp of the First Djinn","Untangle his father''s essence","Meet his father","Understand the Shifting Sands"],"beliefs":["Wishes should carry meaning","Greed destroys people","Freedom is essential","Sacrifice gives wishes value"],"culture":["Sunspear","Navigator"],"lineage":"Sunspear","storyArc":"Zafir''s search for the Lamp of the First Djinn forces him to confront whether becoming whole requires separating himself from the father whose essence helped create him. His journey through the Shifting Sands becomes both a search for his father and an exploration of his own identity.","backstory":"Genies normally cannot reproduce with mortals. Zafir''s mother used her final Great Wish to conceive a child with the Genie she loved. The wish required Zafir''s father''s entire essence to be woven into Zafir, leaving the boy carrying both his own soul and his father''s essence. Zafir eventually began searching for the Lamp of the First Djinn in hopes of untangling them.","childhood":"Zafir was raised by his mother in a village of Master Navigators within the Shifting Sands. He learned Sunspear combat, star-mapping, desert survival, and how to read signs associated with Gaius and Ruchika. His unusual Genie traits made him both valuable to the village and a target for Desert Raiders.","lifestyle":["Prefers hovering to walking","Enjoys social settings","Explores ancient ruins","Searches magical nexuses","Avoids unnecessary physical labor"],"storyRole":"Zafir serves as the charismatic wild card of Kaelen''s crew. His reality-warping abilities provide extraordinary versatility, while his knowledge of the Shifting Sands makes him essential when the crew enters Genie territory.","birthplace":"Shifting Sands","psychology":["Feels divided between two identities","Masks insecurity with confidence","Values personal freedom","Distrusts greed","Protective of his wish magic"],"motivations":["Understand his Genie heritage","Restore his father","Protect his autonomy","Prevent misuse of wishes"],"personality":["Charismatic","Confident","Enigmatic","Romantic","Playful","Witty","Theatrical","Selective","Stylish","Detached"],"voiceSpeech":["Speaks in third person","Smooth delivery","Playful teasing","Elegant phrasing","Slightly theatrical"],"likesDislikes":["Beautiful things","Stories","Teasing Sax","Jasmine","Stargazing","Greed","Confinement","Being underestimated","Wasted wishes"],"majorLifeEvents":"Born through the Great Wish\nFather''s essence merged with his soul\nRaised among the Master Navigators\nBecame a Navigator scout\nTargeted by Desert Raiders\nJoined Kaelen''s Crew\nBegan searching for the First Djinn''s Lamp"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/6d00acef-a778-40bb-bfdc-f72787d0168f/portrait/1790360764956-zafir-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Kaelen\nSax","rivals":"Sax","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Shifting Sands\nShifting Citadel\nLamp of the First Djinn","relationshipNotes":"Zafir''s unnamed Genie father sacrificed his separate existence during the Great Wish that created Zafir, leaving his essence woven into Zafir''s soul. His unnamed Sunspear mother raised him among the Navigators and taught him the story of his father''s sacrifice. Zafir shares a playful rivalry with Sax and frequently provokes him through teasing and effortless displays of magic."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"0b60f4e0-6962-403f-9129-83fba60ab268","realm_record_id":"48066562-cd1c-4b72-8c29-399594efad38","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"5390053d-91ee-4046-943f-d8008e4d5d0e","faction_record_id":"f5492e8b-d617-44b1-bce7-517c90d1da55"},{"id":"68184520-5c4b-48e9-a93b-668149340e3b","name":"Ylva Morwenna de la Vega","media":{"tbdFields":"Reference / Production Sheet\nAlternate / True Form","canonLocks":"Age 14\n5''1\" height\nOlive-pale skin\nDeep espresso near-black hair\nSlightly wavy hair\nExplorer''s braid\nIridescent violet gaze\nTraitor''s Glyph on shoulder\nSwirling iridescent aura\nPetite wiry build\nDark witch-explorer aesthetic","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Character Portrait establishes the current visual direction.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/68184520-5c4b-48e9-a93b-668149340e3b/portrait/1790356662790-ylva-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve Ylva''s youthful anime appearance, petite wiry build, olive-pale complexion, near-black braided hair, iridescent violet gaze, Traitor''s Glyph, dark witch-explorer clothing, ritual compass, and Umbral iridescence in future artwork.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/68184520-5c4b-48e9-a93b-668149340e3b/reference/1790356671135-ylva-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/68184520-5c4b-48e9-a93b-668149340e3b/alternate/1790356679144-ylva-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"14","era":"","name":"Ylva Morwenna de la Vega","race":"Witch","alias":"The Gilded Prisoner","gender":"Female","titles":"","subrace":"","summary":"A prodigious young witch and fugitive from Whisperingdale whose obsession with forbidden magical knowledge led her to Umbral Genesis. Ylva approaches magic as an unexplored system that can be mapped, calculated, and improved. After two years imprisoned in the Whispering Spire, she escaped with two boys her age and became the strategic anchor of their group.","heritage":"Spanish","homeland":"Whisperingdale","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"Ylvie\nLittle Cartographer","occupation":"Witch","affiliation":"Belladonna Coven","apparentAge":"14","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"Whisperingdale","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Ritual compass","strengths":"Exceptional intelligence\nStrategic planning\nMagical precision\nRitual optimization\nAura analysis\nThree-step spell planning","weaknesses":"Limited physical strength\nRequires preparation\nVulnerable when rushed\nPrecision-dependent casting","combatStyle":["Calculated","Ritualistic","Strategic","Predictive","Seal-based"],"limitations":["Longer cast time","Complex rituals require accuracy","Traitor''s Glyph dampens earth connection"],"powerSource":["Witchcraft","Belladonna magic","Umbral exposure","Ritualism"],"abilityNotes":"Umbral exposure permanently altered Ylva''s magical resonance. Her spells can occasionally flicker in ways that bypass conventional magical shielding. Her iridescent gaze allows her to perceive magical auras as structures or patterns that she interprets like code.","combatProfile":"Ylva avoids direct physical confrontation and instead controls encounters through preparation, positioning, seals, and calculated spell sequences. She habitually plans several magical actions ahead. Her Umbral mutation can cause spells to flicker unpredictably through conventional magical defenses, but disruption of her concentration can severely reduce her effectiveness.","weaponDetails":"Ylva uses a ritualistic compass as both a navigation instrument and magical focusing tool. It assists with geometric ritual construction, veil calculations, and precise magical positioning.","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Calculated Ritualism\nRitual Circle Construction\nSeal Magic\nUmbral Manipulation\nAura Perception","secondaryAbilities":"Magical Analysis\nRitual Optimization\nVeil Piercing\nMagical Cartography\nAura Reading","signatureTechniques":"The Weaver''s Math\nUmbral Flicker","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Petite","Lean","Wiry","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"5''1\" (155 cm)","makeup":"","weight":"102 lbs (46 kg)","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Iridescent violet"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Olive-pale"],"wardrobe":"Layered ritual clothing\nExplorer clothing\nLaced boots","hairColor":["Deep espresso","Near-black"],"hairStyle":"Practical explorer''s braid","accessories":"Ritual compass\nSpellbook\nUtility pouches\nMapping tools","faceDetails":["Youthful features","Sharp attentive gaze"],"hairTexture":["Thick","Slightly wavy"],"colorPalette":"Near-black\nDeep espresso\nIridescent violet\nUmbral purple\nAntique gold","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Near-black\nCharcoal\nUmbral purple\nAntique gold","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"A practical fusion of witchcraft and explorer aesthetics. Her clothing favors layered dark fabrics, durable boots, utility belts, ritual markings, and equipment for carrying books, mapping tools, and magical components.","appearanceNotes":"Her prolonged confinement left her naturally warm Mediterranean complexion noticeably pale. Umbral exposure causes faint iridescent flickers around her hair and aura. The Traitor''s Glyph remains permanently branded on her shoulder.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Woven cloth","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Stiff posture","Disciplined movement","Athletic grace"],"signatureOutfit":"Dark layered witch-explorer attire combining practical travel clothing with ritual garments, belts, pouches, occult detailing, and navigation-inspired accessories.","distinguishingFeatures":["Traitor''s Glyph","Swirling iridescent aura"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:41:17.011413+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:40.668434+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Permanent confinement","Loss of intellectual freedom"],"goals":["Decode Umbral Genesis","Understand the Between-Space","Complete her magical research"],"beliefs":["Magic can be mapped","Knowledge should be tested","Tradition requires proof","Magical limits can be surpassed"],"culture":["Belladonna Coven","Whisperingdale","Spanish seafaring heritage","Master explorer tradition"],"lineage":"Belladonna Coven and master explorer ancestry","storyArc":"Her story begins with intellectual rebellion and punishment for pursuing forbidden knowledge. Escape gives Ylva the freedom she wanted, but also forces her to confront the consequences of experimentation outside controlled conditions. Her connection to Umbral Genesis challenges her to determine whether knowledge should merely be discovered or also restrained.","backstory":"Ylva discovered the Vesper Ledger, a forbidden ancestral logbook containing coordinates connected to the Between-Space and Umbral Genesis. During a Blood Moon experiment, she pierced the veil and successfully captured Umbral energy, causing a powerful resonance throughout Whisperingdale. The experiment permanently mutated her aura. She was branded with the Traitor''s Glyph and imprisoned in the Whispering Spire for two years. At fourteen, two boys her age—one wielding voodoo power and another possessing Umbral Genesis—helped her escape, and she fled with them.","childhood":"Born to Chieftain Morwenna, Ylva showed an unusual fascination with geometry, stars, navigation, and magical structure. Rather than treating magic solely as a spiritual tradition, she approached it as an unexplored territory. By age nine, she was already correcting ancient ritual circles and improving their efficiency.","lifestyle":["Constant calculation","Magical research","Mapping","Ritual study","Strategic planning"],"storyRole":"Ylva serves as the intellectual and strategic anchor of her young fugitive group. Her knowledge of forbidden texts, ritualism, navigation, and Umbral phenomena allows her to interpret forces that her companions can wield but may not fully understand.","birthplace":"Whisperingdale","psychology":["Views magic as a system","Rejects unsupported tradition","Values intellectual freedom","Hides emotional vulnerability","Feels justified in her research"],"motivations":["Understand Umbral Genesis","Map unknown magic","Break magical limitations","Preserve intellectual freedom"],"personality":["Analytical","Calculated","Precise","Quietly defiant","Strategic","Blunt","Intellectually rebellious","Disciplined","Curious","Lonely"],"voiceSpeech":["Matter-of-fact","Precise","Blunt","Analytical"],"likesDislikes":["Ancient texts","Maps","Geometry","Stars","Magical research","Intellectual freedom","Dislikes unquestioned tradition","Dislikes confinement"],"majorLifeEvents":"Corrected ancient ritual circles\nDiscovered the Vesper Ledger\nResearched Umbral Genesis\nPierced the veil\nCaptured Umbral energy\nSuffered aura mutation\nBranded with the Traitor''s Glyph\nImprisoned in the Whispering Spire\nEscaped at age fourteen\nBecame a fugitive"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/68184520-5c4b-48e9-a93b-668149340e3b/portrait/1790356662790-ylva-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Chieftain Morwenna","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Whisperingdale\nWhispering Spire","relationshipNotes":"Ylva and Chieftain Morwenna share a painful bond shaped by love, law, and opposing philosophies of magic. Morwenna enforced Ylva''s imprisonment but later allowed the pursuit after her escape to remain deliberately weak. The Belladonna Coven elders fear Ylva''s magical development and regard her as a potential precursor to a new magical era."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"ec309b7f-d65a-4dca-af0b-846ed7318701","realm_record_id":"11533949-e0a1-4a62-aceb-25a09ba911da","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"0fede975-a6cd-4ec3-a649-6d2ed55c1863","faction_record_id":"7747ea2c-6d4f-4ff3-b0f3-c3cbda5ecd1a"},{"id":"b4f84058-548a-4ea6-ac43-f83d7cc7275e","name":"Kusa-No-Shin Durasurya","media":{"tbdFields":"Pronunciation\nName meaning\nBirth date\nSpoiler level\nNationality\nCurrent residence\nBirthplace\nParents\nSiblings\nPartner\nWeight\nDominant hand\nChildhood\nDetailed story arc\nSpecific fears\nAbility limitations","canonLocks":"Name: Kusa-No-Shin Durasurya\nAge: 28\nMale\nHe/Him\nDurskari and Sunspear heritage\nHeight: 6''2\"\nDeep bronze-ebony skin\nBlack textured locks\nMint and amethyst eyes\nAdaptive Flux\nEmerald Mirage Style\nVerdant Eclipse\nGrandmother Zu\nKaelen’s crew\nHealer role\nNine-Cloud Nirvana\nEmerald and plum color identity","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Character portrait and refined visual reference have been created. All future artwork should preserve established facial features, complexion, hair texture and style, lean build, emerald-and-plum clothing palette, dual-state eyes, Grandmother Zu, and Verdant Eclipse.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b4f84058-548a-4ea6-ac43-f83d7cc7275e/portrait/1790319871004-kusa-no-shin-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nFull-Body Front — Needed\nBack View — Needed\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Needed\nOutfit Breakdown — Needed\nWeapon Reference — Done\nExpression Sheet — Needed\nCombat Reference — Needed\nNine-Cloud Nirvana Reference — Needed\nGrandmother Zu Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Use the refined Kusa-No-Shin artwork as the primary visual direction. Maintain his deep bronze-ebony complexion, textured black locks with braided sides, lean athletic build, emerald-and-plum asymmetrical clothing, dual-colored eyes, Grandmother Zu, and Verdant Eclipse. Future production sheets should preserve the same facial structure and period-inspired fantasy design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b4f84058-548a-4ea6-ac43-f83d7cc7275e/reference/1790319878935-kus-no-shin-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b4f84058-548a-4ea6-ac43-f83d7cc7275e/alternate/1790319885670-kusa-no-shin-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"28","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired fantasy","name":"Kusa-No-Shin Durasurya","race":"Human","alias":"The Flickering Phantom","gender":"Male","titles":"The Flickering Phantom\nThe Emerald Vagabond\nThe Laughing Healer\nThe Keeper of Nine Clouds\nKaelen’s Greatest Headache","subrace":"Durskari-Sunspear","summary":"Kusa-No-Shin Durasurya is a mixed Durskari and Sunspear healer, smoke mage, and swordsman known as the Flickering Phantom. His Adaptive Flux shifts between energetic Sativa Flow, heavy Indica Stasis, and a balanced Hybrid state. Relaxed, compassionate, spiritual, and deceptively formidable, Kusa restores physical and emotional balance while serving as one of Kaelen’s most trusted companions.","heritage":"Durskari and Sunspear","homeland":"Umbral Empire","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"Kusa","occupation":"Healer, smoke mage, swordsman","affiliation":"Kaelen’s crew","apparentAge":"Late 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"TBD","nationality":"TBD","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"TBD","currentResidence":"TBD","elementalHeritage":"Adaptive Flux"},"abilities":{"weapons":"Verdant Eclipse — Chronic Katana\nGrandmother Zu — Zucca Gourd","strengths":"Battlefield control\nHealing support\nAdaptive combat\nSwordsmanship\nUnpredictable movement\nEmotional awareness\nPain management","weaknesses":"Easily distracted\nUnconventional focus","combatStyle":["Emerald Mirage Style","Durskari rhythm footwork","Sunspear sword forms","Adaptive smoke manipulation"],"limitations":["TBD"],"powerSource":["Adaptive Flux","Smoke magic","Spiritual energy"],"abilityNotes":"Emerald Reprieve suppresses pain and exhaustion temporarily rather than simply closing wounds. Soul Mulch converts negative emotional energy into restorative life force. Gentle Monsoon calms panic and helps restore clarity. His Adaptive Flux is also capable of helping suppress the effects of Kaelen’s Demon Blot.\n\nPreserve the contrast between Kusa’s goofy behavior and genuine spiritual wisdom. His relaxed personality should never erase his competence as a healer and swordsman.","combatProfile":"Kusa fights through constant shifts in tempo. Sativa Flow emphasizes speed and mental overstimulation, while Indica Stasis emphasizes heaviness and battlefield suppression. Hybrid Flux combines both states with deceptive movement, smoke clones, and sensory disruption. His healing techniques allow him to stabilize allies while remaining an active combatant.","weaponDetails":"Verdant Eclipse is an early curved tachi forged from Emerald Steel. Its hollow Dragon-Resin hilt functions as a pipe, while microscopic channels carry magical smoke through the blade. The sword becomes thin and green during Sativa Flow, heavier and violet during Indica Stasis, and semi-transparent with coiling smoke during Hybrid Flux. Grandmother Zu is an ancestral ceremonial gourd decorated with cowrie shells, sandalwood beads, emerald gemstones, and brass Sunspear etchings.","transformations":"Sativa Flow State\nIndica Stasis State\nBalanced Hybrid State\nNine-Cloud Nirvana — Garden of the Emerald Scale","primaryAbilities":"Sativa Flow\nIndica Stasis\nHybrid Flux\nSmoke manipulation\nRestorative balance\nTemporal anaesthesia","secondaryAbilities":"Pain suppression\nEmotional stabilization\nSmoke clones\nSensory disruption\nGravity-like suppression\nCerebral overstimulation","signatureTechniques":"Flux-Flicker Dash\nCouch-Lock Cloud\nGiggling Mist\nEmerald Reprieve\nSoul Mulch\nGentle Monsoon\nBreath of Flux\nNine-Cloud Nirvana","transformationDetails":"Sativa Flow turns both eyes luminous mint with vine-like pupils and emphasizes speed and cerebral energy. Indica Stasis turns both eyes deep violet while emphasizing heaviness and suppression. Balanced Hybrid State preserves one green and one purple eye. Nine-Cloud Nirvana transforms the battlefield into nine floating cloud platforms inhabited by Strain Spirits and manifests the Zenith Dragon."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Lean","Athletic"],"nails":["Natural"],"eyeHex":["#86E8B5","#9B72CF"],"height":"6''2\"","makeup":"","weight":"TBD","hairHex":["#171312"],"skinHex":["#6B3F2A","#A66A3F"],"eyeColor":["Mint green","Soft amethyst"],"grooming":"Neatly maintained braids and locks.","skinTone":["Deep bronze-ebony","Golden undertones"],"wardrobe":"Asymmetrical hitare-inspired robe\nLayered trousers\nBraided rope belt\nPeriod sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Braided sides with shoulder-length textured locks.","accessories":"Wooden hair beads\nCopper hair rings\nEmerald charms\nCowrie shells\nBeaded necklaces\nGrandmother Zu gourd","faceDetails":["Defined jawline","Relaxed expression","Half-lidded gaze","Lopsided grin"],"hairTexture":["Thick 4C coils","Springy textured locks"],"colorPalette":"Emerald green #2F6B4F\nMint #86E8B5\nDeep plum #4A235A\nAmethyst #9B72CF\nAntique gold #B58A45\nEbony #171312","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"Emerald green\nDeep plum\nBlack\nAntique gold\nNatural brown","alternateForm":["Sativa Flow State","Indica Stasis State","Balanced Hybrid State","Nine-Cloud Nirvana"],"clothingStyle":"Loose early-period fantasy garments blending Durskari and Sunspear influences. His clothing favors unrestricted movement, natural materials, asymmetry, and an emerald-and-plum visual split representing Adaptive Flux.","appearanceNotes":"His visual identity centers on duality. Emerald represents Sativa Flow and amethyst represents Indica Stasis. In Balanced State, one eye remains mint green and the other amethyst. His design should remain relaxed and approachable even when displaying dangerous magical power.","outfitMaterials":["Woven cloth","Braided rope","Leather","Wood","Copper","Brass"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed posture","Fluid movement","Unpredictable footwork"],"signatureOutfit":"An asymmetrical early-period hitare-inspired robe divided between emerald green and deep plum. A thick braided rope belt secures the layered garments, while Grandmother Zu hangs at his side. Sandals, beads, copper rings, emerald charms, and period-inspired accessories complete the wandering swordsman silhouette.","distinguishingFeatures":["Mint-green left eye","Amethyst right eye","Beaded textured locks","Green smoke wisps","Relaxed grin"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T06:50:40.496518+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T07:08:43.146966+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["TBD"],"goals":["Protect Kaelen’s crew","Maintain spiritual balance","Master Adaptive Flux"],"beliefs":["Strength requires peace","Peace requires strength","Balance requires both","Burden should be shared"],"culture":["Durskari","Sunspear"],"lineage":"Mixed Durskari and Sunspear ancestry.","storyArc":"TBD","backstory":"Kusa became known as the Flickering Phantom through his unusual mastery of Adaptive Flux, healing arts, smoke manipulation, and swordsmanship. His connection to the ancestral Zucca Gourd known as Grandmother Zu and his friendship with Kaelen are established parts of his identity. Further details of his early life remain TBD.","childhood":"TBD","lifestyle":["Talks to butterflies","Names rocks","Collects stray spirits","Meditates","Carries herbal supplies"],"storyRole":"Kusa serves as the healer and Adaptive Flux specialist of Kaelen’s crew. His seemingly unserious personality contrasts with his importance to the group, especially when Kaelen’s Demon Blot becomes unstable. He provides physical recovery, emotional grounding, battlefield control, and unpredictable tactical support.","birthplace":"TBD","psychology":["Values emotional balance","Highly empathetic","Observant beneath humor","Comfortable with silence"],"motivations":["Protect his companions","Restore balance","Ease suffering","Keep Kaelen grounded"],"personality":["Compassionate","Emotionally intelligent","Spiritual","Distractible","Goofy","Relaxed","Wise","Unpredictable","Supportive"],"voiceSpeech":["Relaxed speech","Playful observations","Spiritual metaphors","Casual humor","Calls others friend"],"likesDislikes":["Likes peaceful environments","Likes butterflies","Likes nature","Likes good vibes","Dislikes unnecessary tension"],"majorLifeEvents":"Inherited Grandmother Zu\nMastered Adaptive Flux\nJoined Kaelen’s crew\nBecame Kaelen’s trusted healer"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b4f84058-548a-4ea6-ac43-f83d7cc7275e/portrait/1790319871004-kusa-no-shin-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Kaelen — Trusted companion and crew leader","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"TBD","partner":"TBD","children":"","siblings":"TBD","worldConnections":"Umbral Empire\nDurskari heritage\nSunspear heritage\nKaelen’s crew","relationshipNotes":"Kusa is one of the people Kaelen trusts completely. Although his relaxed behavior frequently clashes with Kaelen’s structured tactical planning, Kusa understands him deeply. His Adaptive Flux helps prevent the Demon Blot affecting Kaelen’s arm from overwhelming him, and Kusa supports him without fear or judgment."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"c68d60d1-883a-4683-8000-a9cd9d0d4d2a","realm_record_id":"81dcaa1f-296e-4e34-98c5-c69907431fc7","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"c5625a0b-727b-4792-8128-f8aceb92186a","faction_record_id":"f5492e8b-d617-44b1-bce7-517c90d1da55"},{"id":"b6617db7-3178-4a31-bbc6-420bd1e8c605","name":"Xolani","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nExact age\nWeight\nDominant hand\nParents\nSiblings\nPartner\nExact current residence\nFormer mentor name","canonLocks":"Human male\n6''2\" height\nMahogany-charcoal brown skin\nLong black beaded locs\nBrown right eye\nMilky-white left Dead Eye\nCharcoal-grey veins around Dead Eye\nBorn in Kwaye-Zulu\nOriginates from Stone Mountains\nMvula bound to Dead Eye\nUses Asalato in combat\nCreated Dead Eye through forbidden binding\nBlack Rain occurred during Great Drought\nXolani lives as an exile\nMvula was forcibly bound","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Use the established Xolani production artwork as the primary visual continuity reference. Future portraits, combat artwork, album covers, and production assets should preserve his face, complexion, Dead Eye placement, locs, clothing silhouette, jewelry, and Asalato design.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b6617db7-3178-4a31-bbc6-420bd1e8c605/portrait/1790320005150-xolani-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Done\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nWeapon Reference — Done\nCombat Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain Xolani''s established dark anime-fantasy design across all future artwork. His mahogany-charcoal complexion, long beaded locs, lean 6''2\" silhouette, Dead Eye, charcoal veins, layered dark clothing, ritual jewelry, and Asalato are defining visual anchors. Mvula''s manifestations should appear as charcoal shadow, smoke, and ash rather than replacing Xolani''s own silhouette.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b6617db7-3178-4a31-bbc6-420bd1e8c605/reference/1790320018088-xolani-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b6617db7-3178-4a31-bbc6-420bd1e8c605/alternate/1790320022686-xolani-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"TBD","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired fantasy","name":"Xolani","race":"Human","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"The Vessel of Mvula\nThe Reluctant Vessel\nChronicler of Souls","subrace":"","summary":"Xolani is a spirit-bound mystic from Kwaye-Zulu in the Stone Mountains. After using a forbidden Binding Cadence to enslave the restless spirit Mvula during the Great Drought, he was cursed with the Dead Eye and forced to perceive the living and spirit worlds simultaneously. Now an exile, he uses his sacred Asalato and Crossroads magic to protect others while carrying the spiritual debt created by his mistake.","heritage":"Kwaye-Zulu","homeland":"Stone Mountains","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"","occupation":"Spirit-bound mystic","affiliation":"Kwaye-Zulu","apparentAge":"Adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"Peace","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"sho-LAH-nee","currentResidence":"Wandering exile","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Sacred Asalato","strengths":"Exceptional rhythm\nSpirit perception\nMental discipline\nPrecise coordination\nBattlefield control\nSpiritual resistance\nClose-range weapon skill","weaknesses":"Silence magic\nBroken rhythm\nSpiritual debt\nConsecrated ground\nSacred salt\nFlorida Water","combatStyle":["Rhythmic combat","Asalato striking","Spiritual disruption","Kinetic control","Short-range teleportation","Psychological warfare"],"limitations":["Magic depends on vibration","Missed rhythms cause backlash","Spirit invocation drains vitality","Mvula can sabotage movement","Cannot harm the truly innocent","13th Gate damages his senses"],"powerSource":["Crossroads spirit magic","Asalato rhythm","Mvula''s spiritual influence","Dead Eye"],"abilityNotes":"The swish of the Asalato sustains flow-based effects while the clack acts as a spiritual trigger. Xolani''s strongest techniques depend on uninterrupted timing. His Dead Eye allows direct perception of spirits and can expose others to the Grey Space through Eye-Lock.","combatProfile":"Xolani fights through rhythm rather than brute force. Continuous Asalato patterns control movement, summon spiritual interference, distort kinetic energy, and create openings for precise physical strikes. Mvula can either disrupt Xolani''s coordination or protect him from lethal attacks, making every battle a simultaneous struggle against the enemy and the spirit within him.","weaponDetails":"Xolani fights with paired Asalato, also known as Kashaka or shaker balls. Their swish sustains rhythmic magic while their clack releases or locks spiritual force. His combat set is reinforced for physical strikes and spiritually linked to Mvula.","transformations":"The 13th Gate state","primaryAbilities":"Rattling Call\nSoul-Clack\nPapa Legba''s Gate\nEye-Lock","secondaryAbilities":"Syncopated Stasis\nSpirit perception\nKinetic distortion\nSpectral summoning\nSpiritual binding","signatureTechniques":"Crossroads Cadence\nPolyrhythmic Paradox\nLateral Click — X-Snap\nThe Stillness\nThe 13th Gate","transformationDetails":"During The 13th Gate, Xolani breaks open his Asalato and spills their spirit dirt around himself, temporarily becoming a manifestation of the Crossroads. For roughly sixty seconds, his spiritual perception and temporal attacks become extreme. The technique leaves him temporarily blind and deaf afterward."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Wiry","Sinewy","Lean"],"nails":["Natural dark nails"],"eyeHex":["#4A2D1C","#E5E1D8"],"height":"6''2\" (188 cm)","makeup":"","weight":"TBD","hairHex":["#0B0908"],"skinHex":["#593A2D","#3E2A23"],"eyeColor":["Right eye — deep brown","Left eye — milky white"],"grooming":"Weathered but deliberate","skinTone":["Mahogany-charcoal brown"],"wardrobe":"Tattered cloak\nLayered wraps\nLoose trousers\nLeather footwear\nWeathered work clothing","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Long voluminous locs with beads","accessories":"Beaded necklaces\nRitual charms\nBone tokens\nMetal rings\nTobacco pouch\nSmall rum flask","faceDetails":["High sharp cheekbones","Straight nose","Strong elegant jawline"],"hairTexture":["Locs"],"colorPalette":"Charcoal black\nEarth brown\nAsh grey\nAntique bronze\nBone white","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"#0D0C0B\n#211B18\n#4A382B\n#8A6743\n#B9B0A2","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Practical Stone Mountains attire with dark layered fabrics, weathered materials, beadwork, ritual accessories, and an understated mystical silhouette suited to a wandering spirit practitioner.","appearanceNotes":"Xolani should appear striking and regal despite his exhausted, haunted presence. His right eye remains naturally brown while the left Dead Eye is completely milky-white and pupil-less. Fine charcoal-grey veins radiate from the left socket and become more pronounced when Mvula is active.","outfitMaterials":["Worn cloth","Leather","Canvas","Wood","Bone","Metal"],"postureMovement":[' WHERE id='6891a983-25e1-4ab7-8ffc-3516dd4bd09f';
UPDATE studio_backup_snapshots SET snapshot=snapshot||'"Predatory grace","Controlled movements","Rhythmic hand movement"],"signatureOutfit":"Layered dark ritual clothing with a weathered cloak, practical wraps, loose trousers, leather footwear, beadwork, necklaces, and subtle spiritual symbols. His clothing is worn and functional rather than ceremonial.","distinguishingFeatures":["Milky-white Dead Eye","Charcoal-grey eye veins","Scarred hands","Calloused palms","Ash-stained fingertips","Cold left hand","Long beaded locs"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T06:50:56.828975+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T07:08:45.164033+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing control to Mvula","Repeating his original mistake","Being pulled into the spirit realm","Mvula being forgotten","Breaking his rhythm in combat"],"goals":["Find spiritual peace","Atone for binding Mvula","Protect others from restless spirits","Keep Mvula from being forgotten"],"beliefs":["Every soul deserves remembrance","Spirits are not servants","Power creates responsibility","The dead deserve dignity","Peace requires accountability"],"culture":["Kwaye-Zulu","High Crossroads keepers","Rhythm-based spiritual tradition"],"lineage":"Kwaye-Zulu spiritual tradition","storyArc":"Xolani begins as a guilt-ridden exile enduring Mvula''s hatred as punishment for his past. Through remembrance, shared rituals, and stubborn compassion, their parasitic bond gradually develops into reluctant mutual recognition. His journey centers on accountability, remembrance, and discovering whether peace can exist without erasing what happened.","backstory":"During the Great Drought, Xolani became desperate to save his starving village. Against his master''s warnings, he climbed to the Altar of the Unburied and used a forbidden Binding Cadence to imprison the restless spirit Mvula within his Asalato. The ritual produced Black Rain and saved the village, but Mvula retaliated by spiritually overwriting Xolani''s left eye, creating the Dead Eye. Marked by the curse and ashamed of what he had done, Xolani left Kwaye-Zulu and became a wandering protector who works to repay his debt to the spirit world.","childhood":"Xolani grew up in Kwaye-Zulu, where rhythm was woven into birth, mourning, spiritual practice, and everyday life. He showed unusual sensitivity to spirits and became a talented apprentice in the village''s spiritual traditions.","lifestyle":["Wanders between settlements","Handles dangerous spirit problems","Practices rhythmic meditation","Carries ritual offerings","Keeps his Asalato nearby"],"storyRole":"Xolani serves as a bridge between the living and the forgotten dead. His abilities make him exceptionally dangerous against spiritual threats, while his relationship with Mvula forces him to confront the consequences of treating a suffering soul as a source of power.","birthplace":"Kwaye-Zulu, Stone Mountains","psychology":["Burdened by guilt","Spiritually exhausted","Highly self-controlled","Protective of forgotten souls","Resists Mvula''s influence"],"motivations":["Repay his spiritual debt","Protect the living","Remember forgotten souls","Preserve Mvula''s memory","Prevent similar mistakes"],"personality":["Stoic","Weary","Reserved","Compassionate","Remorseful","Protective","Disciplined","Observant","Stubborn"],"voiceSpeech":["Deep soulful baritone","Quiet delivery","Measured speech","Few words","Emotionally restrained"],"likesDislikes":["Likes rainfall","Likes natural beauty","Values quiet","Values remembrance","Dislikes spiritual exploitation","Dislikes arrogant magic"],"majorLifeEvents":"Born in Kwaye-Zulu\nTrained in spiritual rhythms\nGreat Drought strikes Kwaye-Zulu\nClimbs the Altar of the Unburied\nBinds Mvula against his will\nSummons the Black Rain\nReceives the Dead Eye curse\nLeaves Kwaye-Zulu in exile\nBecomes a wandering spirit protector\nDevelops The Stillness"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b6617db7-3178-4a31-bbc6-420bd1e8c605/portrait/1790320005150-xolani-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Mvula — Bound spirit and reluctant guardian\nSekani — Ally and musical counterpart","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"Kwaye-Zulu village elder — Former spiritual mentor","parents":"","partner":"TBD","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Stone Mountains\nKwaye-Zulu\nAltar of the Unburied\nHigh Crossroads\nGrey Space","relationshipNotes":"Xolani and Mvula began as jailer and captive after Xolani forcibly bound the spirit during the Great Drought. Mvula initially tormented and sabotaged him, but Xolani''s refusal to forget Mvula''s human life gradually changes their relationship. They remain spiritually fused, contentious, and emotionally complicated, with Mvula increasingly protecting the only living person who continues to remember him."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"c68d60d1-883a-4683-8000-a9cd9d0d4d2a","realm_record_id":"c6c8934d-b274-44f7-a1a6-a6f8f959654b","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"2ff89f94-94cb-4de0-a6a8-8b4e3925f455","faction_record_id":"cb4c27cc-2adb-4d75-92b0-a1cabfa13127"},{"id":"f1a92df4-a271-4f90-beb5-662c725b2661","name":"Mvula","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nExact age at death\nPronunciation\nName meaning\nHeight\nDominant hand\nParents\nSiblings\nChildhood\nExact appearance before death","canonLocks":"Male spirit\nFormer Stone Mountains scout\nOriginates from Kwaye-Zulu\nDied in a mountain crevice\nDenied final rites\nBecame a Ghede-Baka\nForcibly bound by Xolani\nTethered to Xolani''s Dead Eye\nCharcoal shadow manifestation\nWhite spirit-light eyes\nElongated spectral limbs\nFears being forgotten\nProtects Xolani reluctantly","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Use Mvula''s established portrait and full-body artwork as visual continuity references. Future artwork should preserve his charcoal-and-ash palette, spectral white eyes, gaunt silhouette, elongated fingers, smoky manifestation, and visual connection to Xolani''s Dead Eye.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/f1a92df4-a271-4f90-beb5-662c725b2661/portrait/1790321436461-mvula-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Needed\nAlternate / True Form — Needed\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Needed\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Needed\nEye Reference — Needed\nOutfit Breakdown — Needed\nExpression Sheet — Needed\nCombat Reference — Needed","productionNotes":"Mvula must remain visually connected to the established Xolani design without resembling Xolani himself. Preserve his emaciated charcoal spirit body, ash-grey fractures, white spirit-light eyes, elongated limbs, smoke-like edges, and remnants of practical Stone Mountains scout clothing. His design should communicate that he was once human before becoming a corrupted restless spirit.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/f1a92df4-a271-4f90-beb5-662c725b2661/reference/1790321444313-mvula-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":""},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"TBD","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired fantasy","name":"Mvula","race":"Restless Spirit","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"The Forgotten Scout\nThe Shadow of the Crevice\nThe Hunger Behind the Dead Eye","subrace":"Ghede-Baka","summary":"Mvula was once a scout of the Stone Mountains who died alone in a mountain crevice without receiving his final rites. Forgotten by the living, his abandoned spirit became a corrupted Ghede-Baka. During the Great Drought, Xolani forcibly bound Mvula through the Binding Cadence, creating a parasitic spiritual connection that ultimately tethered Mvula to Xolani''s Dead Eye.","heritage":"Kwaye-Zulu","homeland":"Stone Mountains","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"","occupation":"Former scout","affiliation":"Xolani","apparentAge":"Adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"TBD","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"TBD","currentResidence":"Spirit-bound to Xolani","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Spectral influence","strengths":"Spirit perception\nPsychological warfare\nSensory manipulation\nSpectral movement\nDefensive instinct\nIntimidation","weaknesses":"Sacred salt\nFlorida Water\nConsecrated ground\nRitual cleansing","combatStyle":["Psychological warfare","Spiritual disruption","Fear induction","Sensory attacks","Defensive intervention"],"limitations":["Bound to Xolani","Cannot freely leave the bond","Xolani''s survival affects him","Manifestation depends on spiritual influence"],"powerSource":["Restless spirit energy","Dead Eye bond","Grey Space","Spiritual connection to Xolani"],"abilityNotes":"Mvula''s Choking Miasma creates crushing grief and hopelessness around Xolani. His Echoing Scream causes the target''s spirit to recoil from the body. Through Eye-Lock and the Direct Feed, he can expose a target to the horrifying Grey Space perceived through Xolani''s Dead Eye.","combatProfile":"Mvula fights indirectly through Xolani and the surrounding spirit space. He overwhelms enemies with despair, spiritual screams, visions, and sensory distortion while manifesting spectral limbs to influence combat. Although he frequently sabotages Xolani, his survival is tied to his host, causing him to intervene when Xolani faces lethal danger.","weaponDetails":"Mvula does not rely on a conventional physical weapon. He attacks through spiritual pressure, sensory manipulation, spectral manifestations, and his connection to Xolani''s Dead Eye and Asalato.","transformations":"Partial manifestation\nFull spirit manifestation","primaryAbilities":"Choking Miasma\nEchoing Scream\nEye-Lock\nSpectral Manifestation","secondaryAbilities":"Sensory manipulation\nSpectral guidance\nMotor interference\nDeath visions\nSpirit perception","signatureTechniques":"Direct Feed\nSpectral Intervention\nRhythm Sabotage","transformationDetails":"Mvula usually exists as a shadow clinging to Xolani''s back or within the Dead Eye. When his influence intensifies, more of his emaciated charcoal form emerges through smoke and ash. His elongated arms can manifest around Xolani and mimic or interfere with his movements."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Emaciated","Elongated","Gaunt"],"nails":["Dark elongated nails"],"eyeHex":["#E9E8DF"],"height":"TBD","makeup":"","weight":"Weightless spirit","hairHex":["#11100F"],"skinHex":["#171615","#494642"],"eyeColor":["White spirit-light"],"grooming":"Spirit manifestation","skinTone":["Charcoal black","Ash grey"],"wardrobe":"Tattered scout clothing\nWeathered wraps\nShredded outer layers","hairColor":["Charcoal black"],"hairStyle":"Flowing shadow and drifting ash","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Hollow facial structure","Sunken cheeks","Gaunt jawline","Shadowed features"],"hairTexture":["Smoke-like","Shadow-like"],"colorPalette":"Charcoal black\nAsh grey\nBone white\nSmoke grey\nMoonlit silver","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"#11100F\n#292725\n#55514C\n#B8B5AD","alternateForm":["Partial shadow manifestation","Full spirit manifestation"],"clothingStyle":"Ruined Stone Mountains scout clothing fused into his spectral body. Clothing should appear ancient, practical, torn, and partially consumed by smoke.","appearanceNotes":"Mvula should remain recognizably humanoid while clearly supernatural. His silhouette is tall, thin, and unnerving, with charcoal smoke continuously peeling from his body. His elongated spectral arm frequently manifests over Xolani''s shoulder and mirrors Xolani''s Asalato movements.","outfitMaterials":["Tattered cloth","Weathered leather","Spectral smoke","Ash"],"postureMovement":["Predatory hovering","Unnatural stillness","Smoke-like movement","Clings behind Xolani"],"signatureOutfit":"Fragments of his former scout clothing remain within his manifestation as shredded, smoke-darkened layers that dissolve into ash and shadow. His silhouette should suggest the remains of a mountain scout rather than ornate ceremonial clothing.","distinguishingFeatures":["Charcoal smoke body","White spirit-light eyes","Elongated fingers","Emaciated arms","Ash-fractured form","Smoke-shrouded face","Unstable body edges"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T07:04:10.977435+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:35.039401+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Being forgotten","The Void of the Forgotten","Xolani dying","Losing his final connection to life"],"goals":["Remain remembered","Preserve his existence","Make Xolani understand his suffering"],"beliefs":["The forgotten suffer twice","Spirits should not be enslaved","Memory preserves existence"],"culture":["Kwaye-Zulu","Stone Mountains"],"lineage":"Kwaye-Zulu","storyArc":"Mvula begins consumed by hatred toward the man who enslaved him. He torments Xolani through visions, sensory manipulation, and attempts to sabotage his rhythm. Xolani''s refusal to erase Mvula''s humanity slowly changes their bond, and Mvula begins protecting the person he once wanted to destroy because Xolani has become the only living witness to who Mvula was.","backstory":"Mvula was a scout from the Stone Mountains who was left to die in a mountain crevice during a tribal war. Denied final rites and eventually forgotten, his spirit remained trapped in bitterness and grief until he became a corrupted Ghede-Baka. During the Great Drought, Xolani found Mvula and forcibly imprisoned him through the Binding Cadence to power a ritual that brought Black Rain to Kwaye-Zulu. Mvula retaliated by spiritually overwriting Xolani''s left eye, becoming permanently tethered to the Dead Eye.","childhood":"TBD","lifestyle":["Exists through Xolani''s Dead Eye","Observes the spirit world","Whispers to Xolani","Interferes with Xolani''s senses","Protects his host when threatened"],"storyRole":"Mvula is both Xolani''s tormentor and reluctant guardian. He embodies the consequences of Xolani''s forbidden ritual while giving a voice to the forgotten dead. His constant presence turns Xolani''s spiritual abilities into both a weapon and an ongoing punishment.","birthplace":"Kwaye-Zulu, Stone Mountains","psychology":["Terrified of being forgotten","Resents Xolani","Carries abandonment trauma","Emotionally dependent on Xolani","Hides concern behind hostility"],"motivations":["Avoid being forgotten","Preserve his existence","Punish Xolani","Protect his remaining connection","Have his life remembered"],"personality":["Bitter","Vindictive","Observant","Hostile","Sarcastic","Manipulative","Fearful","Protective","Lonely"],"voiceSpeech":["Distorted male whisper","Ancient tone","Bitter delivery","Sardonic speech","Low spectral voice"],"likesDislikes":["Loved the smell of rain","Notices mountain flowers","Hates being forgotten","Hates spiritual enslavement","Resents forced binding"],"majorLifeEvents":"Serves as a Stone Mountains scout\nAbandoned during tribal war\nDies alone in mountain crevice\nDenied final rites\nBecomes a Ghede-Baka\nEncountered by Xolani\nForcibly bound by Binding Cadence\nPowers the Black Rain ritual\nCreates Xolani''s Dead Eye\nBecomes tethered to Xolani\nBegins reluctantly protecting Xolani"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/f1a92df4-a271-4f90-beb5-662c725b2661/portrait/1790321436461-mvula-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Xolani — Host, former captor, and reluctant companion","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Xolani\nKwaye-Zulu\nStone Mountains\nGrey Space\nDead Eye\nAltar of the Unburied","relationshipNotes":"Mvula initially views Xolani as his jailer after being forcibly bound during the Great Drought. He tortures Xolani through visions, whispers, sensory overlap, and rhythm sabotage, yet protects him whenever death threatens them both. Xolani''s determination to remember Mvula as a man rather than a monster gradually transforms their relationship from pure hatred into reluctant mutual recognition."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"4b626524-5522-485d-b40f-6490debf9f06","realm_record_id":"c6c8934d-b274-44f7-a1a6-a6f8f959654b","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"7fe566b0-b4c5-4bef-8c77-0ab21b2a3ff4","faction_record_id":"e2b28b7d-4073-4cf3-b937-7090a913102c"},{"id":"6358b47b-ec0c-4027-b539-5334a350b2ff","name":"Count Vex","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/6358b47b-ec0c-4027-b539-5334a350b2ff/portrait/1790355157048-count-vex-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"","productionNotes":"","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/6358b47b-ec0c-4027-b539-5334a350b2ff/reference/1790355222664-count-vex-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/6358b47b-ec0c-4027-b539-5334a350b2ff/alternate/1790355291182-count-vex-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Late 30s to early 40s","era":"","name":"Count Vex","race":"","alias":"The Iron Smile","gender":"Male","titles":"Grand Inquisitor of Shadowfen","subrace":"","summary":"Count Vex is the Grand Inquisitor of Shadowfen, known as the Iron Smile. Refined, controlled, and intimidating, he carries himself like a judge who has already reached a verdict. His immaculate appearance and quiet authority make every encounter feel like a formal trial.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Grand Inquisitor","affiliation":"Shadowfen","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Shadowfen","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Ceremonial Rapier","strengths":"","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Dueling"],"limitations":"","powerSource":"","abilityNotes":"Mass Fear Projection creates an overwhelming sensation of judgment and guilt. Those affected describe the experience as feeling as though the world itself has decided they are guilty.","combatProfile":"Vex has the lean, athletic physique of a duelist rather than a brute. His known weapon is an ornate ceremonial rapier.","weaponDetails":"An ornate ceremonial rapier carried as part of Vex''s refined inquisitorial appearance.","transformations":"Mass Fear Projection State","primaryAbilities":"Mass Fear Projection","secondaryAbilities":"","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"When Mass Fear Projection activates, Vex''s pupils narrow into thin vertical slits and dark veins spread around his eyes."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Lean","Athletic","Duelist-built"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"6''3\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Pale steel gray"],"grooming":"Immaculate","skinTone":["Pale"],"wardrobe":"Military dress coats\nWhite gloves\nCrimson mantles","hairColor":["Dark silver","Platinum blond"],"hairStyle":"Perfectly slicked back","accessories":"White gloves\nShadowfen insignia","faceDetails":["Sharp aristocratic face","High cheekbones","Long nose","Narrow eyes","Cold smile"],"hairTexture":["Straight","Smooth"],"colorPalette":"Black\nSilver\nWhite\nCrimson","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nSilver\nWhite\nCrimson","alternateForm":["Mass Fear Projection State"],"clothingStyle":"Extremely refined military formalwear with aristocratic and ceremonial details.","appearanceNotes":"Vex treats his appearance as a weapon. His clothing, hair, posture, and grooming remain meticulously controlled because he considers imperfection a weakness. During Mass Fear Projection, his pupils become thin vertical slits and dark veins spread around his eyes.","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Controlled","Elegant","Deliberate"],"signatureOutfit":"Black military dress coat with silver embroidery, white gloves, and a long crimson mantle.","distinguishingFeatures":["Perpetually unimpressed expression","Immaculate grooming"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:44:05.635265+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:39.159928+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":["Imperfection equals weakness"],"culture":"","lineage":"","storyArc":"","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Meticulous grooming","Strict personal presentation"],"storyRole":"Grand Inquisitor of Shadowfen.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Views imperfection as weakness","Maintains strict self-control"],"motivations":"","personality":["Cold","Refined","Controlled","Judgmental","Intimidating","Aristocratic","Unimpressed"],"voiceSpeech":["Quiet","Controlled","Formal"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/6358b47b-ec0c-4027-b539-5334a350b2ff/portrait/1790355157048-count-vex-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":null,"realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":"74fb0163-f452-4f7e-a9ea-13c15bb960db"},{"id":"b2d998c0-1754-4a6a-af91-281d65ded816","name":"Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nBirthplace\nApparent age\nHeight\nWeight\nDominant hand\nNationality\nExact weaknesses\nExact power limitations\nFormal signature techniques\nPartner status\nFull story arc\nExact sovereignty structure of her children","canonLocks":"Name: Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá\nHuman title: Lady Lánhuá\nDivine title: Shuǐmǔ Tiān Hòu\nFemale\nAsian heritage\nPrimordial\nLiving embodiment of Water\nRules the Sunken Domain\nSunken Domain encompasses the world''s waters\nSunken Domain is not within Aethelgard\nMother of Rahim\nMother of Ife\nMother of Ruchika\nIgnis is father of Rahim and Ife\nTerrax is father of Ruchika\nIfe is the Steam Dragon\nRuchika is the Bone Dragon\nRahim is the Blood Dragon\nRahim is currently lost\nIfe lives with her father\nRuchika lives with his father\nIfe and Ruchika visit their mother\nTrue form is an Eastern-style aquatic leviathan","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Maintain exact visual continuity between her established portrait, human-form production sheet, dragon form, and dragon production sheet. Future artwork should preserve her face, black hair, ocean-blue eyes, imperial aquatic aesthetic, signature palette, and Eastern-style leviathan design.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b2d998c0-1754-4a6a-af91-281d65ded816/portrait/1790319597422-shu-m-l-nhu-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nDragon Production Sheet — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Done\nRight View — Done\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Done\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nExpression Sheet — Needed\nCombat Reference — Needed","productionNotes":"Use the established production sheet as the primary visual reference for Lánhuá. Her human design should remain elegant, ancient, and imperial with long black hair, ocean-blue eyes, ornate aquatic hairpieces, and layered blue ceremonial robes. Her dragon form must remain a colossal Eastern-style aquatic leviathan with an elongated serpentine body, iridescent blue-teal scales, luminous aquatic mane, and water-and-mist manifestations.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b2d998c0-1754-4a6a-af91-281d65ded816/reference/1790319612245-shu-m-l-nhu-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b2d998c0-1754-4a6a-af91-281d65ded816/alternate/1790319622886-shu-m-l-nhu-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Unknown","era":"Ancient","name":"Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá","race":"Primordial","alias":"Lady Lánhuá","gender":"Female","titles":"Shuǐmǔ Tiān Hòu\nHeavenly Empress, Mother of All Waters\nThe Splendid Orchid\nMother of All Waters","subrace":"Living Embodiment of Water","summary":"Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá is the ancient Primordial and living embodiment of Water itself. She does not merely command water; oceans, seas, ice, rain, mist, currents, and other natural forms of water are expressions of her primordial existence. Known among mortals as Lady Lánhuá, she rules the Sunken Domain, which encompasses the world''s waters rather than existing within Aethelgard. She is the mother of Rahim, Ife, and Ruchika.","heritage":"Asian","homeland":"Sunken Domain","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"","occupation":"Primordial Sovereign of Water","affiliation":"Sunken Domain","apparentAge":"TBD","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"The Splendid Orchid, Mother of Waters","nationality":"TBD","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"TBD","currentResidence":"Sunken Domain","elementalHeritage":"Primordial Water"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Elemental fluidity\nExtreme water pressure\nEnvironmental control\nAquatic dominion\nAncient primordial power","weaknesses":"TBD","combatStyle":["Fluid","Defensive","Environmental","Pressure-based","Large-scale elemental control"],"limitations":["TBD"],"powerSource":["Primordial Water","Living embodiment of Water"],"abilityNotes":"Her authority over water comes from being its primordial embodiment, not from conventional learned water magic. Exact limits and interactions with other Primordials remain TBD.\n\nDo not classify Lánhuá as a Dragon Primal who merely rules water. She is a Primordial and the living embodiment of Water itself.","combatProfile":"Lánhuá fights as an elemental force rather than a conventional warrior. She changes water between liquid, ice, mist, and highly compressed states while manipulating currents, pressure, and surrounding moisture. Her movements remain controlled and graceful until extreme anger causes her power to become devastatingly violent.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Human Form\nAbyssal Leviathan Form","primaryAbilities":"Absolute water manipulation\nPhase manipulation\nHydrostatic pressure manipulation\nIce manipulation\nMist manipulation\nRain manipulation\nCurrent manipulation\nAbyssal command","secondaryAbilities":"Water compression\nTemperature manipulation\nAquatic telepathy\nSea-life command\nAtmospheric moisture manipulation","signatureTechniques":"TBD","transformationDetails":"Lánhuá can manifest as a colossal Eastern-style aquatic dragon or sea serpent. Her elongated body carries iridescent midnight-blue, teal, and seafoam scales with a flowing bioluminescent mane. Rather than conventional leathery wings, her established dragon design can manifest immense wings formed from compressed water, mist, and atmospheric moisture."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Slender","Graceful","Regal"],"nails":["TBD"],"eyeHex":["TBD"],"height":"TBD","makeup":["Subtle","Elegant"],"weight":"TBD","hairHex":["#090D18"],"skinHex":["TBD"],"eyeColor":["Ocean blue"],"grooming":"Immaculate and imperial.","skinTone":["Fair"],"wardrobe":"Layered ceremonial robes\nImperial water-themed gowns\nFlowing silk garments","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Very long black hair styled with ornate water-themed hairpieces.","accessories":"Ice orchid hair ornaments\nOrnate hairpins\nWater-drop earrings\nDragon-scale necklace\nWater orb pendant\nJade ornaments","faceDetails":["Elegant features","Regal expression","Refined facial structure"],"hairTexture":["Straight","Silky"],"colorPalette":"Midnight blue #071A33\nDeep teal #07566B\nSeafoam #67C8C2\nTurquoise #46CFE0\nSilver #C8D5DF\nPearl white #EEF3F4","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"Midnight blue\nDeep teal\nTurquoise\nSilver\nPearl white","alternateForm":["Abyssal Leviathan","Eastern-style sea dragon"],"clothingStyle":"Regal 500–1300 AD-inspired Asian fantasy clothing with flowing silhouettes, layered silks, wave motifs, and refined ornamentation.","appearanceNotes":"Her human design should feel ancient, serene, elegant, and unmistakably connected to the ocean. Her clothing and hair should appear to move with subtle underwater fluidity even on land. Maintain the established midnight-blue, teal, turquoise, silver, and pearl palette across all artwork.","outfitMaterials":["Silk","Translucent silk","Fine embroidery"],"postureMovement":["Poised","Fluid","Controlled"],"signatureOutfit":"Flowing multi-layered imperial robes inspired by 500–1300 AD Asian dress, combining midnight blue, deep teal, silver, and translucent water-like layers. Fine wave and orchid motifs decorate the fabric.","distinguishingFeatures":["Ocean-blue eyes","Very long black hair","Water-themed hair ornaments","Regal presence"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T06:48:09.359491+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T08:15:14.874796+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["TBD"],"goals":["Protect the Sunken Domain","Preserve aquatic life","Safeguard her family"],"beliefs":["Water sustains life","Water must remain balanced"],"culture":["Ancient aquatic court","Asian-inspired imperial aesthetic"],"lineage":"Primordial embodiment of Water.","storyArc":"Her larger story arc remains TBD. Rahim''s disappearance creates an unresolved thread within her family, while Ife and Ruchika maintain connections to her domain despite residing with their fathers.","backstory":"Lánhuá is one of the ancient Primordials and the living embodiment of Water. Her sovereignty is not limited to a single ocean or continent; the Sunken Domain encompasses the waters of the world. Her unions with Ignis produced Rahim and Ife, while her union with Terrax produced Ruchika. Although Ife and Ruchika reside with their fathers, they remain connected to their mother''s domain and visit her. Rahim is currently lost, and his absence remains unresolved.","childhood":"TBD","lifestyle":["Rules the Sunken Domain","Oversees the waters of the world","Receives visits from her children"],"storyRole":"Lánhuá serves as the primordial embodiment of Water and sovereign of the Sunken Domain. Her existence connects the oceans, aquatic civilizations, and several elemental bloodlines through her children Rahim, Ife, and Ruchika.","birthplace":"TBD","psychology":["Emotionally restrained","Deeply maternal","Patient observer","Terrifying when enraged"],"motivations":["Protect her children","Preserve the waters","Maintain natural balance"],"personality":["Patient","Calm","Soft-spoken","Graceful","Observant","Maternal","Protective","Formidable"],"voiceSpeech":["Soft-spoken","Measured","Regal","Controlled"],"likesDislikes":["TBD"],"majorLifeEvents":"Union with Ignis\nBirth of Rahim\nBirth of Ife\nUnion with Terrax\nBirth of Ruchika\nRahim disappeared\nIfe resides with Ignis\nRuchika resides with Terrax"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b2d998c0-1754-4a6a-af91-281d65ded816/portrait/1790319597422-shu-m-l-nhu-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"TBD","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"Rahim — Son; Blood Dragon; child with Ignis; currently lost\nIfe — Daughter; Steam Dragon; child with Ignis; resides with her father and visits Lánhuá\nRuchika — Son; Bone Dragon; child with Terrax; resides with his father and visits Lánhuá","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Ignis — Father of Rahim and Ife\nTerrax — Father of Ruchika\nSunken Domain — Her primordial realm\nWorld waters — Her elemental existence","relationshipNotes":"Lánhuá is the mother of Rahim, Ife, and Ruchika. Rahim and Ife are her children with Ignis, while Ruchika is her child with Terrax. Ife and Ruchika live with their fathers but retain a connection and form of sovereignty within their mother''s waters and continue to visit her. Rahim remains lost; his established disappearance and story should not be overwritten."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f0c6ce62-f547-4fc2-8765-6a9f8bebc590","realm_record_id":"065f06b5-4812-4543-9430-02830d72ae0b","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"3e083a30-190f-4d2e-a61c-605c24c21769","faction_record_id":"9eabcca3-b901-4fdb-92da-03d6ab2a98c5"},{"id":"35fd725a-f7b0-45a0-acc8-61958469e015","name":"Nysera Sylvaris","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Pure Sylvani Elf\nStrong resemblance to Shailara\nAmber-brown left eye\nGlacial icy-blue right eye\nLong wild dark-brown hair\nMoss-green hair highlights\nLight bronze skin\nVine-like markings\nDark emerald marking glow\nBriarfang","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/35fd725a-f7b0-45a0-acc8-61958469e015/portrait/1790356295017-nysera-sylvaris-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve Nysera''s strong facial resemblance to Shailara while maintaining her fully Sylvani identity and wilder visual language. Her heterochromia, dark wild hair, moss-green highlights, light bronze skin, and vine-like markings are essential visual identifiers.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/35fd725a-f7b0-45a0-acc8-61958469e015/reference/1790356310666-nysera-sylvaris-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/35fd725a-f7b0-45a0-acc8-61958469e015/alternate/1790356321872-nysera-sylvaris-2-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Nysera Sylvaris","race":"Sylvani Elf","alias":"The Wild Root","gender":"Female","titles":"The Thornheart Elf\nThe Shadow of Eldoria\nKeeper of the Hollow Groves\nBeloved Sister of Shailara, The Living Mountain","subrace":"","summary":"Nysera Sylvaris is a pure Sylvani Elf known as the Wild Root and Keeper of the Hollow Groves. Where Shailara embodies calm growth and sheltering nature, Nysera represents nature''s untamed, darker will. Her chaotic temperament and forbidden-feeling Hollow Root magic make her both a troublesome presence and a potential guardian of Eldoria.","heritage":"Sylvani","homeland":"Eldoria","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Eldoria","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Briarfang","strengths":"Unpredictable combat\nEnvironmental control\nExceptional mobility\nImprovisation\nMagical energy draining\nAdaptive weapon use","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Wild","Chaotic","Improvised","Acrobatic","Feral"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["The Hollow Root","Sylvani nature magic"],"abilityNotes":"The Hollow Root governs the neglected and darker aspects of nature rather than conventional nurturing growth. Gravebloom causes black flowers to erupt from the ground and drain magical energy, with stronger opponents producing larger blooms. Thornshade Forest transforms the surrounding area into black trees, twisting roots, glowing fungi, and dark vines that obey Nysera.","combatProfile":"Nysera fights more like a feral woodland spirit than a Sylvani noble. She jumps, spins, climbs, and exploits the environment while using roots for sudden movement and unconventional attacks. Her unpredictability makes her difficult to read in battle.","weaponDetails":"Briarfang is a living weapon formed from enchanted black roots. It can transform between whip, spear, bow, and blade configurations according to Nysera''s needs and mood.","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Dead Forest Manipulation\nBlack Root Manipulation\nFungal Manipulation\nThorn Growth\nDecay Cycle Manipulation\nShadowed Vegetation Manipulation","secondaryAbilities":"Root Mobility\nRoot Slingshot Movement\nVegetation Command","signatureTechniques":"Gravebloom\nThornshade Forest","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":"","nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Amber-brown left eye","Glacial icy-blue right eye"],"grooming":"Wild and natural","skinTone":["Light bronze"],"wardrobe":"","hairColor":["Dark brown","Near-black undertones","Moss-green highlights"],"hairStyle":"Long, wild, usually unbrushed","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Elegant jawline","High cheekbones","Graceful Sylvani features"],"hairTexture":"","colorPalette":"Dark brown\nNear-black\nMoss green\nDark emerald\nAmber-brown\nIcy blue","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"","appearanceNotes":"Nysera strongly resembles Shailara, sharing the same elegant facial structure and graceful Sylvani features. Outsiders sometimes mistake them for twins or assume they share the same father, which secretly delights Nysera. Her moss-green hair streaks become visible in sunlight, while her vine-like markings glow dark emerald when she channels magic.","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Restless","Energetic","Acrobatic","Feral"],"signatureOutfit":"","distinguishingFeatures":["Heterochromia","Faint vine-like markings","Pointed Sylvani ears"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:47:28.813169+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:38.184706+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":["Decay is part of nature","Untamed nature deserves protection"],"culture":["Sylvani"],"lineage":"Pure Sylvani","storyArc":"","backstory":"Nysera inherited no Terrax blood and is entirely Sylvani. Despite this, her strong resemblance to Shailara frequently causes outsiders to assume the sisters share the same father. Her unusual connection to the darker cycles of nature distinguishes her from traditional Sylvani and leaves Eldoria''s elders divided over what she may become.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Climbs constantly","Explores wild places","Rarely sits still"],"storyRole":"Nysera serves as Eldoria''s unpredictable troublemaker and a possible future guardian. Her connection to neglected and feared aspects of nature challenges traditional Sylvani ideas about what natural magic should be.","birthplace":"Eldoria","psychology":["Idolizes Shailara","Constantly seeks stimulation","Enjoys pushing back","Intensely loyal"],"motivations":["Protect Shailara","Defend untamed nature","Follow her own instincts"],"personality":["Hyperactive","Feisty","Stubborn","Protective","Reckless","Talented","Argumentative","Distractible"],"voiceSpeech":["Energetic","Argumentative","Blunt"],"likesDislikes":["Collecting flowers Shailara touched","Sketching Shailara","Bragging about Shailara","Dislikes insults toward Shailara","Dislikes being told no"],"majorLifeE' WHERE id='6891a983-25e1-4ab7-8ffc-3516dd4bd09f';
UPDATE studio_backup_snapshots SET snapshot=snapshot||'vents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/35fd725a-f7b0-45a0-acc8-61958469e015/portrait/1790356295017-nysera-sylvaris-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Shailara","worldConnections":"Eldoria","relationshipNotes":"Nysera intensely adores and idolizes Shailara. She collects flowers Shailara has touched, keeps sketches of her, constantly brags about her, and readily starts fights when someone insults her. Shailara is one of the few people capable of calming Nysera down."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"76da8c54-5f55-4b33-b807-02e8eb74e869","realm_record_id":"291c05cb-0705-495d-95be-c6037453f9b4","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"00ba4f50-602d-4833-9eae-2ce8c18297e6","faction_record_id":null},{"id":"231f402f-3543-4506-a286-8bd29c6974e1","name":"Ezra","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Alias: The Sapphire Dragon\nLight caramel skin\nDruskari-African + Faelite-White heritage\nSapphire blue eyes\nBlack and silver-white hair\nSapphire blue primary palette\nLightning element\nFire + Air elemental heritage\nCrystalline dragon scales\nStorm-cloud dragon wings\nAnime visual style","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/231f402f-3543-4506-a286-8bd29c6974e1/portrait/1790356417100-ezra-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Use the established anime production-sheet design as Ezra''s primary visual reference. Human and dragon artwork should emphasize sapphire blue, stark white, silver, black, crystalline shapes, and electrical effects. His human appearance must retain his light caramel complexion and mixed Druskari-African and Faelite-White features.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/231f402f-3543-4506-a286-8bd29c6974e1/reference/1790356429322-ezra-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/231f402f-3543-4506-a286-8bd29c6974e1/alternate/1790356437345-ezra-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Ezra","race":"Elemental Dragon","alias":"The Sapphire Dragon","gender":"Male","titles":"Lightning Prince","subrace":"","summary":"Ezra, known as the Sapphire Dragon, is a Lightning Dragon born from the union of primal Fire and Air. Brilliant, volatile, and exceptionally fast, he embodies the friction between heat and atmosphere. He carries himself like a high-born prince and openly considers his speed, power, and lineage proof that he is destined for greatness.","heritage":"Druskari-African + Faelite-White","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":"Fire + Air"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Extreme speed\nExplosive offense\nAerial mobility\nRapid strikes\nElectrical paralysis\nPlasma attacks\nStorm manipulation","weaknesses":"Arrogance\nImpatience\nPoor defensive patience\nEasily provoked\nOverconfidence","combatStyle":["High-speed offense","Rapid-hit combat","Aerial combat","Hit-and-run attacks","Showboating","Electrical suppression"],"limitations":["Favors offense over defense","Can underestimate slower opponents"],"powerSource":["Primal Fire","Primal Air","Lightning"],"abilityNotes":"Ezra''s Lightning element results from the interaction of Fire and Air. He can manipulate electrical currents and plasma, create localized storms, electrify his claws, and generate enormous static charges. His movement can produce sonic cracks, and Lightning Shift allows brief transitions into electrical energy.","combatProfile":"Ezra fights through overwhelming speed and relentless offensive pressure. He circles opponents, attacks from rapidly changing angles, and uses electrical shocks to disrupt movement before delivering additional strikes. He prefers humiliating opponents through superior speed rather than patiently wearing them down.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Sapphire Dragon Form\nLightning Shift","primaryAbilities":"Lightning Manipulation\nElectrical Current Manipulation\nPlasma Manipulation\nLightning Generation\nStorm Generation","secondaryAbilities":"Extreme Speed\nElectrical Paralysis\nStatic Charge Generation\nAtmospheric Mobility\nEnergy Transformation","signatureTechniques":"Lightning Shift\nSonic Dash\nPlasma Burst\nElectrical Claws\nThunderstorm Summon","transformationDetails":"In Sapphire Dragon Form, Ezra becomes a sharp, aerodynamic dragon covered in brilliant electric-blue and stark-white crystalline scales. His anatomy favors jagged, streamlined shapes built for extreme aerial speed. Dark storm-cloud wings churn with internal lightning while electrical arcs continuously travel between his horns, spine, wings, and scales. Lightning Shift temporarily converts his body into electrical energy for near-instantaneous short-distance movement."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Lean-muscular","Athletic","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Sapphire Blue — #1261FF"],"height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #11131A","Silver-White — #E5E8F0"],"skinHex":["Light Caramel — #B98263"],"eyeColor":["Sapphire blue"],"grooming":"Immaculate","skinTone":["Light caramel"],"wardrobe":"Noble tunics\nLayered court attire\nElite champion armor\nLong coats\nArmored boots","hairColor":["Black","Silver-white"],"hairStyle":"Tousled two-tone hair","accessories":"Sapphire earrings\nDecorative chains\nSilver clasps\nArmored gauntlets","faceDetails":["Sharp jawline","Refined features","High cheekbones"],"hairTexture":["Thick","Wavy"],"colorPalette":"Sapphire Blue — #1261FF\nDeep Blue — #102B68\nMidnight Navy — #091426\nSilver — #C8CFDA\nStark White — #F4F5F7\nBlack — #11131A","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Sapphire blue\nDeep blue\nStark white\nSilver\nBlack","alternateForm":["Sapphire Dragon"],"clothingStyle":"Flashy high-born clothing inspired by early European court fashion and elite medieval champions. Ezra favors structured silhouettes, sweeping layers, luxurious detailing, and clothing designed to make his status immediately apparent.","appearanceNotes":"Ezra''s human design reflects his mixed Druskari-African and Faelite-White heritage. His light caramel complexion contrasts strongly with his sapphire, silver, white, and black palette. His overall appearance should remain handsome, sharp, aristocratic, and unmistakably confident.","outfitMaterials":["Fine woven fabric","Leather","Polished metal"],"postureMovement":["Confident","Regal","Quick","Explosive"],"signatureOutfit":"A high-born layered court ensemble combining sweeping noble tunics with fitted champion armor. Deep sapphire fabrics, stark white layers, silver detailing, structured shoulders, fitted gloves, and armored boots create a sharp princely silhouette.","distinguishingFeatures":["Split black and silver-white hair","Piercing gaze"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:43:35.075732+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:45.432239+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Being overshadowed","Being proven inferior"],"goals":["Become the dominant heir","Earn unmatched recognition"],"beliefs":["Speed determines victory","Power deserves recognition","He is the rightful heir"],"culture":"","lineage":"Primal Fire Dragon + Primal Air Dragon","storyArc":"Ezra begins convinced that his speed, lineage, and spectacular power place him above his siblings. His rivalries increasingly confront him with abilities that cannot simply be overwhelmed by moving faster, forcing his certainty about superiority to be challenged.","backstory":"Ezra was born from the elemental union of Ignis and Atherous. Fire supplied the heat and raw energy of his nature, while Air supplied atmospheric movement and extraordinary speed. Their combination manifested in Ezra as Lightning, producing one of the family''s fastest and most visually explosive elemental descendants.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Competitive","High-energy","Luxury-loving"],"storyRole":"Ezra serves as the brilliant family rival whose immense talent is complicated by pride and ambition. His competitive nature creates friction with siblings whose abilities challenge his belief that speed and overwhelming offense make him superior.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Massive ego","Craves recognition","Obsessed with superiority","Competitive with family","Equates speed with dominance"],"motivations":["Prove his superiority","Surpass his siblings","Claim personal glory","Honor his lineage"],"personality":["Arrogant","Loud","Proud","Competitive","Confident","Flashy","Ambitious","Easily insulted","Attention-seeking"],"voiceSpeech":["Confident","Boastful","Sharp","Provocative"],"likesDislikes":["Glory","Praise","Admiration","Speed","Competition","Luxury","Being underestimated","Losing","Slowness","Being ignored"],"majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/231f402f-3543-4506-a286-8bd29c6974e1/portrait/1790356417100-ezra-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"Ife","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Ignis\nAtherous","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Ife\nRahim\nGaius\nAsh","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":"Ezra constantly provokes Ife and is frustrated by the durability of her defensive abilities. He respects Rahim''s raw power but dislikes his chaotic brutality. He considers Gaius boring and overly quiet despite their shared connection through Atherous. Ezra treats Ash with cold disdain because of Ash''s mortal maternal lineage and views him as a blemish on Ignis''s bloodline, unaware of how dangerous Ash''s smothering magic could be to his electricity."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f6cff800-4029-4f02-b391-098583082feb","realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"a040ba80-3b84-4caf-b268-f0d59e8cbd2e","faction_record_id":null},{"id":"ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e","name":"Lord Alistar Vane","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Dark auburn hair\nCopper-gold eyes\nMessy tied-back hairstyle\nBroad muscular build\nStrong jaw\nSlightly crooked nose\nWarm smile\nForge goggles\nGolden kinetic runes","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Anime-style visual design established.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e/portrait/1790360559565-ailstar-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve his dark auburn tied-back hair, loose face-framing strands, copper-gold eyes, broad muscular build, forge goggles, leather harness, rolled sleeves, reinforced gloves, heavy forge boots, elegant outer coat, and golden kinetic rune effects.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e/reference/1790360575346-ailstar-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e/alternate/1790360586376-ailstar-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Mid 30s","era":"","name":"Lord Alistar Vane","race":"","alias":"The Architect of Tomorrow","gender":"Male","titles":"The Technical Forgemaster","subrace":"","summary":"A charismatic and brilliant technical forgemaster whose approachable personality contrasts sharply with the dangerous potential of his inventions. Alistar channels kinetic force through glowing golden runes and approaches creation with infectious enthusiasm.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Technical Forgemaster","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Technical brilliance\nForging expertise\nInventive engineering\nPhysical strength","weaknesses":"Underestimates invention hazards","combatStyle":"","limitations":"","powerSource":["Kinetic Imbuement"],"abilityNotes":"When Alistar channels kinetic power, golden runes ignite beneath his skin. Nearby tools vibrate, weapons hum, and the surrounding air crackles with restrained force.","combatProfile":"","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Kinetic Imbuement","secondaryAbilities":"Kinetic rune manifestation","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Broad-shouldered","Muscular arms"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"6''1\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Copper-gold"],"grooming":"Frequently forgets to brush his hair","skinTone":"","wardrobe":"Elegant coats\nRolled-sleeve shirts\nLeather harnesses\nReinforced gloves\nForge boots","hairColor":["Dark auburn"],"hairStyle":"Messy and usually tied back","accessories":"Forge goggles","faceDetails":["Strong jaw","Slightly crooked nose","Warm smile","Approachable expression"],"hairTexture":"","colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Noble attire blended with practical workshop clothing.","appearanceNotes":"His bright, intelligent eyes are constantly moving and analyzing. When excited, his copper-gold eyes appear to sparkle.","outfitMaterials":["Leather"],"postureMovement":"","signatureOutfit":"Rolled sleeves, leather harness, reinforced gloves, heavy forge boots, goggles around his neck, and an elegant coat over functional workshop gear.","distinguishingFeatures":["Loose face-framing strands"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:32:58.221955+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:27:15.710822+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":"","lineage":"","storyArc":"","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Forging","Inventing","Workshop experimentation"],"storyRole":"","birthplace":"","psychology":["Constantly analyzing","Excitable about inventions","Underestimates his creations'' danger"],"motivations":["Innovation","Creation"],"personality":["Charismatic","Friendly","Brilliant","Approachable","Enthusiastic","Inventive","Absent-minded"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":["Creating inventions","Technical experimentation"],"majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/ccc902c8-99ac-442c-b404-783996e7218e/portrait/1790360559565-ailstar-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":null,"realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":null},{"id":"e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735","name":"Venny''Macon","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Rich warm brown skin\nDeep brown eyes\nBlack 4c hair\nWild untamed hairstyle\nSturdy muscular build\nNatural linen tunic\nBraided leather waist cord\nLeather sandals\nWhite werepanther form\nSilver left shoulder patch","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Official visual references include the solo human portrait, human production sheet, and white werepanther production sheet.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735/portrait/1790360114514-venny-macon-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain the established anime design across future artwork. Human-form references establish his youthful face, warm brown skin, deep brown eyes, wild 4c hair, sturdy build, linen tunic, braided leather waist cord, and sandals. Werebeast references establish the large ghost-white werepanther design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735/reference/1790360121111-venny-macon-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735/alternate/1790360126417-venny-macon-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Venny''Macon","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"","subrace":"Werepanther","summary":"Venny''Macon is one of King Kaelo''s children and the mirror counterpart of Venny''Claire. Quiet and reserved, he possesses immense strength that he has yet to fully understand or embrace. His uncertainty contrasts with the tremendous potential sleeping within him.","heritage":"Dire Wolf lineage","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Immense physical strength\nHigh durability\nPowerful build\nHeightened senses","weaknesses":"Lack of confidence\nUnrefined power\nOccasional clumsiness","combatStyle":["Strength-based","Instinctive","Power-focused"],"limitations":["Untapped potential","Reluctance to use full strength"],"powerSource":["Werepanther heritage","Dire Wolf lineage"],"abilityNotes":"His greatest limitation is not a lack of power but his uncertainty about using it. Much of his strength remains dormant or restrained.","combatProfile":"Venny''Macon possesses tremendous physical potential but has not fully learned to control or trust it. His werepanther form favors raw strength, durability, and powerful movement rather than refined technique.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Sudo Form\nWhite Werepanther Form","primaryAbilities":"Werepanther Transformation\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Durability","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Senses\nEnhanced Speed\nEnhanced Agility","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Venny''Macon''s full werebeast form is a magnificent white werepanther with a ghostly white, subtly shimmering coat. He becomes substantially larger and more muscular than a typical panther. His only visible dire wolf trait is a silver patch of fur on his left shoulder. Despite his noble and powerful appearance, his movements can be slightly clumsy and his demeanor remains timid and uncertain."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Sturdy","Muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Deep brown"],"grooming":"Natural","skinTone":["Rich warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Knee-length tunic\nLeather sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Wild and untamed","accessories":"Braided leather waist cord","faceDetails":["High cheekbones","Small symmetrical nose","Youthful features"],"hairTexture":["4c","Dense"],"colorPalette":"Warm Brown\nBlack\nNatural Linen\nLeather Brown\nGhost White\nSilver","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Natural linen\nLeather brown","alternateForm":["White Werepanther","Sudo Form"],"clothingStyle":"Simple, practical clothing suited to the climate and active life of Moonwood Vail.","appearanceNotes":"Venny''Macon closely mirrors Venny''Claire in facial structure, complexion, eyes, and hair. He is slightly taller and sturdier than his sister, with greater visible muscular development.","outfitMaterials":["Woven linen","Leather"],"postureMovement":["Reserved posture","Powerful movement"],"signatureOutfit":"Simple knee-length woven linen tunic secured with a braided leather cord and worn with leather sandals.","distinguishingFeatures":["Large wide-set eyes"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:41:56.33402+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:27:18.065698+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["His own potential"],"goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"Dire Wolf and Werepanther","storyArc":"His arc follows the gradual awakening of his immense potential and his struggle to gain confidence in his own strength.","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Venny''Macon embodies the sleeping giant: immense natural power restrained by uncertainty and reluctance. His development centers on learning to understand and accept the strength already within him.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Unsure of his potential","Reluctant to embrace his power"],"motivations":"","personality":["Quiet","Reserved","Timid","Uncertain","Kind-hearted"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e229597e-305b-42fe-b232-1f78f3ac5735/portrait/1790360114514-venny-macon-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Venny''Macon and Venny''Claire are mirror counterparts in appearance and temperament. Their shared features emphasize their connection, while his reserved uncertainty contrasts with her playful confidence."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"bbe46246-e94b-498d-9ab5-cae88e0804f7","faction_record_id":null},{"id":"bc34fdb8-22a5-439b-8067-e5b670626b0f","name":"Shailara","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nAge\nHeight\nWeight\nBirthplace\nCurrent residence\nOccupation\nMother''s name","canonLocks":"Warm bronze-brown skin\nJade green eyes\nDark brown hair\nEmerald hair undertones\nPointed Sylvani ears\nLiving vines in hair\nNatural flowers in hair\nForest-green signature outfit\nEmerald crystal motifs\nLiving stone dragon form","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Established visual references include Shailara''s human portrait, Earth Dragon form, and full visual production sheet.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/bc34fdb8-22a5-439b-8067-e5b670626b0f/portrait/1790356221787-shailara-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve the established human and dragon designs. Her visual identity should consistently combine stone, emerald crystal, living vegetation, refined Sylvani elements, and Sunspear Indian heritage.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/bc34fdb8-22a5-439b-8067-e5b670626b0f/reference/1790356235758-shailara-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/bc34fdb8-22a5-439b-8067-e5b670626b0f/alternate/1790356241924-shailara-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Shailara","race":"Half Earth Dragon / Half Sylvani Elf","alias":"The Living Mountain","gender":"Female","titles":"The Living Mountain\nKeeper of the Emerald Vein","subrace":"","summary":"Shailara is the daughter of Terrax, an Earth Dragon of Sunspear Indian heritage, and a Sylvani Elf deeply connected to nature and traditional arcane magic. Known as the Living Mountain, she embodies a rare union of ancient stone and living nature. Her earth-dragon power manifests through the Emerald Vein, allowing stone, crystal, roots, and vegetation to exist as parts of the same living system.","heritage":"Indian + Sylvani Elf","homeland":"","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"Stone Blossom","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":"Earth + Sylvani"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Earth manipulation\nEnvironmental restoration\nDefensive durability\nTerrain control\nNature synergy","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Terrain control","Defensive combat","Environmental manipulation"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Earth Dragon heritage","Sylvani magic","Emerald Vein"],"abilityNotes":"The Emerald Vein unifies Shailara''s earth and Sylvani inheritances, allowing stone and plant life to function together. Her Lithobloom Core causes vegetation to grow naturally from her draconic body and allows her presence to encourage ecological renewal.","combatProfile":"Shailara reshapes the battlefield through stone, roots, crystals, and rapidly growing vegetation. Her fighting style emphasizes environmental control and defense rather than reckless aggression. In dragon form, her immense stone body provides exceptional physical durability.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Earth Dragon Form","primaryAbilities":"Stone Manipulation\nCrystal Manipulation\nPlant Manipulation\nRoot Manipulation\nLand Restoration","secondaryAbilities":"Accelerated Plant Growth\nCrystal Growth\nLiving Stone Creation\nEcosystem Restoration\nStone-to-Wood Transmutation","signatureTechniques":"Emerald Vein\nLithobloom Core","transformationDetails":"Shailara transforms into a colossal Earth Dragon resembling a living mountain. Her body is covered in layered stone scales with moss, vines, flowers, and emerald crystal formations growing naturally across her frame. Her wings resemble interlocking petrified leaves, stone structures, and crystal branches."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Graceful","Curvaceous"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Jade green"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Warm bronze-brown"],"wardrobe":"Sylvani gowns\nNature-inspired ceremonial attire","hairColor":["Dark brown","Emerald undertones"],"hairStyle":"Long and flowing","accessories":"Emerald forehead jewel\nEmerald earrings\nGold jewelry\nLiving floral ornaments","faceDetails":["Elegant features","High cheekbones","Pointed ears"],"hairTexture":["Thick","Wavy"],"colorPalette":"Granite Grey\nMoss Green\nJade\nEmerald\nOlive\nEarth Brown\nSoft Gold\nIvory\nBlossom Pink","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Forest green\nEmerald\nIvory\nSoft gold","alternateForm":["Earth Dragon Form"],"clothingStyle":"Elegant Sylvani clothing blending natural materials, botanical motifs, flowing fabrics, gemstones, and refined ornamentation.","appearanceNotes":"Her human form visibly blends Sunspear Indian and Sylvani features. Living vegetation naturally grows among her hair and clothing. Her dragon form resembles a living mountain composed of layered stone scales, vegetation, vines, flowers, and emerald crystal growths.","outfitMaterials":["Layered fabric","Living vines","Gold ornamentation","Emerald gemstones"],"postureMovement":["Graceful","Composed"],"signatureOutfit":"An elegant forest-green Sylvani gown with botanical detailing, soft flowing ivory fabric, gold ornamentation, emerald accents, and living vines woven naturally through the design.","distinguishingFeatures":["Living vines in hair","Natural flowers in hair","Pointed Sylvani ears"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:49:43.887688+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:43.971616+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":["Life can return","Stone can nurture growth"],"culture":["Sunspear","Sylvani"],"lineage":"Terrax + Sylvani Elf","storyArc":"","backstory":"Born from an Earth Dragon and a Sylvani Elf, Shailara inherited Terrax''s connection to stone alongside her mother''s affinity for nature and traditional arcane magic. These inheritances developed together rather than remaining separate, producing her unusual bond with living stone.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Nature-oriented"],"storyRole":"","birthplace":"","psychology":["Values renewal","Protective of nature","Emotionally grounded"],"motivations":["Protect living ecosystems","Restore damaged land","Preserve natural balance"],"personality":["Calm","Nurturing","Patient","Compassionate","Protective","Hopeful"],"voiceSpeech":["Calm","Measured","Gentle"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/bc34fdb8-22a5-439b-8067-e5b670626b0f/portrait/1790356221787-shailara-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Terrax","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Nysera","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":"Shailara and Nysera share the same Sylvani mother but have different fathers. Nysera is a full Sylvani Elf and is intensely devoted to Shailara."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"41d87f15-5819-4dbb-a9db-7abbdc65e92b","realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"e0563851-b12b-4a90-827f-5c38b92a4a58","faction_record_id":null},{"id":"e3ed8aa4-6a04-4790-9eff-6a0c06066e35","name":"Ife","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nExact chronological age\nWeight\nNationality\nPartner\nChildren\nNamed non-family allies\nNamed personal enemies","canonLocks":"Deep warm-brown skin\nCosmic pink eyes\nNatural black 4C hair\nLong decorated braids\nAthletic-curvaceous build\nSteam Rose signature color\nBronze and copper accessories\nBone Dragon Whip\nPink Steam Dragon true form\nIridescent wing membranes\nSteam and bubble magic","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Maintain visual continuity across all future artwork and 3D models. Pink should remain Ife''s dominant supernatural color, supported by bronze, copper, violet, pearl, and subtle iridescent blue.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e3ed8aa4-6a04-4790-9eff-6a0c06066e35/portrait/1790355886982-ife-character-portrait-2.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nBone Dragon Whip Reference — Done\nVRoid Turnaround Reference — Done\nBlender Model Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Use the established Reference / Production Sheet as the primary visual guide. Preserve Ife''s deep warm-brown complexion, cosmic pink eyes, long decorated 4C braids, athletic-curvaceous build, pink steam-woven clothing, bronze jewelry, and pink-centered elemental effects.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e3ed8aa4-6a04-4790-9eff-6a0c06066e35/reference/1790355900799-ife-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e3ed8aa4-6a04-4790-9eff-6a0c06066e35/alternate/1790355917413-ife-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Ife","race":"Dragon","alias":"The Pink Steam Dragon","gender":"Female","titles":"Daughter of Fire and Water\nProtector of the Scalding Gardens\nThe Steam-Born Guardian","subrace":"Steam Dragon","summary":"Ife is the Pink Steam Dragon, born from the union of Ignis and Leviathans. Fire and Water combine within her as Steam, giving her command over superheated vapor, pressure, condensation, and supernatural bubbles. Quiet and protective by nature, she specializes in defending others and controlling the battlefield.","heritage":"African + Asian","homeland":"Ignis Peaks","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"Pink Steam","occupation":"Elemental Guardian","affiliation":"Ignis Peaks","apparentAge":"Young adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"Love","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"EE-feh","currentResidence":"Moltenmaw Caverns","elementalHeritage":"Fire + Water"},"abilities":{"weapons":"Bone Dragon Whip","strengths":"Battlefield control\nDefensive versatility\nThermal resistance\nPressure manipulation\nEnvironmental adaptability\nWeapon synergy\nHigh elemental output\nProtective focus","weaknesses":"Extreme cold\nMoisture-depleted environments\nOverpressure\nProtective exploitation\nEmotional pressure","combatStyle":["Defensive zoning","Battlefield control","Mid-range whip combat","Containment","Counterattacking","Circular movement"],"limitations":["Steam requires elemental balance","Bubble durability is finite","Large bubbles consume more energy","Pressure releases can endanger allies","Large-scale techniques require concentration","Dragon form increases energy consumption"],"powerSource":["Primordial elemental bloodline","Fire","Water","Steam"],"abilityNotes":"Steam is Ife''s unique elemental identity rather than separate Fire and Water spellcasting. Fire manifests primarily as heat, Water as moisture and condensation, and their equilibrium produces Steam. Her bubbles act as supernatural pressure membranes capable of defense, containment, transportation, and storing extreme heat or pressure.","combatProfile":"Ife controls space through her Bone Dragon Whip, steam fields, reinforced bubbles, and pressure attacks. She prefers to contain threats, protect allies, and punish attempts to breach her defensive perimeter. Her fighting style becomes significantly more destructive when someone under her protection is threatened.","weaponDetails":"Ruchika crafted the Bone Dragon Whip from a replica of his own tail-bone structure. Its articulated bone segments are flexible, heat-resistant, self-repairing, and attuned to Ife. She can channel superheated steam through its internal structure for binding, striking, and pressure-based attacks.","transformations":"Pink Steam Dragon\nSteam Surge\nPressure-Crowned Dragon State","primaryAbilities":"Superheated Steam Generation\nSteam Manipulation\nBubble Sorcery\nThermal Pressure Manipulation\nExtreme Thermal Resistance\nElemental Condensation","secondaryAbilities":"Steam Veil\nHeat Shimmer\nBubble Platforms\nSteam Propulsion\nPressure Detection\nCondensation Tracking\nLava Encapsulation","signatureTechniques":"Steam Lash\nScalding Bind\nPressure Spike\nSteam Whip Cyclone\nBubble Prison\nGuardian Bubble\nPinkout\nScalding Garden\nLava Bloom\nScalding Veil","transformationDetails":"Ife''s true form is a massive deep rose-pink Steam Dragon with translucent underlayers, obsidian-edged markings, cosmic pink eyes, and iridescent bubble-film wing membranes. Her transformation is concealed within rapidly expanding steam as scales, claws, tail, and wings emerge. Pressure-Crowned Dragon State is a high-output state of her true form rather than a separate transformation."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Athletic","Curvaceous","Strong thighs","Defined shoulders","Hourglass proportions"],"nails":["Almond-shaped","Dusty rose","Deep rose accents","Pearl highlights"],"eyeHex":["Main Iris Pink — #E75C9A","Deep Iris — #8E285E","Light Iris Pink — #FF8FC5","Galaxy Violet — #9C68D7","Magical Glow — #FFD0EA","Outer Iris Ring — #6F204E","Hot-Pink Ring — #FF72B6","Pupil — #291224"],"height":"5''8\" / 173 cm","makeup":["Burnt rose blush","Deep plum eyeshadow","Rose mauve eyeshadow","Iridescent pink eyelids","Pearl-pink eye highlights","Black-plum eyeliner","Smoky burgundy lower lash","Deep berry-brown lip liner","Burnt rose lips","Bubble-pearl lip highlight"],"weight":"","hairHex":["Primary Hair — #171116","Warm Black — #24191D","Brown Highlight — #49302F","Pink Reflection — #8B405F"],"skinHex":["Deep Mahogany — #6B3B32","Warm Brown — #805044","Warm Highlight — #A96E5D","Bright Highlight — #C58B78","Shadow — #45241F","Deep Shadow — #2A1615"],"eyeColor":["Cosmic pink","Iridescent pink-violet"],"grooming":"Meticulous hair, skin, jewelry, and clothing care.","skinTone":["Deep warm brown","Reddish-mahogany undertone"],"wardrobe":"Ignis Peaks casual wear\nSunna resting attire\nCombat attire\nCeremonial attire\nSunken Dominion attire","hairColor":["Natural black"],"hairStyle":"Long decorated braids with a raised braided crown and bun.","accessories":"Bronze hoop earrings\nPink gemstone earrings\nForehead jewelry\nHead chains\nHair rings\nPink hair beads\nBronze braid cuffs\nLayered necklaces\nChoker\nUpper-arm cuffs\nBracelets\nWrist cuffs\nWaist chains\nDecorative belt\nHip chains\nAnklets\nPink gemstones","faceDetails":["Softly angular oval face","High cheekbones","Defined jawline","Full lips","Softly broad nose","Almond-shaped eyes","Thick natural eyebrows","Long dark eyelashes"],"hairTexture":["4C","Dense","Tightly coiled"],"colorPalette":"Deep Mahogany — #6B3B32\nWarm Brown — #805044\nDragon Black — #171116\nSteam Rose — #C77B91\nCosmic Pink — #E75C9A\nBubble Blush — #E5A7B8\nSteam Pearl — #F2CAD5\nPressure Rose — #87485F\nBubble Violet — #9C68D7\nBubble Blue — #82C9DF\nDragon Bronze — #9B633B\nMolten Copper — #B96E46\nSteam Gold — #D9A568\nVolcanic Black — #21191C","dominantHand":"Right","outfitColors":"Dusty Steam Pink — #C77B91\nLight Rose — #E5A7B8\nPearl Pink — #F2CAD5\nDeep Rose — #87485F\nWarm Cream — #E8D3C0\nBronze — #9B633B\nCopper — #B96E46\nGold — #D9A568\nPink Gemstone — #D9568D\nBubble Violet — #B894E8\nBubble Blue — #82C9DF","alternateForm":["Pink Steam Dragon"],"clothingStyle":"Flowing early-medieval fantasy attire influenced by African and Sahelian silhouettes. Draped fabrics, split panels, wrapped garments, metallic body jewelry, and translucent steam-woven textiles emphasize movement and bubble motifs.","appearanceNotes":"Ife''s design visually balances Fire and Water through warm skin, bronze metals, flowing fabrics, iridescence, moisture, and translucent bubble motifs. Pink is her dominant supernatural color. Her magical activity increases the visibility of steam, bubbles, iridescent markings, and heat distortion.","outfitMaterials":["Steam-woven alchemical silk","Translucent magical fibers","Bronze","Copper","Pink gemstones"],"postureMovement":["Upright","Composed","Fluid","Deliberate","Circular combat movement"],"signatureOutfit":"A wrapped pink upper garment with layered asymmetrical skirt panels, translucent steam-woven fabric, a decorated metallic belt, and bronze body jewelry.","distinguishingFeatures":' WHERE id='6891a983-25e1-4ab7-8ffc-3516dd4bd09f';
UPDATE studio_backup_snapshots SET snapshot=snapshot||'["Cosmic pink irises","Long decorated braids","Pink steam aura","Iridescent power markings","Heat shimmer"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:39:50.039916+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:44.588654+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Failing to protect loved ones","Losing family","Losing emotional control"],"goals":["Master Steam magic","Understand her dual heritage","Find answers about Rahim","Protect without controlling"],"beliefs":["Strength should protect","Opposing forces can coexist","Power requires purpose","Balance creates strength"],"culture":["Ignis Peaks","Sunken Dominion","Primordial Dragonkin"],"lineage":"Primordial Fire and Water bloodline","storyArc":"Ife''s arc explores the difference between protecting others and believing she is responsible for everything that happens to them. Rahim''s disappearance challenges her belief that sufficient strength can always keep family safe. Her eventual discovery of Ash further forces her to accept that she cannot protect someone from circumstances she never knew existed.","backstory":"Born to Ignis and Leviathans, Ife emerged as a natural equilibrium between Fire and Water. Rather than inheriting two separate elemental disciplines, their opposing forces fused within her as Steam. She grew into a protective fighter who favors containment and defense, later receiving the Bone Dragon Whip from Ruchika. Rahim''s disappearance remains an unresolved emotional wound, while the existence of Ash remains unknown to her.","childhood":"Ife grew up within Moltenmaw Caverns, where volcanic heat and lava were natural parts of everyday life. She developed a strong attachment to the Sunna and learned early that she could sleep beneath its molten surface. Her childhood training focused heavily on controlling the heat, moisture, and pressure generated by her Steam Dragon physiology.","lifestyle":["Lives in Moltenmaw Caverns","Sleeps beneath the Sunna","Maintains her braids","Maintains her weapon","Practices steam control","Trains with family","Enjoys solitude"],"storyRole":"Ife serves as an Elemental Guardian and relational bridge between multiple Primordial bloodlines. Her Fire and Water heritage places her near the center of the wider elemental family while her protective nature makes her a stabilizing presence during conflict.","birthplace":"Moltenmaw Caverns","psychology":["Protective instinct","Strong emotional restraint","Over-responsibility","Difficulty accepting protection","Need for stability"],"motivations":["Protect her family","Protect the vulnerable","Maintain balance"],"personality":["Warm","Reserved","Observant","Protective","Dependable","Patient","Practical","Family-oriented","Responsible","Quietly affectionate","Stubborn"],"voiceSpeech":["Warm medium-low voice","Measured speech","Direct wording","Dry humor","Quiet when angry"],"likesDislikes":["Likes extreme warmth","Likes hot springs","Likes steam","Likes rain on warm stone","Likes quiet mornings","Likes family gatherings","Likes routine","Likes jewelry","Likes bubbles","Likes swimming","Dislikes needless cruelty","Dislikes betrayal","Dislikes reckless endangerment","Dislikes unnecessary chaos","Dislikes bullying"],"majorLifeEvents":"Birth of the Pink Steam Dragon\nChildhood in Moltenmaw Caverns\nDiscovery of the Sunna\nMastery of Bubble Sorcery\nTraining under Ignis\nReceiving the Bone Dragon Whip\nRahim''s disappearance"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/e3ed8aa4-6a04-4790-9eff-6a0c06066e35/portrait/1790355886982-ife-character-portrait-2.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"Ezra","enemies":"","mentors":"Ignis\nLeviathans\nRuchika","parents":"Ignis\nLeviathans","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Rahim\nRuchika\nEzra\nAsh","worldConnections":"Ignis Peaks\nMoltenmaw Caverns\nSunken Dominion\nSunna","relationshipNotes":"Ife is deeply family-oriented and often assumes a protective role around those she loves. Rahim''s disappearance remains a major emotional wound. Ruchika created her Bone Dragon Whip, while Ezra shares a competitive sibling rivalry with her. Ife does not currently know that Ash exists."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"1ec72d01-822b-4992-9434-7772a6b4e474","realm_record_id":"97d4dc51-d1bf-4f80-9e77-3955ba9dad35","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"08d087d1-5f3c-4b76-9ee9-2917fe667bf1","faction_record_id":"406ddfbf-feab-4b20-9026-bd74b716fbda"},{"id":"56793a81-e4e6-48b9-a18a-28f6783ead66","name":"Ignis","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nApparent human age\nWeight\nDominant hand\nNationality\nBirthplace\nExact origin of primordial existence\nNamed signature techniques\nPersonal weapons\nSpecific weaknesses\nSpecific power limitations\nCurrent romantic status","canonLocks":"Ignis is male\nIgnis uses he/him pronouns\nIgnis is the primordial embodiment of Fire\nIgnis is not merely a dragon ruling fire\nIgnis rules Ignis Peaks\nIgnis resides in Moltenmaw Caverns\nHuman form is approximately 7 ft tall\nHuman skin is deep mahogany brown\nEyes are luminous winter grey\nHair is long black locs with fire-like tips\nIgnis has a neat goatee\nDragon form is predominantly black\nDragon scale seams glow dark crimson\nDragon scales appear to leak magma\nDragon eyes resemble the sun\nRahim is his eldest son\nRahim is the Blood Dragon\nIfe is his daughter\nIfe is the Steam Dragon\nEzra is his son\nEzra is the Lightning Dragon\nAshóNodia is his son\nAshóNodia is the Ash Dragon\nLeviathans is the mother of Rahim and Ife\nAetheros is the mother of Ezra\nHecate is the mother of AshóNodia\nRahim is missing","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Maintain strict visual continuity with the completed Ignis portrait, dragon design, and production sheet. Future images should use the same anime/fantasy character identity rather than redesigning him.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/56793a81-e4e6-48b9-a18a-28f6783ead66/portrait/1790318177179-ignis-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Done\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Needed","productionNotes":"Use the established production sheet as Ignis''s primary visual canon reference. Human and dragon artwork must preserve his established proportions, palette, facial identity, hair, and primordial aesthetic. His dragon form must remain an immense obsidian-black dragon with dark-crimson glowing scale seams, magma leakage, and sun-like eyes.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/56793a81-e4e6-48b9-a18a-28f6783ead66/reference/1790318348588-ignis-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/56793a81-e4e6-48b9-a18a-28f6783ead66/alternate/1790318419544-ignis-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Ancient","era":"Primordial Era","name":"Ignis","race":"Primordial","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"Primordial of Fire\nThe Living Flame\nThe First Burning\nThe Sovereign Pyre\nThe Fire Dragon","subrace":"Primordial Dragon","summary":"Ignis is the primordial living embodiment of Fire and sovereign of Ignis Peaks. His dragon form is the physical manifestation of his primordial nature rather than the source of his authority. Ancient, knowledgeable, noble, cocky, and intensely competitive, Ignis is fascinated by strength and constantly seeks opponents capable of giving him exhilarating battles. He fiercely protects his realm and people while encouraging strength through challenge.","heritage":"Primordial","homeland":"Ignis Peaks","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"","occupation":"Sovereign of Ignis Peaks","affiliation":"Ignis Peaks","apparentAge":"TBD","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"Fire","nationality":"TBD","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"IG-nis","currentResidence":"Moltenmaw Caverns, Ignis Peaks","elementalHeritage":"Primordial Fire"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Primordial power\nExtreme physical strength\nAncient combat experience\nFire mastery\nExceptional durability\nBattle intelligence\nDraconic power","weaknesses":"TBD","combatStyle":["Aggressive escalation","Close-quarters combat","Draconic combat","Power contests","Adaptive combat","High-output elemental combat"],"limitations":["TBD"],"powerSource":["Primordial Fire","Living embodiment of Fire"],"abilityNotes":"Ignis''s elemental authority originates from his primordial identity. Fire is not simply a learned magical discipline for him. His knowledge and combat experience are ancient, although his competitive personality often causes others to overlook his intelligence.\n\nIgnis must never be described merely as a dragon who controls fire. He is the primordial living embodiment of Fire; the Fire Dragon is one manifestation of that nature.","combatProfile":"Ignis fights because he genuinely enjoys testing strength. Against weaker opponents he may remain relaxed or deliberately limit himself. A powerful opponent causes him to progressively escalate, seeking the moment both combatants are forced to reveal everything they possess. He does not spare his children during their agreed combat competitions simply because they are family; their ability to challenge him is a source of pride.","weaponDetails":"TBD","transformations":"Primordial Fire Dragon Form","primaryAbilities":"Primordial fire manipulation\nFire generation\nHeat manipulation\nMagma manipulation\nDragon transformation\nPrimordial physical strength","secondaryAbilities":"Extreme fire resistance\nExtreme heat resistance\nDraconic flight\nPrimordial durability\nEnhanced senses","signatureTechniques":"TBD","transformationDetails":"Ignis transforms into an immense black dragon whose obsidian scales contain dim dark-crimson light between their seams. Molten magma appears to leak between portions of his scales, making his body resemble a living volcanic formation. His eyes burn with sun-like intensity. This form must remain predominantly black rather than becoming a conventional red fire dragon."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Muscular","Powerful"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["#C9D1D4"],"height":"7 ft","makeup":"","weight":"TBD","hairHex":["#090909","#E94B16"],"skinHex":["#5A2F24"],"eyeColor":["Luminous winter grey"],"grooming":"Immaculately maintained goatee and locs","skinTone":["Deep rich mahogany brown"],"wardrobe":"Regal battle attire\nPrimordial ceremonial attire","hairColor":["Black","Fire-colored tips"],"hairStyle":"Long black locs with flame-like tips","accessories":"Gold jewelry\nDraconic ornamentation","faceDetails":["Strong masculine features","Defined jawline","Serious expression"],"hairTexture":["Locs"],"colorPalette":"Obsidian black\nDark crimson\nMolten orange\nEmber red\nAntique gold","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"Obsidian black\nDark crimson\nMolten orange\nAntique gold","alternateForm":["Primordial Fire Dragon"],"clothingStyle":"Ancient fantasy warrior nobility with volcanic and draconic motifs appropriate to the 500–1300 AD-inspired Umbra World aesthetic.","appearanceNotes":"Ignis must consistently appear as a towering Black man with deep mahogany skin, luminous winter-grey eyes, long black locs with fire-like tips, a neat goatee, and a powerful muscular build. His expression is usually serious or mildly disinterested because of his nonchalant personality. His visual presence should communicate restrained primordial power rather than constant aggression.","outfitMaterials":["Dark leather","Heavy woven fabric","Metal ornamentation"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed confidence","Commanding stance","Unhurried movement"],"signatureOutfit":"Regal black fantasy attire suited to an ancient warrior-sovereign, accented with dark crimson, molten-fire details, and restrained gold ornamentation. The silhouette is imposing without appearing overly ceremonial.","distinguishingFeatures":["Luminous winter-grey eyes","Flame-tipped locs","Very neat goatee","Towering height"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T06:33:51.978753+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T08:17:18.986171+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["TBD"],"goals":["Remain worthy of his strength","Protect his primordial domain","Challenge powerful beings","Battle Rahim again"],"beliefs":["Strength must be tested","Defeat can create growth","Power should be proven","Challenges reveal character","Strength deserves respect"],"culture":["Ignis Peaks","Primordial culture","Warrior culture"],"lineage":"Primordial living embodiment of Fire","storyArc":"A major emotional thread surrounding Ignis is Rahim''s disappearance. Rahim was not merely his eldest son but one of the few beings capable of providing the kind of prolonged, exhilarating battle Ignis craves. Ignis continues challenging his children and other powerful beings, but the possibility of fighting Rahim again remains uniquely important to him.","backstory":"Ignis is an ancient primordial whose existence is intrinsically connected to Fire itself. He rules Ignis Peaks from Moltenmaw Caverns and protects the civilizations that exist within his primordial domain. His fascination with strength shaped both his rule and his relationship with his children. His battles with his eldest son Rahim were among the most exhilarating fights of his existence, making Rahim''s disappearance a deeply significant absence.","childhood":"TBD","lifestyle":["Rules from Moltenmaw Caverns","Hosts combat competitions","Trains through battle","Challenges his children","Protects Ignis Peaks"],"storyRole":"Ignis functions as the primordial embodiment of Fire, sovereign protector of Ignis Peaks, and father of several powerful elemental dragons. His overwhelming power contrasts with his casual personality and love of competition. His relationship with his children reveals both his warrior philosophy and his capacity for familial pride.","birthplace":"TBD","psychology":["Craves worthy competition","Thrives on escalation","Respects earned strength","Enjoys being challenged","Misses battling Rahim","Hides wisdom beneath bravado"],"motivations":["Experience worthy battles","Protect Ignis Peaks","Test his strength","Strengthen his children","Find exhilarating opponents"],"personality":["Nonchalant","Cocky","Competitive","Battle-loving","Noble","Knowledgeable","Protective","Self-assured","Playful in combat","Strength-driven"],"voiceSpeech":["Deep voice","Calm delivery","Understated trash talk","Short challenges","Rarely raises his voice"],"likesDislikes":["Likes powerful opponents","Likes difficult battles","Likes competition","Likes courageous challengers","Likes testing new techniques","Dislikes false strength","Dislikes cowardice","Dislikes unearned arrogance"],"majorLifeEvents":"Became sovereign of Ignis Peaks\nFathered Rahim with Leviathans\nFathered Ife with Leviathans\nFathered Ezra with Aetheros\nFathered AshóNodia with Hecate\nFrequently battled Rahim\nRahim disappeared\nContinued family combat competitions"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/56793a81-e4e6-48b9-a18a-28f6783ead66/portrait/1790318177179-ignis-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"Rahim — Son and treasured combat rival","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"TBD","children":"Rahim — Eldest son; Blood Dragon\nIfe — Daughter; Steam Dragon\nEzra — Son; Lightning Dragon\nAshóNodia — Son; Ash Dragon","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Ignis Peaks — Primordial domain\nMoltenmaw Caverns — Primary residence\nLeviathans — Mother of Rahim and Ife\nAetheros — Mother of Ezra\nHecate — Mother of AshóNodia\nCinderkin Elves — Protected people\nOrcs — Protected people\nGoblins — Protected people\nDragonborn — Protected people\nLizardfolk — Protected people\nFireborn — Protected beings","relationshipNotes":"Ignis expresses much of his affection through competition, training, and combat. Rahim, his eldest son with Leviathans, became an especially important combat partner because their battles could reach extraordinary levels of power. Ife also shares much of Ignis''s temperament and resides with him. Ezra primarily resides with his mother Aetheros but maintains a connection to his father''s domain. AshóNodia is Ignis''s son with Hecate and embodies Ash rather than conventional fire."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f0c6ce62-f547-4fc2-8765-6a9f8bebc590","realm_record_id":"97d4dc51-d1bf-4f80-9e77-3955ba9dad35","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"758ec32c-b7b2-441a-bc67-15bd2cdaae41","faction_record_id":"406ddfbf-feab-4b20-9026-bd74b716fbda"},{"id":"302f42c7-2c06-47de-a5ef-6d2940d026bf","name":"Terrax","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nExact age\nExact height\nExact weight\nDominant hand\nBirthplace\nName meaning\nNationality\nFormal partner status\nNamed allies\nNamed rivals\nNamed enemies\nNamed mentors\nSpecific weaknesses\nSpecific power limitations\nStory arc","canonLocks":"Terrax is male\nTerrax is Indian\nTerrax is the Primordial embodiment of Earth\nTerrax is not merely a Dragon Primal\nHis primordial truth is the Telluric Verity\nHis humanoid form is called Terrance\nRuchicka is his oldest child\nGaius is his Sand Dragon child\nShailara is his youngest child\nShailara is half Sylvani elf\nTerrax directly rules the land called Terrax\nStone Mountains is Terrax''s sanctuary\nTerrax is a stoner\nThe Heavy Grumble are devoted human followers\nIronspire Hold is independently governed\nEldoria is within Aethelgarud\nEldoria is the Sylvani homeland","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing artwork establishes both Terrance''s human appearance and Terrax''s colossal Earth Dragon form. The completed visual production sheet should be treated as the main design reference for future artwork.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/302f42c7-2c06-47de-a5ef-6d2940d026bf/portrait/1790318633853-terrax-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Done\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Needed\nHair Reference — Needed\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Needed","productionNotes":"Use the established production sheet as Terrax''s primary visual canon. Future human artwork should preserve his Indian features, warm brown skin, long black hair, powerful build, earth markings, dark green and earth-toned clothing, antique-gold detailing, jewelry, and ancient fantasy aesthetic. His dragon form must remain colossal, rocky, mountain-like, winged, and visibly connected to the Telluric Verity.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/302f42c7-2c06-47de-a5ef-6d2940d026bf/reference/1790318701593-terrax-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/302f42c7-2c06-47de-a5ef-6d2940d026bf/alternate/1790318762884-terrax-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Ancient","era":"Primordial","name":"Terrax","race":"Primordial","alias":"Terrance","gender":"Male","titles":"The Earth Primordial\nThe Earth Dragon\nThe First Stone\nThe Mountain Father\nThe One Who Remembers","subrace":"Earth Primordial","summary":"Terrax is the primordial embodiment of Earth and the living foundation of the physical world. His primordial truth, the Telluric Verity, embodies permanence, resilience, gravity, weight, and the memory held within the earth. He rules his own land called Terrax and considers the Stone Mountains a personal sanctuary where he can relax away from his responsibilities.","heritage":"Indian","homeland":"Terrax","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"","occupation":"Primordial embodiment of Earth","affiliation":"Terrax","apparentAge":"Adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"TBD","nationality":"TBD","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"TERR-aks","currentResidence":"Terrax","elementalHeritage":"Primordial Earth"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Immense physical strength\nExtreme durability\nPrimordial resilience\nGravity control\nEarth control\nMassive scale","weaknesses":"TBD","combatStyle":["Heavy","Grounded","Overwhelming force","Defensive","Terrain control"],"limitations":["TBD"],"powerSource":["Telluric Verity","Primordial Earth"],"abilityNotes":"The Telluric Verity is not ordinary earth magic. It is Terrax''s primordial truth governing permanence, resilience, gravity, physical weight, and the memory of the earth. Terrax is the living embodiment of Earth rather than a Dragon Primal who merely controls it.\n\nTerrax should not be treated as the political ruler of every civilization located on land. Ironspire Hold and Eldoria are independent of his rule. His direct territory is Terrax, while the Stone Mountains function primarily as his sanctuary.","combatProfile":"Terrax fights with the overwhelming weight and stability of the earth itself. His combat style favors immense force, resilience, gravity, terrain manipulation, and attacks capable of reshaping the battlefield. His movements may appear slow or deliberate compared with faster Primordials, but each action carries enormous physical weight.","weaponDetails":"No established signature weapon.","transformations":"Earth Dragon Form\nHuman Form","primaryAbilities":"Earth manipulation\nStone manipulation\nGravity manipulation\nTectonic manipulation\nTelluric Verity","secondaryAbilities":"Extreme resilience\nEarth sensing\nGeological awareness\nMountain-scale transformation","signatureTechniques":"Telluric Verity","transformationDetails":"Terrax can manifest as Terrance, his humanoid form, or reveal his true Earth Dragon form. His dragon form is mountain-sized, with colossal rocky scales resembling cliffs and mountain formations. His body should appear ancient enough that vegetation, moss, stone, and geological features can naturally form across portions of his scales."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":["Natural"],"eyeHex":["#8A6036"],"height":"TBD","makeup":"","weight":"TBD","hairHex":["#11100F"],"skinHex":["#70472F"],"eyeColor":["Earthy amber-brown"],"grooming":"Well-kept with a rugged natural appearance","skinTone":["Deep warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Layered robes\nLoose trousers\nDraped mantle\nLeather sandals\nOrnamental belts","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Long layered hair worn loose and partially pulled back","accessories":"Ornate earrings\nLayered necklaces\nStone rings\nMetal bracers\nDecorative belt\nGemstone ornaments","faceDetails":["Strong angular jaw","Defined cheekbones","Heavy brows","Straight nose"],"hairTexture":["Thick","Wavy"],"colorPalette":"Earth brown #70472F\nObsidian #171512\nForest green #263B2A\nAntique gold #A77A36\nStone gray #716B60","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"Forest green\nBlack\nEarth brown\nAntique gold\nStone gray","alternateForm":["Mountain-sized Earth Dragon"],"clothingStyle":"Ancient Indian-inspired fantasy clothing suited to the Umbra World''s 500–1300 AD-inspired aesthetic. His clothing should feel ancient, earthy, regal, practical, and connected to stone rather than resembling modern fashion.","appearanceNotes":"Terrance is Terrax''s humanoid form and should retain the same Indian appearance, long black hair, warm brown skin, earthy palette, gold accents, and ancient grounded presence established in his visual references. His design should communicate immense strength without making him look excessively armored.","outfitMaterials":["Woven cloth","Leather","Metal","Stone","Gemstone"],"postureMovement":["Grounded stance","Heavy deliberate movement","Relaxed posture"],"signatureOutfit":"Layered Indian-inspired fantasy robes with dark green draping, black and earth-brown fabrics, antique-gold embroidery, loose trousers, leather sandals, belts, jewelry, and stone-set ornaments.","distinguishingFeatures":["Golden earth markings","Forehead sigil","Long black hair","Ornate earrings","Earth-toned jewelry"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T06:43:53.695036+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T16:18:09.187254+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["TBD"],"goals":["Maintain the Telluric Verity","Protect Terrax","Preserve the physical world"],"beliefs":["Everything has weight","The earth remembers","Permanence has value","Resilience comes through endurance"],"culture":["Primordial","Indian-inspired"],"lineage":"Primordial embodiment of Earth","storyArc":"TBD","backstory":"Terrax is an ancient Primordial who embodies Earth itself rather than merely ruling the earth element. His existence is tied to the Telluric Verity, the cosmic truth of permanence, resilience, gravity, weight, and physical memory. He personally rules the land called Terrax while allowing unrelated human and nonhuman civilizations elsewhere to govern themselves.","childhood":"TBD","lifestyle":["Retreats to the Stone Mountains","Spends time with his children","Smokes to relax","Enjoys quiet natural spaces"],"storyRole":"Terrax serves as the Primordial embodiment of Earth and father of Ruchicka, Gaius, and Shailara. His existence establishes the metaphysical foundation of earth, stone, gravity, permanence, and physical memory within the Umbra World.","birthplace":"TBD","psychology":["Extremely patient","Values permanence","Difficult to provoke","Comfortable with silence"],"motivations":["Preserve the earth","Protect his children","Maintain natural stability"],"personality":["Calm","Grounded","Patient","Relaxed","Stoic","Independent"],"voiceSpeech":["Deep voice","Measured speech","Few unnecessary words","Heavy relaxed tone"],"likesDislikes":["Likes smoking","Likes mountains","Likes peace and quiet","Likes relaxing","Dislikes unnecessary disturbance"],"majorLifeEvents":"Became the living embodiment of Earth\nFathered Ruchicka with Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá\nFathered Gaius with Aetheros\nFathered Shailara with a Sylvani elf"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/302f42c7-2c06-47de-a5ef-6d2940d026bf/portrait/1790318633853-terrax-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"Ignis","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"TBD","children":"Ruchicka — Oldest child and Bone Dragon\nGaius — Sand Dragon\nShailara — Youngest child and half-Sylvani Stone Dragon","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá — Mother of Ruchicka\nAetheros — Mother of Gaius\nEldoria — Homeland of Shailara''s Sylvani family\nStone Mountains — Personal sanctuary\nHeavy Grumble — Devoted human followers\nIronspire Hold — Independent Duroc homeland","relationshipNotes":"Ruchicka is Terrax''s oldest child with Shuǐmǔ Lánhuá and lives primarily with Terrax while maintaining ties to his mother''s water domain. Gaius is Terrax''s child with Aetheros and lives with his father while maintaining ties to his mother''s air domain. Shailara is Terrax''s youngest child, born to a Sylvani elf; she lives with Terrax while remaining connected to her mother''s people in Eldoria."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f0c6ce62-f547-4fc2-8765-6a9f8bebc590","realm_record_id":"53d924ac-f33c-491b-a246-240d886c2de5","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"cc24abab-518b-4ef0-8cbe-dbea119ee873","faction_record_id":"0ba48458-c018-47e8-bfc0-bcfcd31aa531"},{"id":"7538e2ae-03cd-4c2f-a116-05e51b4fa245","name":"Ruchika","media":{"tbdFields":"Exact age\nBirth date\nExact birthplace\nExact weight\nDominant hand\nName meaning\nNationality\nRomantic partner\nPermanent enemies","canonLocks":"Ruchika is the Bone Dragon\nMale\nSon of Terrax and Leviathans\nEarth + Water heritage\nBrother of Gaius\nBrother of Ife\nBrother of Rahim\nLives in the Shifting Sands with Gaius\nRuchika is a wanderer\nRuchika is a master craftsman\nRuchika crafted Ife''s Bone Dragon Whip\nRuchika is not missing\nRuchika does not have memory loss\nTrue form uses an ivory bone exoskeleton\nDragon wings have water-like membranes","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Human and dragon references should preserve the same ivory, midnight blue, slate gray, earth brown, black, and golden amber palette.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7538e2ae-03cd-4c2f-a116-05e51b4fa245/portrait/1790317260638-ruchika-s-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Official character portrait — Needed\nFull-body front view — Needed\nBack view — Needed\nLeft view — Needed\nRight view — Needed\nFace reference — Needed\nHair reference — Needed\nOutfit breakdown — Needed\nBone weapon reference — Needed\nTrue Bone Dragon Form — Needed\nCombat reference — Needed\nBone Dragon Whip — Done","productionNotes":"Keep his silhouette tall and grounded. Bone should be modeled separately from skin and clothing so it can emerge, retract, break, and regenerate during animation.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7538e2ae-03cd-4c2f-a116-05e51b4fa245/reference/1790317393231-ruchika-s-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7538e2ae-03cd-4c2f-a116-05e51b4fa245/alternate/1790317539819-ruchika-s-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"TBD","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired fantasy era","name":"Ruchika","race":"Dragon","alias":"The Bone Dragon","gender":"Male","titles":"The Bone Dragon\nThe Ivory Artisan\nThe Wandering Craftsman","subrace":"Elemental Dragon","summary":"Ruchika is the Bone Dragon, born from Earth and Water. He is a disciplined craftsman, powerful defender, and natural wanderer who lives in the Shifting Sands with his brother Gaius.","heritage":"Indian + Asian","homeland":"Shifting Sands","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"Ruchi","occupation":"Master Craftsman and Wanderer","affiliation":"Terrax and Leviathans bloodline","apparentAge":"Young adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"TBD","nationality":"TBD","spoilerLevel":"Major","pronunciation":"Roo-chee-kah","currentResidence":"Shifting Sands","elementalHeritage":"Earth + Water"},"abilities":{"weapons":"Manifested bone blades\nBone spears\nBone shields\nBone gauntlets","strengths":"Extreme durability\nPowerful defense\nRapid regeneration\nVersatile weapon creation\nExcellent battlefield control\nHigh physical strength\nSkilled craftsmanship","weaknesses":"Large constructs require more energy\nRepeated regeneration causes fatigue\nExtreme damage can slow reconstruction\nProtective instincts can be exploited","combatStyle":["Defensive combat","Counterattacking","Close-range combat","Battlefield control","Adaptive weapon creation"],"limitations":["Bone creation consumes energy","Density increases require concentration","Large-scale regeneration is exhausting","Cannot endlessly create massive structures"],"powerSource":["Bone Magic","Earth lineage","Water lineage","Draconic power"],"abilityNotes":"His bone is a living synthesis of Earth minerals and Water-driven regeneration. Broken constructs can pull themselves back together when enough of his magic remains.\n\nRuchika is not missing and does not suffer from memory loss. Those story elements belong to Rahim.","combatProfile":"Ruchika fights like a moving fortress. He absorbs pressure, controls space with bone structures, and changes his weapons according to the opponent.","weaponDetails":"Ruchika normally creates weapons directly from living bone. He can alter their shape, weight, flexibility, and density during combat.","transformations":"True Bone Dragon Form\nPartial Bone Armor","primaryAbilities":"Skeletal Replication\nBone Generation\nBone Manipulation\nDensity Manipulation\nInstant Bone Mending\nBone Weapon Creation\nBone Armor Creation","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced durability\nEnhanced strength\nStructural awareness\nMineral sensing\nRapid bone regeneration\nHeat-resistant bone constructs","signatureTechniques":"Ivory Fortress\nSkeletal Bloom\nMarrow Forge\nBone Bastion\nIvory Lance\nLiving Arsenal","transformationDetails":"In his true form, Ruchika becomes a massive dragon covered in an ivory exoskeleton. Dark slate-blue skin shows beneath the armor, while translucent water-like membranes stretch between enormous bone wing digits."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Lean-muscular","Broad-shouldered","Athletic"],"nails":[{"hex":"#C89B83","name":"Natural"}],"eyeHex":[{"hex":"#D89B32","name":"Golden Amber"}],"height":"Approximately 6''3\" / 190 cm","makeup":"","weight":"TBD","hairHex":[{"hex":"#151218","name":"Black"}],"skinHex":[{"hex":"#9A6548","name":"Warm Medium Brown"}],"eyeColor":["Golden amber"],"grooming":"Clean and practical","skinTone":["Warm medium-brown"],"wardrobe":"Travel outfit\nCrafting outfit\nCombat outfit\nCeremonial attire","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Long layered hair worn loose","accessories":"Living bone bracers\nCrafting tools\nTravel satchel\nUtility belt","faceDetails":["Defined jawline","High cheekbones","Straight nose","Calm expression","Thick dark eyebrows"],"hairTexture":["Thick","Slightly wavy"],"colorPalette":"Ivory — #E8DFC8\nMidnight Blue — #182A3D\nSlate Gray — #4E5963\nEarth Brown — #654A3A\nGolden Amber — #D89B32\nBlack — #151218","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"Angrakha — Midnight Blue #182A3D\nDhoti — Charcoal #292A2D\nSash — Earth Brown #654A3A\nBone Bracers — Ivory #E8DFC8\nTrim — Muted Gold #B88A3D","alternateForm":["True Bone Dragon Form"],"clothingStyle":"Early-medieval Indian-inspired clothing with practical layered construction and bone accents.","appearanceNotes":"His design combines grounded Earth elements with subtle Water influence. Bone should always appear smooth, pale ivory, and organically grown rather than metallic.","outfitMaterials":["Woven cotton","Linen","Leather","Living bone"],"postureMovement":["Upright posture","Controlled movement","Heavy grounded stance","Quiet footsteps"],"signatureOutfit":"Dark layered angrakha with a wrapped dhoti, waist sash, living bone bracers, leather sandals, and practical crafting gear.","distinguishingFeatures":["Golden amber eyes","Long black hair","Living ivory bone","Bone can emerge from his body","Natural bone bracers"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T05:08:38.036685+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T16:19:45.097434+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Failing to protect family","Losing control of his creations","Seeing his work used irresponsibly"],"goals":["Perfect Bone craftsmanship","Discover rare materials","Protect Ife","Continue wandering","Preserve useful knowledge"],"beliefs":["Strength should have purpose","Creation is as important as destruction","Nothing strong is built carelessly","Freedom and responsibility can coexist"],"culture":["Terrax elemental traditions","Leviathans aquatic traditions","Shifting Sands culture","Wandering artisan traditions"],"lineage":"Son of Terrax and Leviathans","storyArc":"Ruchika begins as a self-contained wanderer focused on craft and family. His travels gradually pull him into wider conflicts where his ability to create and protect becomes increasingly important.","backstory":"Born from Earth and Water, Ruchika developed Bone as his unique elemental expression. Rather than pursuing destruction, he became a craftsman who uses his power to build, repair, protect, and create. He eventually made his home in the Shifting Sands with his brother Gaius, but his wandering nature keeps him traveling throughout the Umbral World.","childhood":"Ruchika grew up between two ancient elemental bloodlines. Terrax shaped his patience and structural thinking, while Leviathans influenced the adaptive and regenerative nature of his magic.","lifestyle":["Lives in the Shifting Sands","Frequently travels","Crafts weapons and tools","Studies natural materials","Explores ruins and distant lands"],"storyRole":"A wandering Bone Dragon and master craftsman based in the Shifting Sands. His travels allow him to appear across many regions of the Umbral World.","birthplace":"TBD","psychology":["Values stability","Shows love through actions","Needs personal freedom","Protective of family","Finds peace through craftsmanship"],"motivations":["Protect his family","Master his craft","Explore the Umbral World","Understand unusual materials","Create objects that endure"],"personality":["Calm","Disciplined","Patient","Protective","Observant","Independent","Reserved","Reliable"],"voiceSpeech":["Low calm voice","Measured speech","Rarely raises his voice","Prefers direct statements"],"likesDislikes":["Likes craftsmanship","Likes quiet places","Likes traveling","Likes durable materials","Likes learning new techniques","Dislikes waste","Dislikes reckless destruction","Dislikes unnecessary conflict"],"majorLifeEvents":"Born to Terrax and Leviathans\nAwakened Bone Dragon magic\nBecame a master craftsman\nSettled in the Shifting Sands with Gaius\nCrafted the Bone Dragon Whip for Ife\nBecame a frequent wanderer"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7538e2ae-03cd-4c2f-a116-05e51b4fa245/portrait/1790317260638-ruchika-s-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Gaius\nIfe\nTerrax\nLeviathans","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"Terrax — Earth and structural discipline\nLeviathans — Fluidity and regeneration","parents":"Terrax — Father\nLeviathans — Mother","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Gaius — Brother\nIfe — Sister\nRahim — Brother","worldConnections":"Shifting Sands — Home\nTerrax — Paternal connection\nSunken Dominion — Maternal connection\nUmbral World — Wandering territory","relationshipNotes":"Ruchika lives in the Shifting Sands with Gaius and shares a strong brotherly bond with him. He is especially protective of Ife and personally crafted the Bone Dragon Whip for her. Rahim''s disappearance remains a concern for the family."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"1ec72d01-822b-4992-9434-7772a6b4e474","realm_record_id":"48066562-cd1c-4b72-8c29-399594efad38","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"fc49b3d1-6cee-431a-8881-6a0873d53804","faction_record_id":"b17917f0-1e8d-4ecf-b622-61a143f39f32"},{"id":"eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478","name":"Venny''Claire","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Rich warm brown skin\nDeep brown eyes\nBlack 4c hair\nWild untamed hairstyle\nCompact agile build\nNatural linen dress\nBraided leather waist cord\nLayered jewelry\nLeather sandals\nBlack werepanther form\nSilver right hind leg patch","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Official visual references include the solo human portrait, human production sheet, and black werep' WHERE id='6891a983-25e1-4ab7-8ffc-3516dd4bd09f';
UPDATE studio_backup_snapshots SET snapshot=snapshot||'anther production sheet.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/portrait/1790359991558-venny-claire-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain the established anime design across future artwork. Human-form references establish her youthful face, warm brown skin, deep brown eyes, wild 4c hair, compact build, linen dress, layered jewelry, braided leather waist cord, and sandals. Werebeast references establish the sleek black werepanther design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/reference/1790359997049-venny-claire-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/alternate/1790360002404-venny-claire-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Venny''Claire","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Female","titles":"","subrace":"Werepanther","summary":"Venny''Claire is one of King Kaelo''s children and the mirror counterpart of Venny''Macon. Playful, carefree, and highly curious, she embraces movement and instinct with natural confidence. Her exceptional awareness and agility make her a swift, perceptive presence who treats the world around her as something to explore.","heritage":"Dire Wolf lineage","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Exceptional agility\nHigh speed\nHeightened awareness\nFast reflexes\nFluid movement\nAcrobatic mobility","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Agile","Acrobatic","Instinctive","Evasive","Speed-focused"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Werepanther heritage","Dire Wolf lineage"],"abilityNotes":"Her heightened senses provide a constant low-level stream of sensory information that guides her movements and gives her exceptional awareness of her surroundings.","combatProfile":"Venny''Claire relies on speed, agility, instinct, and constant sensory awareness rather than overwhelming physical force. Her compact werepanther form allows rapid directional changes, fluid evasive movement, and acrobatic attacks.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Sudo Form\nBlack Werepanther Form","primaryAbilities":"Werepanther Transformation\nEnhanced Agility\nEnhanced Speed\nHeightened Senses","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Awareness\nEnhanced Reflexes\nAcrobatic Movement\nStealth","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Venny''Claire''s full werebeast form is a sleek black werepanther with a deep, inky coat that seems to absorb light. Her smaller, compact body is built for speed, stealth, and acrobatic agility. Her only visible dire wolf trait is a silver patch of fur on her right hind leg. She moves with fluid grace and retains her playful curiosity and exceptional awareness."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Compact","Lean","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Deep brown"],"grooming":"Natural","skinTone":["Rich warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Sleeveless linen dress\nLeather sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Wild and untamed","accessories":"Braided leather waist cord\nLayered necklaces\nBeaded jewelry\nGold earrings\nGold bracelet","faceDetails":["High cheekbones","Small symmetrical nose","Youthful features"],"hairTexture":["4c","Dense"],"colorPalette":"Warm Brown\nBlack\nNatural Linen\nLeather Brown\nGold\nSilver","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Natural linen\nLeather brown\nGold","alternateForm":["Black Werepanther","Sudo Form"],"clothingStyle":"Light, practical clothing that allows unrestricted movement and suits the climate of Moonwood Vail.","appearanceNotes":"Venny''Claire closely mirrors Venny''Macon in facial structure, complexion, eyes, and hair. She is smaller and more compact than her brother, with a lighter frame suited to speed, agility, and acrobatic movement.","outfitMaterials":["Woven linen","Leather","Beads","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed posture","Fluid movement","Light-footed"],"signatureOutfit":"Simple sleeveless woven linen dress secured with a braided leather waist cord and worn with leather sandals.","distinguishingFeatures":["Large wide-set eyes"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:42:10.890987+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-26T02:37:12.238669+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"Dire Wolf and Werepanther","storyArc":"","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Venny''Claire represents instinct, curiosity, and freedom of movement. Her natural confidence and heightened awareness contrast with Venny''Macon''s uncertainty, making the twins mirrors in appearance but opposites in how they approach their abilities.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Highly instinctive","Constantly aware","Lives in the moment"],"motivations":["Exploration","Curiosity"],"personality":["Playful","Carefree","Curious","Unserious","Mischievous","Observant"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/eaaf8270-7b8d-4c38-99ee-3ac9d9b1b478/portrait/1790359991558-venny-claire-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nPeregrine\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Venny''Claire and Venny''Macon are mirror counterparts in appearance and temperament. Their shared features emphasize their connection, while her playful confidence and instinctive nature contrast with his reserved uncertainty."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"bbe46246-e94b-498d-9ab5-cae88e0804f7","faction_record_id":null},{"id":"c48e35c9-e98d-414c-afb7-ae85f99eb649","name":"Atherous","media":{"tbdFields":"Pronunciation\nName meaning\nBirth date\nExact age\nApparent age\nExact height\nExact weight\nDominant hand\nNationality\nBirthplace\nChildhood\nStory arc\nSpecific fears\nAbility weaknesses\nAbility limitations","canonLocks":"Atherous is female\nAtherous is Caucasian\nAtherous is a Primordial\nAtherous is the living embodiment of Air\nAtherous is not merely an Air Dragon ruler\nAtherous has silver hair\nAtherous is mother of Ezra\nIgnis is Ezra''s father\nAtherous is mother of Gaius\nTerrax is Gaius''s father\nEzra is the Lightning Dragon\nGaius is the Sand Dragon\nEzra lives primarily with Atherous\nGaius lives primarily with Terrax\nVeritas Volans is Atherous''s primordial truth\nThe Veiled Whisper governs vibration and frequency\nVoid Sky — The Eternal Horizon is an Atherous power\nEchoing Truth is Atherous''s Sonic Blade","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing visual references establish Atherous''s human form, Primordial Air Dragon form, production sheet, and Echoing Truth Sonic Blade. These designs should be treated as the visual continuity reference for future artwork.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/c48e35c9-e98d-414c-afb7-ae85f99eb649/portrait/1790319732526-aetheros-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Done\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nWeapon Reference — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain Atherous''s established anime/fantasy appearance across every future asset. Her human form uses long silver-white hair, fair porcelain skin, silver-blue eyes, an elegant slender build, flowing white-and-silver clothing, and frost-blue atmospheric effects. Her dragon form remains silver-white and luminous. Echoing Truth must retain its established silver-white sonic and atmospheric design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/c48e35c9-e98d-414c-afb7-ae85f99eb649/reference/1790319737660-aetheros-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/c48e35c9-e98d-414c-afb7-ae85f99eb649/alternate/1790319744447-aetheros-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Primordial","era":"Primordial Era","name":"Atherous","race":"Primordial","alias":"The Veiled Whisper","gender":"Female","titles":"The Veiled Whisper\nThe Eternal Horizon\nLiving Embodiment of Air","subrace":"God-Prime","summary":"Atherous is the primordial living embodiment of air. She does not simply rule wind or possess air magic; air itself is her elemental existence. Her authority encompasses wind, atmosphere, sound, vibration, frequency, vacuum, storms, flight, motion, and the unseen pathways connecting the world. Her primordial truth is Veritas Volans, the Law of Eternal Change.","heritage":"Caucasian","homeland":"Veylora","pronouns":"She / Her","birthDate":"TBD","nicknames":"","occupation":"Primordial Sovereign","affiliation":"Veylora","apparentAge":"TBD","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"TBD","nationality":"TBD","spoilerLevel":"TBD","pronunciation":"TBD","currentResidence":"Veylora","elementalHeritage":"Primordial Air"},"abilities":{"weapons":"Echoing Truth — Sonic Blade","strengths":"Extreme speed\nAtmospheric control\nLong-range attacks\nSound manipulation\nFrequency control\nAerial mobility\nVacuum creation","weaknesses":"TBD","combatStyle":["Extreme-speed combat","Sonic swordsmanship","Aerial combat","Precision strikes","Battlefield control"],"limitations":["TBD"],"powerSource":["Primordial Air","Veritas Volans","Veiled Whisper"],"abilityNotes":"The Veiled Whisper governs vibration and frequency rather than simple wind manipulation. Atherous can weaponize sound, create vacuums, alter atmospheric pressure, transmit whispers through air, and form sonic cutting forces. Her magic may sound like sharp whistles, cracking whips, or countless distant voices.\n\nAtherous must not be described as merely an Air Dragon who rules air. Her dragon form is a manifestation of her primordial nature; she is the living embodiment of Air itself.","combatProfile":"Atherous specializes in overwhelming speed, aerial mobility, atmospheric control, and precision attacks. Void Sky — The Eternal Horizon allows her movement to resemble teleportation as she slides through the horizon, while residual currents can remain behind as damaging after-images. Horizon Slice allows her to pass an opponent before the displaced air produces the actual cut.","weaponDetails":"Echoing Truth is Atherous''s signature Sonic Blade. It channels her authority over sound, vibration, frequency, and air into a sword capable of producing devastating frequency-based cuts. Its design uses silver-white and frost-blue atmospheric energy consistent with Atherous''s established visual identity.","transformations":"Primordial Air Dragon Form","primaryAbilities":"Atmospheric Command\nWind Manipulation\nStorm Manipulation\nSound Manipulation\nFrequency Manipulation\nVibration Manipulation\nVacuum Creation\nAtmospheric Pressure Control","secondaryAbilities":"Flight\nSonic Blades\nSound-Sight\nLong-Distance Whispering\nAir Removal\nExtreme-Speed Movement","signatureTechniques":"Void Sky — The Eternal Horizon\nThe Severing Current\nHorizon Slice\nThe Echoing Truth\nVacuum — The Absence of Breath","transformationDetails":"Atherous can manifest as a colossal silver-white air dragon with immense wings, an elongated draconic silhouette, luminous pale eyes, and atmospheric energy flowing around her body. The form should retain the same silver, white, and frost-blue palette as her human appearance."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Elegant","Slender"],"nails":["Pale silver"],"eyeHex":["#BFD8EA"],"height":"TBD","makeup":["Subtle cool-toned makeup"],"weight":"TBD","hairHex":["#E8EAF0","#F4F5F7"],"skinHex":["#F2E8E5"],"eyeColor":["Silver-blue"],"grooming":"Immaculate and ethereal","skinTone":["Fair porcelain"],"wardrobe":"Flowing ceremonial gowns\nAir-themed divine garments","hairColor":["Silver-white"],"hairStyle":"Extremely long flowing silver-white hair","accessories":"Silver headpiece\nCrystal ornaments\nSilver jewelry","faceDetails":["Elegant facial structure","High cheekbones","Delicate features"],"hairTexture":["Silky","Flowing"],"colorPalette":"Cloud white #F4F5F7\nSilver #C7CCD6\nFrost blue #BFD8EA\nSky blue #AFCDE3\nMoonlight pearl #E7E5ED","dominantHand":"TBD","outfitColors":"White\nSilver\nFrost blue","alternateForm":["Primordial Air Dragon"],"clothingStyle":"Ethereal fantasy regalia built around flowing layers, silver ornamentation, and lightweight materials that constantly react to surrounding air currents.","appearanceNotes":"Atherous should always appear exceptionally beautiful, ethereal, and nearly weightless. Her hair and clothing should appear affected by invisible currents even while she stands still. Her established visual identity is white, silver, frost blue, and luminous atmospheric effects.","outfitMaterials":["Flowing fabric","Translucent fabric","Silver ornamentation","Crystal accents"],"postureMovement":["Graceful","Weightless","Fluid"],"signatureOutfit":"A flowing white-and-silver fantasy gown with crystalline detailing, layered translucent fabrics, and long wind-swept elements. The silhouette remains elegant and otherworldly while fitting the fantasy identity of the Umbra World.","distinguishingFeatures":["Silver-white hair","Silver-blue eyes","Ethereal beauty","Wind-swept silhouette","White atmospheric aura"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T06:47:38.069587+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T16:17:16.362719+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["TBD"],"goals":["Uphold Veritas Volans"],"beliefs":["Nothing should be bound","Change is necessary","Air carries truth"],"culture":["Veyloran"],"lineage":"Primordial embodiment of Air","storyArc":"TBD","backstory":"Atherous is one of the primordial elemental beings of the Umbra World and embodies air itself rather than merely governing it. Her existence encompasses the atmosphere and its movement, allowing her presence to extend wherever air exists. Her primordial truth, Veritas Volans, represents freedom, motion, transition, and eternal change.","childhood":"TBD","lifestyle":["Exists throughout her atmospheric domain","Moves freely through Veylora"],"storyRole":"Atherous serves as the primordial embodiment of Air and sovereign presence of Veylora. Through her, the Umbra World''s wind, atmosphere, sound, vibration, vacuum, and atmospheric motion are connected to a single primordial source.","birthplace":"TBD","psychology":["Values freedom","Rejects stagnation","Embraces change"],"motivations":["Preserve freedom","Maintain atmospheric balance"],"personality":["Elusive","Free-spirited","Graceful","Calm","Independent"],"voiceSpeech":["Soft-spoken","Ethereal","Controlled"],"likesDislikes":["Values freedom","Values movement","Dislikes confinement"],"majorLifeEvents":"Became mother of Ezra with Ignis\nBecame mother of Gaius with Terrax"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/c48e35c9-e98d-414c-afb7-ae85f99eb649/portrait/1790319732526-aetheros-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Ignis — Father of Ezra\nTerrax — Father of Gaius","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"Ezra — Son with Ignis; Lightning Dragon\nGaius — Son with Terrax; Sand Dragon","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Veylora — Primordial domain\nIgnis — Ezra''s father\nTerrax — Gaius''s father\nEzra — Lightning Dragon son\nGaius — Sand Dragon son","relationshipNotes":"Ezra is the son of Atherous and Ignis and lives primarily with Atherous while retaining a sovereign connection to his father''s domain. Gaius is the son of Atherous and Terrax and lives primarily with Terrax while retaining a sovereign connection to his mother''s domain."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f0c6ce62-f547-4fc2-8765-6a9f8bebc590","realm_record_id":"fd4462c1-d940-4eb8-8105-5ff2b323bc99","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"b32427ed-0baf-457b-8c84-b0266dd31c76","faction_record_id":"efcdcdc6-0a8e-4713-8e49-fce93c606887"},{"id":"7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662","name":"AshóNodia","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nBirthplace\nHeight\nWeight\nDominant hand","canonLocks":"Age appearance 15–16\nSame loc hairstyle\nWarm brown skin\nEmerald green eyes\nRectangular pupils\nBlack layered clothing\nGreen witch magic\nAsh-based draconic power\nBlack Ash Dragon form","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing references establish Ash''s human, pseudo-dragon, and full Ash Dragon designs.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662/portrait/1790356618371-ash-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Use the established teenage production design as the primary reference. Ash should consistently appear approximately 15–16 years old. His magic visuals should emphasize black ash and green witch energy rather than conventional fire.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662/reference/1790356625725-ash-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662/alternate/1790356635134-ash-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"15–16","era":"","name":"AshóNodia","race":"Half Human + Half Dragon","alias":"Ashle","gender":"Male","titles":"The Ash Dragon\nThe Lost Son","subrace":"Dragonkin","summary":"AshóNodia is the hidden son of Ignis and Hecate. Raised under the name Ashle by his great-aunt, he inherited an unusual expression of his father''s draconic lineage: ash rather than conventional fire. His witch heritage allows him to magically ignite and manipulate that ash. Emotionally volatile and immensely powerful, Ash struggles with abandonment, belonging, and controlling abilities he was never properly taught to use.","heritage":"Duskari + Faelite","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"Ash","occupation":"","affiliation":"Kaelen''s Crew","apparentAge":"15–16","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":"Fire + Witch Magic"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Massive raw output\nArea control\nMagic disruption\nClose-range destruction\nDraconic durability\nAsh versatility","weaknesses":"Emotional instability\nPoor power control\nHigh collateral risk","combatStyle":["Aggressive","Instinctive","Area-of-effect","Close-range","Overwhelming force"],"limitations":["Does not naturally produce conventional fire","Power intensifies with emotion","Rampages impair judgment","Requires emotional regulation"],"powerSource":["Draconic blood","Hecate''s witch lineage","Ley-line magic"],"abilityNotes":"Despite being the son of Ignis, Ash does not display conventional fire-dragon properties. His inherited fire affinity manifests as ash, the residue of fire, rather than ordinary flame. Hecate''s witchcraft allows him to ignite the ash itself, producing burning enchanted ash without turning Ash into a conventional pyromancer.\n\nAshóNodia is his true name. His great-aunt gave him the everyday name Ashle, shortened to Ash.","combatProfile":"Ash fights through overwhelming pressure rather than refined technique. He floods the battlefield with ash, controls its movement through witchcraft, and can ignite it magically when attacking. His emotional state directly affects his control, making prolonged rage increasingly dangerous to allies and surroundings.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Pseudo Dragon Form\nAsh Dragon Form","primaryAbilities":"Ash Manipulation\nWitch-Ignited Ash\nFumemancy\nMagic Dampening","secondaryAbilities":"Smoke Manipulation\nSoot Manipulation\nEmber Manipulation\nAsh Solidification\nLey-Line Sensitivity\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Speed\nEnhanced Durability\nDraconic Senses","signatureTechniques":"Dragon''s Roar\nIncinerating Blast\nCinder Step\nVolcanic Burst\nAsh Cloud\nSilent Cinder Field","transformationDetails":"Ash''s pseudo form develops horns, black scales, claws, a tail, and increased draconic physical ability. His full dragon form becomes a massive black Ash Dragon surrounded by drifting ash and green witch energy. His draconic manifestation emphasizes ash rather than conventional flame."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Lean","Athletic"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Emerald green"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Hooded jackets\nDark fitted shirts\nUtility trousers\nCombat boots","hairColor":["Light brown"],"hairStyle":"Layered medium-length locs with loose face-framing strands","accessories":"Green pendant\nLayered necklaces\nUtility belts\nEar piercings","faceDetails":["Youthful angular face","Defined cheekbones"],"hairTexture":["Locs"],"colorPalette":"Black\nCharcoal\nAsh gray\nEmerald green\nEarth brown","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nCharcoal\nEmerald green","alternateForm":["Pseudo Dragon Form","Ash Dragon Form"],"clothingStyle":"Dark layered street-fantasy clothing built for movement and combat.","appearanceNotes":"Ash retains the same loc hairstyle throughout his human design. His hybrid form develops horns, claws, scales, and a tail while preserving his recognizable facial features. His dragon form is predominantly black with green witch-magic visible through portions of the scales.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Cloth","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Watchful","Tense","Explosive"],"signatureOutfit":"Black layered street-fantasy clothing with a hooded jacket, fitted shirt, utility belts, dark trousers, and strapped combat boots.","distinguishingFeatures":["Rectangular pupils","Green magical markings"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:42:50.553656+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:41.344973+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing control","Hurting his allies","Being abandoned"],"goals":["Master his ash magic","Learn the truth about his parents","Reconcile with Ignis"],"beliefs":"","culture":["Old Way of Witches"],"lineage":"Ignis and Hecate","storyArc":"Ash begins as an emotionally unstable youth who understands neither his heritage nor the nature of his unusual ash abilities. His journey gradually exposes the truth of Etaceh''s identity as Hecate, Rahim''s role in saving him, and Ignis''s belief that his son had died. His growth centers on mastering his power and discovering that his separation from his family was not abandonment.","backstory":"AshóNodia was born to Ignis and Hecate, who lived under the hidden identity Etaceh. Following Hecate''s death, Rahim was compelled by her final spell to carry the infant Ash to his great-aunt in Whisperingdale. Ignis was left believing his youngest son had been lost. Ash eventually encountered Kaelen''s crew, where his uncontrolled power made Ylva''s Tranquil Hymn essential for calming his violent magical surges.","childhood":"After Hecate''s death, Ash was carried to safety under the influence of her final protective spell and delivered to his great-aunt. She raised him as Ashle and taught him within a community that preserved Hecate''s ancient magical traditions. Ash grew up unaware that Etaceh, the mother he knew of, was actually Hecate.","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Ash serves as Kaelen''s volatile heavy hitter and as a living bridge between the Dragon God-Primals and Hecate''s ancient witch lineage. His hidden parentage connects the crew directly to Ignis, Whisperingdale, and the lost history of Hecate.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Abandonment wounds","Difficulty regulating anger","Fear of losing control","Strong need for belonging"],"motivations":["Protect his crew","Understand his origins","Control his power","Find belonging"],"personality":["Melancholy","Watchful","Quiet","Volatile","Protective","Loyal","Hot-tempered","Isolated"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Birth to Ignis and Hecate\nDeath of Hecate\nRescue by Rahim\nArrival in Whisperingdale\nRaised by great-aunt\nJoined Kaelen''s crew"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7afd3c82-379f-4f9a-8907-13eef84fe662/portrait/1790356618371-ash-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Kaelen\nYlva\nSax\nZafir","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Ignis\nHecate","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Rahim\nIfe\nEzra","worldConnections":"Ignis Peaks\nWhisperingdale\nUmbral Empire","relationshipNotes":"Ignis does not know what became of Ash after Hecate''s death. Hecate concealed her identity as Etaceh during her hidden life with Ignis. Rahim carried Ash to safety under Hecate''s final protective spell. Ash relies heavily on Ylva''s Tranquil Hymn when his emotional state overwhelms his control."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"d7fecdc3-89a1-49ab-8e00-3198d310e968","realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"1a437d0b-ed4f-49d2-8f8f-30c60eef7f74","faction_record_id":"f5492e8b-d617-44b1-bce7-517c90d1da55"},{"id":"7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4","name":"Rahim","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nAge\nHeight\nWeight\nCurrent residence\nCurrent whereabouts\nOccupation\nAffiliation","canonLocks":"Mixed Black and Asian heritage\nDeep warm-brown skin\nBlack hair\nCrimson eyes\nTall muscular build\nBlack and crimson palette\nBlood-crystal aesthetic\nObsidian-black dragon scales\nGlowing crimson dragon veins\nAnime visual style","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"The Reference / Production Sheet is the primary continuity reference for future Rahim artwork. Blood Dragon and blood-crystallization references establish his alternate-form visual language.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/portrait/1790356514399-rahim-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nBlood Crystallization Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Use the established anime production sheet as Rahim''s primary visual reference. Preserve his mixed Black and Asian facial identity, dark skin, black hair, crimson eyes, muscular build, black-and-crimson wardrobe, blood-crystal aesthetic, and established Blood Dragon design.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/reference/1790356521344-rahim-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/alternate/1790356526948-rahim-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Rahim","race":"Elemental Dragon","alias":"The Blood Dragon","gender":"Male","titles":"Crimson Blood Dragon","subrace":"Blood Dragon","summary":"Rahim is the firstborn Blood Dragon of Ignis and Leviathans. Fire and Water manifest through him as chaotic blood magic, allowing him to manipulate life force, weaponize blood, and crystallize it into devastating constructs. Battle-hungry and arrogant, he considers many less destructive elemental powers beneath his own.","heritage":"Black + Asian","homeland":"Ignis Peaks","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":"Fire + Water"},"abilities":{"weapons":"Blood-crystal weapons","strengths":"Extreme destructive power\nBattlefield control\nVersatile blood constructs\nLife-force absorption\nBlood-crystal durability\nAggression amplification","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Aggressive","Overwhelming","Close-range combat","Battlefield domination","Construct-based combat"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Fire","Water","Blood","Life force"],"abilityNotes":"Hemocrystal Dominion allows Rahim to condense manipulated blood into extremely hard crimson crystal for armor, weapons, spikes, and constructs. Bloodlust Amplification intensifies aggression and fighting spirit around him. Life-Force Siphon draws vitality from others, while Heart of the Battlefield allows spilled blood across a battlefield to become material for his constructs.","combatProfile":"Rahim thrives in prolonged, chaotic battles where blood and aggression are abundant. He combines direct physical combat with life-force manipulation, blood constructs, crystallized weapons, and large-scale battlefield control. His presence can intensify aggression around him, making an already violent conflict increasingly unstable.","weaponDetails":"Rahim crystallizes blood into blades, spears, shields, whips, armor, and other combat constructs. The weapons can be formed rapidly from manipulated blood and reshaped during battle.","transformations":"Blood Dragon Form\nCrimson Tyrant State","primaryAbilities":"Chaotic Blood Magic\nBlood Manipulation\nBlood Crystallization\nLife-Force Siphon\nBloodlust Amplification","secondaryAbilities":"Blood Construct Creation\nBlood-Crystal Armor\nBlood-Crystal Weaponry\nBlood-Crystal Regeneration","signatureTechniques":"Hemocrystal Dominion\nHeart of the Battlefield\nBlood Spear Storm","transformationDetails":"Rahim''s Blood Dragon Form has obsidian-black scales threaded with glowing crimson veins, scarlet eyes, blood-crystal structures, and wings formed through dark draconic tissue, blood mist, and crystal. In Crimson Tyrant State, blood crystallization spreads across his body as dense crimson armor, enlarging his horns, claws, spikes, and other natural weapons."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Crimson — #A20D1A"],"height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #111014"],"skinHex":["Deep Brown — #704936"],"eyeColor":["Crimson red"],"grooming":"Clean-shaven","skinTone":["Deep warm brown"],"wardrobe":"Long black coat\nDark trousers\nCombat boots","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Tousled medium-length hair","accessories":"Crimson pendant\nEarrings\nLayered chains\nRings","faceDetails":["Sharp jawline","High cheekbones","Strong brows"],"hairTexture":["Wavy","Thick"],"colorPalette":"Blood Crimson — #8A0712\nObsidian Black — #111014\nDeep Garnet — #5E101B\nMolten Scarlet — #D4232E","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nCrimson\nDark red\nMetallic silver","alternateForm":["Blood Dragon Form","Crimson Tyrant State"],"clothingStyle":"Dark, regal battlewear combining draconic ornamentation with a dangerous and aristocratic silhouette.","appearanceNotes":"Rahim''s human design reflects his Black paternal and Asian maternal heritage. His established visual identity uses black, crimson, and blood-crystal accents. His dragon form is covered in obsidian-black scales threaded with glowing crimson veins and increasingly develops crystalline structures as his blood crystallization intensifies.","outfitMaterials":["Dark fabric","Leather","Metal","Blood crystal"],"postureMovement":["Confident","Predatory","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"Black battle attire with crimson accents, an open chest, layered dark fabrics, metallic detailing, and blood-crystal ornamentation.","distinguishingFeatures":["Dragon markings","Blood-crystal formations"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T16:43:10.905895+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:22:42.183073+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":["Power should be fully expressed"],"culture":"","lineage":"Firstborn of Ignis and Leviathans","storyArc":"Rahim''s established history connects him directly to Ash''s survival. After carrying out Hecate''s protective spell and delivering Ash to safety, he vanished under circumstances tied to altered memories, leaving his family without clear knowledge of his fate.","backstory":"Rahim is the eldest child of Ignis and Leviathans, with Fire and Water manifesting through him as Blood rather than Steam. He later carried out Hecate''s protective memory spell and delivered the infant Ash safely to Hecate''s great-aunt. Rahim subsequently vanished, leaving his whereabouts unknown and his memories altered.","childhood":"Rahim was raised at Ignis Peaks and developed a strong combat bond with Ignis.","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Rahim is the volatile eldest sibling whose immense destructive potential contrasts sharply with the more controlled elemental expressions of his family. His disappearance and altered memories leave his current role unresolved.","birthplace":"Ignis Peaks","psychology":["Craves intense combat","Disdains weaker powers","Seeks powerful opponents"],"motivations":["Experience intense combat","Fully express his power"],"personality":["Battle-hungry","Chaotic","Arrogant","Destructive","Possessive"],"voiceSpeech":"","likesDislikes":["Likes battle","Likes powerful opponents","Dislikes restrained power"],"majorLifeEvents":"Raised at Ignis Peaks\nBonded with Ignis through combat\nProtected infant Ash\nDelivered Ash to Hecate''s great-aunt\nMemories altered\nDisappeared"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/7e07c96b-9f3f-495f-b7b5-1e14cc4875f4/portrait/1790356514399-rahim-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"Ignis\nLeviathans","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Ife\nEzra\nRuchika\nAsh","worldConnections":"Ignis Peaks","relationshipNotes":"Ife shares both parents with Rahim and manifests the same Fire and Water lineage as Steam rather than Blood. Rahim protected Ash as an infant and delivered Ash safely to Hecate''s great-aunt before disappearing."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f6cff800-4029-4f02-b391-098583082feb","realm_record_id":"97d4dc51-d1bf-4f80-9e77-3955ba9dad35","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"7f13ea09-709b-4aff-8d52-e65832afb12b","faction_record_id":null},{"id":"5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8","name":"Lord Corvin Sterling","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Warm amber eyes\nDark brown hair\nShort practical hairstyle\nThin build\n5''11\" height\nSoft jawline\nSlightly tired eyes\nThin lips\nPractical noble attire\nGlasses\nLeather gloves","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8/portrait/1790360678101-corvin-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"Anime-style visual design. Preserve his understated appearance, thin build, short dark brown hair, warm amber eyes, practical noble clothing, glasses, leather gloves, and Beast Tamer accessories.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8/reference/1790360695453-corvin-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8/alternate/1790360714190-corvin-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Mid to late 30s","era":"","name":"Lord Corvin Sterling","race":"","alias":"The Man Who Forgets Nothing","gender":"Male","titles":"Intelligence Master","subrace":"","summary":"An unassuming intelligence master whose perfect memory and exceptional observational skills make him quietly formidable. Corvin rarely commands attention; instead, he absorbs everything around him. His calm demeanor contrasts with the unsettling realization that he remembers nearly everything he sees and hears.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Intelligence Master","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Perfect recall\nExceptional observation\nBehavioral analysis\nAnimal affinity\nInformation retention","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":"","limitations":"","powerSource":"","abilityNotes":"Perfect Memory Recall allows Corvin to retain extraordinary amounts of observed and spoken information. His attention to microexpressions, inconsistencies, and breathing patterns makes even ordinary conversations valuable sources of intelligence. His Beast Tamer affinity creates an unusually strong rapport with animals.","combatProfile":"","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Perfect Memory Recall\nBeast Taming","secondaryAbilities":"Microexpression Reading\nBehavioral Observation\nInconsistency Detection\nBreathing Pattern Analysis","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Thin"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"5''11\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Warm amber"],"grooming":"Practical","skinTone":["Fair"],"wardrobe":"Practical noble attire\nLayered clothing\nTravel cloaks","hairColor":["Dark brown"],"hairStyle":"Short and practical","accessories":"Glasses\nLeather gloves\nWhistles\nCarved animal tokens","faceDetails":["Soft jawline","Slightly tired eyes","Thin lips","Understatedly handsome"],"hairTexture":"","colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Functional noble clothing designed for travel, observation, an' WHERE id='6891a983-25e1-4ab7-8ffc-3516dd4bd09f';
UPDATE studio_backup_snapshots SET snapshot=snapshot||'d discreet storage rather than display.","appearanceNotes":"Corvin looks surprisingly ordinary and does not naturally command attention. His warm eyes initially appear comforting, but prolonged eye contact becomes unsettling once his flawless recall and observational ability are understood.","outfitMaterials":["Leather"],"postureMovement":["Unassuming","Quiet","Observant"],"signatureOutfit":"Layered practical noble attire with a travel cloak, leather gloves, concealed pockets, and glasses when reviewing reports.","distinguishingFeatures":""},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:30:40.358267+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:27:13.755287+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":"","lineage":"","storyArc":"","backstory":"","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Corvin serves as an intelligence specialist whose extraordinary memory allows him to retain conversations, behaviors, inconsistencies, and subtle details others overlook.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Highly perceptive","Constantly observant","Detail-oriented"],"motivations":"","personality":["Calm","Reserved","Observant","Patient","Quiet","Analytical"],"voiceSpeech":["Soft-spoken","Controlled","Rarely raises his voice"],"likesDislikes":["Animals"],"majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/5de8dc77-a4f2-4117-8c92-105cfd9b2cd8/portrait/1790360678101-corvin-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":null,"realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":null},{"id":"74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d","name":"Silas","media":{"tbdFields":"Age\nWeight\nDominant hand\nBirth date\nParents'' names\nBrother''s name\nWife''s name\nDaughter''s name","canonLocks":"Human\nDeep ebony skin\nLilac eyes\nBlack 4C hair\nSubtle undercut\nFull beard\nThin connected mustache\nThick arched eyebrows\nVoodoo-style tattoos\n6''4\" height\nMuscular build\nBone adornments\nFeather adornments\nAnimal-hide clothing\nHumorous public persona\nGloomy private persona","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"The smiling Silas reference represents the protective persona he commonly presents around Sax. The darker full-body reference represents the grief, fury, and psychological instability beneath that persona.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d/portrait/1790360616164-silas-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nAlternate Mood Reference — Done\nSilas and Sax Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain the contrast between Silas''s public persona and his private emotional state. His familiar design should feel warm, charismatic, witty, and slightly mischievous. When the emotional mask drops, preserve the same face and design while replacing the smile with a dark blank stare, severe frown, visible rage, disorientation, and a gloomy aura.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d/reference/1790360624556-silas-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d/alternate/1790360632228-silas-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Silas","race":"Human","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"Grand Voodoo Priest","subrace":"","summary":"Silas is the Grand Voodoo Priest of Moonwood Vail and a master of ancestral magic, spiritual crossroads, and curse-weaving. Beneath his witty, carefree persona is a deeply wounded survivor whose family was slaughtered during Captain Blackheart''s pirate raid. He raises and trains his surviving nephew, Sax, while guarding the balance between the physical and spiritual realms. He later becomes a mentor to Kaelen, teaching him spiritual grounding techniques capable of stabilizing Umbral Genesis.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Grand Voodoo Priest","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"40s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Exceptional spiritual mastery\nAdvanced curse control\nAncestor communication\nCrossroads manipulation\nSpiritual defense\nExperienced mentorship","weaknesses":"Unresolved grief\nSuppressed rage\nProtectiveness toward Sax","combatStyle":["Tactical","Ritual-based","Binding-focused","Curse-based","Spirit-assisted"],"limitations":["Spiritual balance must be maintained"],"powerSource":["Chronoessence","Ancestor spirits","Loa","Spiritual crossroads"],"abilityNotes":"Voodoo in Aethelgard draws upon Chronoessence, ancestral spirits, Loa, nature, and places where the veil between realms is thin. Silas''s mastery makes him capable of maintaining spiritual equilibrium and opposing corruption such as the Shadow Blight. These same principles allow him to teach Kaelen structured spiritual methods for containing and grounding Umbral Genesis.","combatProfile":"Silas approaches conflict through control rather than simple destructive force. He uses spirits, curses, bindings, redirection, and manipulation of spiritual connections to weaken or neutralize opponents. His experience with the crossroads allows him to fight threats that operate across physical and spiritual boundaries.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Ancestor Magic\nSpirit Communion\nCrossroads Magic\nCurse-Weaving\nChronoessence Manipulation","secondaryAbilities":"Spirit Invocation\nSpiritual Binding\nCurse Redirection\nSpiritual Cleansing\nGris-Gris Creation\nRitual Magic\nSpiritual Protection","signatureTechniques":"Ancestor Communion\nCrossroads Invocation\nSpiritual Grounding\nCurse Binding\nCurse Redirection","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Lilac — #B47AE8"],"height":"6''4\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #111013"],"skinHex":["Deep Ebony — #3A2119"],"eyeColor":["Lilac"],"grooming":"Well-kept beard","skinTone":["Deep ebony"],"wardrobe":"Ritual robes\nLeather wraps\nLayered trousers\nLaced sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Long curls with a subtle undercut","accessories":"Bone necklaces\nFeather charms\nBeaded bracelets\nGris-gris charms\nRitual talismans","faceDetails":["Handsome angular face","Thick arched eyebrows","Full beard","Thin connected mustache"],"hairTexture":["4C","Curly"],"colorPalette":"Black — #111013\nDeep Brown — #3A2119\nLilac — #B47AE8\nBone Ivory — #D8C9AA\nDark Purple — #4A284F\nSpirit Green — #72C66A","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nDark brown\nDeep purple\nBone ivory","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Ancient spiritual attire combining practical wilderness clothing with ritual adornments. Bones, feathers, animal hides, beads, and intricate lacing visually reflect his connection to ancestral traditions and the spiritual crossroads.","appearanceNotes":"Silas normally presents himself with an easy, goofy smile that reinforces his relaxed and humorous persona. When that mask drops, his expression becomes gloomy and severe, with a blank stare, deep frown, visible rage, and an almost unhinged intensity revealing grief he has never completely healed from.","outfitMaterials":["Animal hide","Leather","Bone","Feathers","Beads","Woven cloth"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed","Confident","Intimidating when serious"],"signatureOutfit":"Layered dark ritual clothing with an open chest, intricate lacing, animal hides, bone adornments, feathers, beads, wraps, and weathered fabric.","distinguishingFeatures":["Voodoo-style tattoos"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:31:02.583952+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:27:14.453024+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing Sax","Failing his family again","Spiritual imbalance","Shadow Blight corruption"],"goals":["Prepare Sax as a successor","Ground Kaelen''s power","Protect Moonwood Vail","Preserve spiritual equilibrium"],"beliefs":["Ancestor veneration","Harmony with spirits","Balance between realms","Chronoessence connects existence","Spiritual power requires responsibility"],"culture":["Moonwood Vail","Voodoo tradition"],"lineage":"","storyArc":"Silas''s outward humor conceals grief and rage that never fully disappeared after his family''s massacre. His relationship with Sax gives him a reason to remain emotionally connected to the living instead of surrendering himself completely to vengeance. Through mentoring Sax and Kaelen, his role evolves from survivor seeking strength into a guardian responsible for passing that strength forward.","backstory":"Silas eventually married and had a daughter while his brother married and had Sax. At thirty-one, Silas remained home reading while his family went out together. Captain Blackheart''s pirates attacked while searching for a powerful vampire relic and slaughtered Silas''s family. Silas discovered one-year-old Sax alive beneath his mother''s body. Consumed by grief and the need to protect his nephew, Silas devoted himself to Voodoo and eventually rose to become the Grand Voodoo Priest.","childhood":"Silas grew up in the slums of Moonwood Vail with his younger brother and their struggling mother. At thirteen, Silas and his ten-year-old brother vowed to escape poverty and give their mother a better life. Through years of odd jobs and saving, they moved her into a small cottage when Silas was seventeen.","lifestyle":["Spiritual training","Ancestor communion","Ritual practice","Mentoring","Crossroads guardianship"],"storyRole":"Silas serves as a major mentor and spiritual anchor within The Chronicles of Umbra. His mastery of Voodoo allows him to bridge the living world, ancestral realms, and the deeper forces surrounding Chronoessence. His knowledge becomes especially important when he begins teaching Kaelen how to ground the unstable power of Umbral Genesis.","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Unresolved grief","Suppressed rage","Survivor''s guilt","Protective attachment to Sax","Humor masks emotional pain"],"motivations":["Protect Sax","Honor his family","Maintain spiritual balance","Defend the crossroads","Oppose the Shadow Blight","Avenge his family"],"personality":["Witty","Funny","Carefree","Protective","Strict","Demanding","Resilient","Vengeful"],"voiceSpeech":["Relaxed humor","Playful teasing","Strict teaching voice","Serious when necessary"],"likesDislikes":["Reading","Humor","Spiritual study","Protecting Sax","Pirates"],"majorLifeEvents":"Raised in Moonwood Vail slums\nVowed to escape poverty at thirteen\nMoved his mother from the slums\nMarried and became a father\nCaptain Blackheart''s pirate raid\nFound Sax alive after the massacre\nDevoted himself to Voodoo training\nBecame Grand Voodoo Priest\nBegan training Sax\nBegan mentoring Kaelen"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/74fd4dac-0364-45fd-9aae-2e363ac3706d/portrait/1790360616164-silas-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Sax\nKaelen","rivals":"","enemies":"Captain Blackheart","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Sax is Silas''s nephew and the only surviving member of his immediate family after Captain Blackheart''s raid. Silas raised, protected, and relentlessly trained him with the possibility that Sax may eventually succeed him as Grand Voodoo Priest. Silas later becomes Kaelen''s mentor, teaching him Voodoo principles to ground and contain Umbral Genesis."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"c68d60d1-883a-4683-8000-a9cd9d0d4d2a","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":null},{"id":"2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f","name":"Gaius","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f/portrait/1790360157683-gaius-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"","productionNotes":"","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f/reference/1790360166812-gaius-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f/alternate/1790360177853-gaius-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Gaius","race":"Elemental Dragon","alias":"The Sand Dragon","gender":"Male","titles":"Warden of the Wastes","subrace":"","summary":"Gaius is the Sand Dragon, born from the elemental union of Earth and Air. Calm, observant, and fiercely independent, he wanders the shifting deserts as a solitary warden. His power embodies erosion: the gradual reduction of even the strongest structures into countless moving grains.","heritage":"Indian + White","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Warden of the Wastes","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Shifting Sands","elementalHeritage":"Earth + Air"},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Physical attack evasion\nArea control\nAttrition combat\nEnvironmental manipulation\nArmor erosion\nBody reformation","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Patient","Defensive","Attrition-based","Area control","Indirect"],"limitations":["Extreme heat fuses sand into glass"],"powerSource":["Earth","Air","Sand"],"abilityNotes":"Gaius can disperse his physical body into sand, allowing conventional physical attacks to pass through him. Extreme heat can fuse his sand into glass, which he can manipulate into cages, barriers, jagged formations, or shattered projectiles. His sand combines Earth''s physical matter with Air''s velocity.","combatProfile":"Gaius avoids brute-force exchanges and gradually controls the battlefield through sandstorms, erosion, blindness, suffocation, and friction. He can dissolve into billions of grains to evade physical attacks and reform elsewhere. His high-speed sand can gradually strip protective material from targets.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Sand Dragon Form","primaryAbilities":"Sand Manipulation\nErosion Manipulation\nSand Dissolution\nSandstorm Generation","secondaryAbilities":"Mirage Creation\nFriction Manipulation\nSuffocation\nGlass Creation\nBody Reformation","signatureTechniques":"Mirage & Dissolution\nSuffocation & Friction\nGlass Creation","transformationDetails":"Gaius becomes a massive dragon composed of compressed golden-brown sand, silica, and quartz. His scales continuously grind and shift like moving dunes, while portions of his wings and tail dissolve into a perpetual sandstorm. His crystalline gold eyes remain completely solid and motionless while the rest of his body constantly shifts."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Lean-muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Golden Amber — #D89A32"],"height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #171313"],"skinHex":["Warm Brown — #9A6848"],"eyeColor":["Golden amber"],"grooming":"Natural","skinTone":["Warm medium-brown"],"wardrobe":"Layered desert wraps\nFlowing drapes\nLoose trousers\nFace wraps\nLeather waist layers","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Tousled medium-length hair","accessories":"Gold earrings\nBronze arm cuffs\nLayered waist belts\nDesert face wrap","faceDetails":["Angular features","Defined jawline"],"hairTexture":["Wavy","Thick"],"colorPalette":"Sand — #D6B07A\nDune Gold — #C78B3B\nCopper — #9B5D2E\nDeep Brown — #4A3025\nDesert Cream — #E6D7BC","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Beige\nCopper\nDeep gold\nBrown","alternateForm":["Sand Dragon Form"],"clothingStyle":"Practical early-medieval desert attire designed for heat, wind, dust, and long-distance travel. Gaius favors loose layers that move naturally with the wind and can be rearranged for protection during sandstorms.","appearanceNotes":"His human design carries a distinctly nomadic desert silhouette with flowing layers and minimal rigid armor. His clothing should appear weathered and functional while retaining subtle gold ornamentation.","outfitMaterials":["Linen","Leather","Bronze","Gold"],"postureMovement":["Relaxed","Quiet","Fluid"],"signatureOutfit":"Layered desert wraps with flowing linen drapes, loose trousers, wrapped footwear, leather waist layers, and a protective face wrap. Gold and bronze accessories add restrained ornamentation without sacrificing mobility.","distinguishingFeatures":["Desert face wrap"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:33:26.092803+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T18:27:16.828989+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":["Guard the elemental borders","Preserve the wastes"],"beliefs":["Power does not require recognition","Change is inevitable"],"culture":"","lineage":"Primal Earth + Primal Air","storyArc":"","backstory":"Born to Terrax and Atherous, Gaius inherited the physical mass of Earth and the relentless velocity of Air. Their combined forces manifested as sand and erosion rather than solid stone or open wind. He eventually chose a solitary existence among the vast dunes, distancing himself from elemental family conflicts.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Nomadic","Solitary","Desert wandering","Border guarding"],"storyRole":"Gaius serves as a quiet border guardian between the mortal world and the dangerous territories of the Primal Dragons. His isolation allows him to occupy a neutral position within volatile elemental family conflicts.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Values independence","Avoids family drama","Dislikes confinement","Prefers observation"],"motivations":["Protect the desert borders","Maintain independence","Prevent mortal trespassing"],"personality":["Calm","Observant","Independent","Reserved","Patient","Detached"],"voiceSpeech":["Quiet","Measured","Reserved"],"likesDislikes":["Likes solitude","Likes open deserts","Likes quiet","Dislikes loud egos","Dislikes confinement","Dislikes unnecessary conflict"],"majorLifeEvents":"Became Warden of the Wastes"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/2db0849d-a110-403b-a442-42bab2a31f6f/portrait/1790360157683-gaius-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"f6cff800-4029-4f02-b391-098583082feb","realm_record_id":"48066562-cd1c-4b72-8c29-399594efad38","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"65ff1f49-c1fc-4599-93a6-fe6a49a4c4d5","faction_record_id":null},{"id":"27d2993d-dc47-4027-9d2d-d0daed6b43c2","name":"Peregrine","media":{"tbdFields":"Age\nBirth date\nPronunciation\nName meaning\nExact height\nExact weight\nDominant hand\nMother\nPartner\nAllies\nRivals\nEnemies\nMentors\nExact dagger design\nExact illusion techniques\nIllusion limitations","canonLocks":"Male\nHe/Him\nKing Kaelo''s son\nOne of seven siblings\nMoonwood Vail\nWerebeast\nWarm caramel skin\nLoose 4C afro\nLithe slender build\nShortest older sibling\nIllusion mastery\nDeception mastery\nDaggers\nFox-Dire Wolf form\nSmaller werebeast form\nRed and caramel fur\nDark grey paws","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing artwork establishes Peregrine''s human appearance, fantasy clothing, daggers, expressions, and Fox-Dire Wolf werebeast design. Future artwork should preserve the established visual continuity.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/27d2993d-dc47-4027-9d2d-d0daed6b43c2/portrait/1790364115845-peregrine-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Done\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nWeapon Reference — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain Peregrine''s established anime/fantasy design across future artwork. His human form must remain lithe, slender, warm caramel-skinned, sharp-featured, and characterized by loose 4C hair. His werebeast form must remain smaller than his siblings'' forms and preserve its red, caramel, and dark grey coloration.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/27d2993d-dc47-4027-9d2d-d0daed6b43c2/reference/1790364122249-peregrine-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/27d2993d-dc47-4027-9d2d-d0daed6b43c2/alternate/1790364130239-peregrine-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Peregrine","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"Prince of Moonwood Vail","subrace":"Fox-Dire Wolf Werebeast","summary":"Peregrine is a lithe and cunning prince of Moonwood Vail whose strengths lie in agility, deception, and illusion. Smaller than his older siblings, he developed a competitive streak and a constant need to prove that he is every bit as dangerous. He carries himself with sly confidence, natural elegance, and a sharp awareness of his surroundings.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Prince","affiliation":"Moonwood Vail Royal Family","apparentAge":"Young adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Daggers","strengths":"Agility\nSpeed\nCunning\nDeception\nObservation\nIllusion\nQuick thinking","weaknesses":"Smaller stature\nCompetitive pride\nNeed to prove himself","combatStyle":["Agile","Deceptive","Evasive","Dagger-based","Misdirection-focused","Precision-focused"],"limitations":["Less physically imposing","Illusion limits unestablished"],"powerSource":["Werebeast nature","Illusion mastery"],"abilityNotes":"Peregrine is established as a master of deception and illusion. Exact illusion techniques, ranges, costs, and restrictions have not yet been established.","combatProfile":"Peregrine favors speed, misdirection, illusions, and precision over direct contests of strength. His quick movements and deceptive tactics keep opponents uncertain of his true position and intentions. His smaller werebeast form further emphasizes agility rather than overwhelming physical power.","weaponDetails":"Peregrine carries daggers at his waist for fast, precise attacks that complement his agile fighting style. Their exact design and number have not been established.","transformations":"Fox-Dire Wolf Werebeast Form","primaryAbilities":"Illusion\nDeception","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced agility\nEnhanced senses\nRapid movement\nStealth\nSharp observation","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Peregrine''s werebeast form is approximately the size of a large fox, making him smaller than his siblings'' werebeast forms. It combines fox-like proportions with powerful dire wolf limbs and a dense coat. His fur blends vibrant reds and warm caramel, shifting to dark grey around his dire wolf-like paws. His sharp, intelligent eyes and agile movements preserve his cunning personality in this form."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Lithe","Slender","Lean","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Amber Brown — #A8662B"],"height":"Medium height","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #15120F"],"skinHex":["Warm Caramel — #A96845"],"eyeColor":["Amber-brown"],"grooming":"Neat and stylish","skinTone":["Warm caramel"],"wardrobe":"Short linen tunic\nFitted trousers\nLeather ankle ties\nWide leather belt\nShort shoulder cloak","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Loose stylish afro","accessories":"Metal cloak brooch\nLeather belt\nDagger sheaths","faceDetails":["Sly fox-like face","Sharp features","Expressive brows"],"hairTexture":["4C"],"colorPalette":"Black — #151515\nDark Brown — #3A281E\nWarm Caramel — #A96845\nWarm Red — #9A3F27\nDark Grey — #3B3A3A","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nCharcoal\nDark brown","alternateForm":["Fox-Dire Wolf Werebeast Form"],"clothingStyle":"Peregrine favors dark, lightweight garments designed for maximum movement and stealth. His clothing remains practical while retaining the understated refinement expected of Moonwood Vail nobility.","appearanceNotes":"Peregrine is the most lithe and slender of his brothers and the shortest of his older siblings. His silhouette should emphasize speed and agility rather than physical bulk. His sharp face, loose 4C afro, sly smirk, and confident bearing should remain consistent across artwork.","outfitMaterials":["Dark linen","Leather","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Natural elegance","Confident swagger","Quick movements","Graceful movements","Purposeful movements"],"signatureOutfit":"A tightly woven dark linen tunic cut short for unrestricted movement with period-appropriate trousers secured by leather ties at the ankles. A wide leather belt holds his daggers, while a short dark linen cloak is draped over one shoulder and secured with a metal brooch.","distinguishingFeatures":["Sly smirk","Fox-like features"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:30:14.787091+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:19.126065+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Being dismissed as weak","Being overshadowed"],"goals":["Master illusion","Remain unpredictable","Prove his capability"],"beliefs":["Cunning can defeat strength","Size does not determine danger"],"culture":["Moonwood Vail","Werebeast royalty"],"lineage":"Moonwood Vail Royal Family","storyArc":"Peregrine''s established internal conflict centers on his need to prove that his smaller stature does not make him less dangerous or capable than his siblings. Further story developments remain unestablished.","backstory":"Peregrine grew into a clever and agile member of Moonwood Vail''s royal family. His smaller stature became both an insecurity and a driving force, pushing him toward mastery of illusion and deception. He learned to make unpredictability, speed, and intelligence more dangerous than brute strength.","childhood":"Growing up smaller than his older siblings contributed to Peregrine''s competitive nature and strong need to prove himself. Rather than relying on physical size, he developed cunning, agility, wit, and deception as his defining strengths.","lifestyle":["Practices agility","Practices deception","Maintains mobility-focused clothing"],"storyRole":"Peregrine represents cunning, deception, and agility among King Kaelo''s children. His smaller stature distinguishes him from his physically larger siblings and encourages him to approach danger through intelligence, misdirection, and speed.","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Short guy complex","Needs to prove himself","Dislikes underestimation","Highly competitive"],"motivations":["Prove his worth","Outsmart stronger opponents","Match his siblings"],"personality":["Cunning","Competitive","Confident","Sly","Clever","Observant","Free-spirited","Prideful","Witty"],"voiceSpeech":["Sharp wit","Confident delivery","Playful taunting"],"likesDislikes":["Likes competition","Likes clever victories","Likes proving himself","Dislikes being underestimated","Dislikes size comparisons"],"majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/27d2993d-dc47-4027-9d2d-d0daed6b43c2/portrait/1790364115845-peregrine-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Peregrine is one of King Kaelo''s seven children. His smaller stature compared with his older siblings contributes to his competitive personality and desire to prove himself."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"615fa3ab-4f1d-47f0-b4f3-5e94e4fbf5fe","faction_record_id":"ec408c98-c948-442c-9c14-74dd07dde097"},{"id":"808d3a77-faab-458d-9d54-715ac887bb40","name":"Sax","media":{"tbdFields":"Birth date\nName meaning\nElemental heritage\nSubrace\nHeritage\nNationality\nCurrent residence\nWeight\nDominant hand\nParents'' names\nSiblings\nPartner","canonLocks":"Duskari\nMale\nMoonwoodvail origin\nSilas''s nephew\nCrimson Tide survivor\nCaptain Blackheart killed his family\nAzure Fleet destroyed his family\nVoodoo Roguery\nInvocation\nBiomancy\nTwin shadow daggers\nPurple eyes\nCornrow braids\nRed hair beads\nKaelen''s close friend\nZafir rivalry","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Future artwork must follow the established production sheet and full-body reference. Do not redesign Sax''s face, skin tone, eyes, hairstyle, physique, signature outfit, weapons, or primary palette.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/808d3a77-faab-458d-9d54-715ac887bb40/portrait/1790363965860-sax-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Done\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Needed\nHair Reference — Needed\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nWeapon Reference — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Done","productionNotes":"The established Reference / Production Sheet is Sax''s primary visual canon. Preserve his dark skin, purple eyes, cornrow braids with red beads, lean muscular build, fur-trimmed vest, bone ornaments, deep-red sash, skull belt piece, Voodoo dolls, feather accents, and ornate twin daggers. Spiritual blade energy should remain dark purple and black.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/808d3a77-faab-458d-9d54-715ac887bb40/reference/1790363972828-sax-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/808d3a77-faab-458d-9d54-715ac887bb40/alternate/1790363979976-sax-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"19","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Sax","race":"Duskari","alias":"The Voodoo Assassin","gender":"Male","titles":"The Voodoo Assassin","subrace":"","summary":"Sax is a young Duskari Voodoo Assassin raised in Moonwoodvail. After Captain Blackheart and the Azure Fleet slaughtered his family, his uncle Silas took him in and trained him in Voodoo. Sax weaponized those spiritual teachings into an aggressive assassination style driven by Invocation, Biomancy, shadow magic, and curses.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwoodvail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Assassin","affiliation":"Umbra Crew","apparentAge":"19","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Twin Shadow Daggers\nVoodoo Dolls","strengths":"Extreme speed bursts\nFast reflexes\nClose-range combat\nSpiritual curses\nMental attacks\nHigh agility\nAssassination tactics","weaknesses":"Hot temper\nMental charms\nSpiritual manipulation\nImpulsiveness\nEmotional instability","combatStyle":["Voodoo Roguery","Dual-blade combat","Close-range assassination","High-speed movement","Mid-combat curse weaving","Shadow-enhanced strikes"],"limitations":["Sympathetic magic needs a connection","Blood curse requires prior contact","Spiritual Surge consumes life-force","Emotion disrupts concentration"],"powerSource":["Invocation","Biomancy","Spiritual energy","Ancestor spirits","Voodoo"],"abilityNotes":"Shadow-Cloaked Blades can temporarily disrupt Chronoessence conduits where Sax strikes. Grave Flashback overwhelms an enemy''s spiritual senses and forces traumatic memories or fears to the surface. Phantom Requiem: Thousand Curses summons spectral shadow-hands to restrain an enemy while Sax delivers a rapid sequence of shadow-cloaked strikes whose energy trails detonate in succession.","combatProfile":"Sax fights at close range rather than relying on stationary rituals. He channels Invocation through his spiritual techniques and Biomancy through his body, accelerating his muscles and nervous system with Spiritual Surge. His style combines rapid dual-blade attacks, shadow cloaking, sympathetic curses, and aggressive psychic assaults.","weaponDetails":"Sax dual-wields ornate curved daggers for rapid close-range attacks. He cloaks the blades in dark spiritual shadow capable of cutting physical targets and disrupting Chronoessence conduits. His blank Voodoo dolls become weapons for sympathetic curses after he obtains a physical connection to a target.","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Shadow-Cloaked Blades\nSpiritual Surge\nSympathetic Magic\nPsychomancy\nSpirit Channeling\nAncestor Communion","secondaryAbilities":"Sciomancy\nPhysical enhancement\nSpiritual tracking\nCurse weaving\nMental disruption","signatureTechniques":"Shadow-Cloaked Blades\nSpiritual Surge\nSympathetic Curse\nGrave Flashback\nPhantom Requiem: Thousand Curses","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Lean","Athletic","Muscular","Toned"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Vibrant Purple — #7B2CBF"],"height":"5''10\"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #111111"],"skinHex":["Dark Brown — #70472F"],"eyeColor":["Vibrant purple"],"grooming":"Neat braids with rugged styling","skinTone":["Dark brown"],"wardrobe":"Fur-trimmed vest\nLoose dark trousers\nDeep-red sash\nArm wraps\nLeg wraps\nWrapped sandals","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Cornrow braids with loose front braids and red beads","accessories":"Animal-tooth necklace\nTooth earrings\nRed beads\nUpper-arm bands\nAnimal-skull belt buckle\nTwo Voodoo dolls\nFeather bundle\nSpiritual charms","faceDetails":["Sharp eyebrows","Angular features","Confident grin","Small sharp fangs"],"hairTexture":["Tightly coiled"],"colorPalette":"Dark Brown — #70472F\nBlack — #111111\nDeep Red — #711B1B\nBone Ivory — #DDD2BE\nSpirit Purple — #7B2CBF\nTeal — #285B69","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Dark brown\nBlack\nDeep red\nBone ivory\nTeal","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Rugged Moonwoodvail assassin attire designed for unrestricted movement. Bone, teeth, beads, feathers, leather, and spiritual charms reinforce his Rootworker influence while preserving a fast close-combat silhouette.","appearanceNotes":"Sax''s established design uses a lean muscular silhouette with minimal armor for speed. His skull belt ornament, Voodoo dolls, bone jewelry, feather accents, braided hairstyle, and twin ornate daggers are major visual identifiers.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Fur","Cloth","Bone","Feathers","Cord","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Predatory","Agile","Fast","Combat-ready"],"signatureOutfit":"Sax wears an open sleeveless brown vest with fur trim, bone fasteners, loose dark trousers, arm wraps, rugged leg wraps, and a deep-red waist sash. An animal skull decorates his belt, two Voodoo dolls hang at his waist, and a feather bundle adds red, white, and teal accents.","distinguishingFeatures":["Small fangs","Red hair beads","Tooth earrings","Bone ornaments"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:35:28.28368+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:21.506892+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing another family","Failing his loved ones","Mental manipulation"],"goals":["Kill Captain Blackheart","Protect the Umbra Crew","Master Voodoo Roguery"],"beliefs":["Respect the ancestors","Protect those you love","Loyalty demands action"],"culture":["Moonwoodvail","Rootworking","Voodoo","Ancestor communion","Crossroads spirituality"],"lineage":"Duskari","storyArc":"Sax begins as a young fighter consumed by vengeance against Captain Blackheart. Training under Silas gradually forces him to refine his volatile emotions into disciplined spiritual combat. His bond with Kaelen and the Umbra Crew gives him people to protect beyond the family he lost.","backstory":"Captain Blackheart and the Azure Fleet slaughtered Sax''s family during the Crimson Tide Tragedy. Sax survived because his mother hid him during the raid. His uncle Silas took custody of him and attempted to teach him the healing and protective traditions of Voodoo, but Sax''s desire for vengeance led him to weaponize those teachings into an assassination-focused fighting style.","childhood":"Sax grew up in Moonwoodvail alongside Asha, Keno, Mali, and Rico. Their tight-knit peer group gave him a strong sense of community despite his naturally hot temper. His childhood ended violently when Captain Blackheart and the Azure Fleet attacked his coastal village.","lifestyle":["Aggressive combat training","Spiritual practice","Target hunting","Traveling with the Umbra Crew"],"storyRole":"Sax is an emotional lightning rod within the early Umbra Crew and one of Kaelen''s first true friends. His clear desire for vengeance contrasts with Kaelen''s uncertainty about his missing memories. Sax''s hatred of corruption pushes the group forward while his fierce loyalty helps keep Kaelen grounded.","birthplace":"Moonwoodvail","psychology":["Trauma-driven anger","Survivor grief","Vengeance fixation","Protective attachment","Emotionally reactive"],"motivations":["Avenge his family","Protect Kaelen","Destroy the Azure Fleet","Master his spiritual power"],"personality":["Hot-tempered","Fiercely loyal","Brash","Impulsive","Protective","Vengeful","Determined","Gritty","Competitive"],"voiceSpeech":["Blunt","Sharp","Emotionally charged","Quick-tempered"],"likesDislikes":["His crew","Challenges","Spicy food","Silas''s old stories","Dislikes vampires","Dislikes betrayal","Dislikes corrupt authority","Hates being tricked"],"majorLifeEvents":"Childhood in Moonwoodvail\nCrimson 