 Kaelo''s seven children. Fierce, intelligent, confident, and competitive, she carries herself with quiet authority and the controlled grace of a huntress. Her werebeast form combines the grace of a lioness with the powerful legs and heavy paws of a dire wolf.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"Late 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Physical Strength\nAgility\nSpeed\nPredatory Senses\nPouncing Power","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Predatory","Fluid","Close-range","Pounce-focused"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Werebeast physiology"],"abilityNotes":"","combatProfile":"Calliope fights with fluid, purposeful aggression modeled on a large hunting predator. Her werebeast form emphasizes explosive pounces, powerful limbs, heavy paws, claws, fangs, and close-range physical attacks.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Lioness/Dire Wolf Werebeast Form","primaryAbilities":"Werebeast Transformation\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Agility\nEnhanced Speed\nPredatory Senses","secondaryAbilities":"Natural Claws\nNatural Fangs\nPowerful Pounce","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Calliope becomes a quadrupedal werebeast approximately the size of a full-grown lioness. Her form has a rich tawny-gold coat, lioness proportions, powerful dire wolf-like legs, and heavy paws. A thick shaggy ruff covers the neck and shoulders, but she has no male lion mane. Her eyes retain the fierce intelligence and predatory focus of her human form."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Athletic","Powerful","Feminine"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #0B0908"],"skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Golden amber"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Deep brown"],"wardrobe":"Regal attire\nCombat attire","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Thick majestic locs framing her face and falling down her back.","accessories":"Gold hair cuffs\nGold earrings\nGold jewelry","faceDetails":["Long face","Angular features","Confident chin"],"hairTexture":["4C"],"colorPalette":"Black — #0B0908\nTawny Gold\nDark Brown\nGold","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nGold","alternateForm":["Lioness/Dire Wolf Werebeast"],"clothingStyle":"Regal fantasy clothing with dark fabrics, gold detailing, and practical construction suited to movement and combat.","appearanceNotes":"Calliope''s human design emphasizes strength, femininity, and predatory confidence. Her thick 4C locs visually echo the powerful silhouette associated with her lioness heritage without becoming a literal mane.","outfitMaterials":["Cloth","Leather","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Fluid","Purposeful","Predatory","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"Regal dark fantasy attire with gold detailing, fitted for mobility and a commanding silhouette.","distinguishingFeatures":["Thick long locs","Confident smirk"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:37:15.885714+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:23.933496+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"King Kaelo''s bloodline","storyArc":"","backstory":"Calliope is one of King Kaelo''s seven children of Moonwood Vail. She developed a fierce, competitive temperament and carries herself with natural authority. Her movements and demeanor reflect the instincts of a patient, confident huntress.","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Strong-willed","Self-assured","Competitive"],"motivations":"","personality":["Confident","Fierce","Intelligent","Competitive","Authoritative","Fiery"],"voiceSpeech":["Confident","Commanding"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/34b16e35-6625-4143-b97b-a3b628d60617/portrait/1790363775772-calliope-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nHuxleigh\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Calliope is one of King Kaelo''s seven children. Her established siblings are Cosmo, Gemma, Huxleigh, Peregrine, Venny''Claire, and Venny''Macon."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"54d24391-3ed4-445b-8bfe-8dba238fc8e0","faction_record_id":null},{"id":"3fd4e4a6-bb47-4ed5-9d1f-cae8636d7a3a","name":"Vorlenien \"Vorlag\" Hochmeister","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Black hair\nPiercing blue eyes\nTall build\nLean-muscular build\nBroad shoulders\nRegal presence","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/3fd4e4a6-bb47-4ed5-9d1f-cae8636d7a3a/portrait/1790363520697-vorlag-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done","productionNotes":"","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/3fd4e4a6-bb47-4ed5-9d1f-cae8636d7a3a/reference/1790363526757-vorlag-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/3fd4e4a6-bb47-4ed5-9d1f-cae8636d7a3a/alternate/1790363531960-vorlag-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"Vorlenien \"Vorlag\" Hochmeister","race":"","alias":"King","gender":"Male","titles":"King of Shadowfen","subrace":"","summary":"King Vorlenien \"Vorlag\" Hochmeister is the ruler of Shadowfen and wielder of the great runic magic inherited through his male bloodline. After his noble family was stripped of its status and later massacred in a fire secretly orchestrated by The Church, his dormant runic power awakened through overwhelming trauma. Raised and manipulated by The Church afterward, Vorlag pursued vengeance, power, and kingship while believing the prophecy surrounding his Runes of Dominion represented his true destiny.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"Vorlag","occupation":"King","affiliation":"Shadowfen","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Shadowfen","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Exceptional intellect\nRunic power\nStrategic planning\nStrong will\nPolitical authority","weaknesses":"Unresolved trauma\nFear of helplessness\nProtective obsession\nSusceptibility to Church manipulation","combatStyle":"","limitations":["Runes were initially uncontrollable"],"powerSource":["Hochmeister bloodline","Great Runic Magic"],"abilityNotes":"The great runic magic passes through the male Hochmeister bloodline. Vorlag''s abilities remained dormant until the destruction of his family triggered their violent awakening at age twelve.","combatProfile":"Vorlag possesses powerful hereditary runic magic awakened through extreme trauma. His Runes of Dominion form the supernatural foundation of his authority and are central to the prophecy cultivated around him by The Church.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Runic Magic\nRunes of Dominion","secondaryAbilities":"","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Lean-muscular","Broad-shouldered"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":["Piercing blue"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Pale"],"wardrobe":"","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Sharp jawline","Angular features","Strong brows"],"hairTexture":"","colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"","appearanceNotes":"","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Regal","Controlled","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"","distinguishingFeatures":""},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:39:22.116779+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:26.037429+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing his family","Powerlessness","Failing to protect Theron","Losing control"],"goals":["Secure Shadowfen","Strengthen his rule","Fulfill his perceived destiny"],"beliefs":["Power ensures protection","Control prevents chaos","His runes mark his destiny","He is destined to rule"],"culture":"","lineage":"Hochmeister noble bloodline","storyArc":"Vorlag''s tragedy begins with a child desperate to protect his family and develops into a ruler who equates safety with absolute control. His vengeance and rise to power appear self-directed, but both were cultivated by The Church. The eventual truth behind his family''s massacre threatens the foundation of his identity, kingship, and belief in his destiny.","backstory":"At twelve, Vorlag returned with Vex, Corvin Sterling, and Alistar Vane to find the Hochmeister home engulfed in flames. Hearing his family trapped inside triggered the violent awakening of his inherited runic magic, forcing Vex to knock him unconscious before the uncontrolled eruption worsened. The massacre had secretly been engineered by The Church to awaken Vorlag''s power and advance a prophecy surrounding the Runes of Dominion. Church agents subsequently sheltered and trained him while directing his vengeance toward the nobles they had used as puppets. Vorlag eventually rose to kingship, married Isolde, established Shadowfen as his seat of power, and extended his influence into Ironspire Hold and the Lionheart Plains while remaining unaware of the full extent of The Church''s manipulation.","childhood":"Vorlag was born into a high-ranking noble family and displayed exceptional intellect from childhood. At age six, rival nobles stripped his family of its position and reduced them to commoners. He witnessed repeated humiliation and abuse directed toward his family and learned that openly resisting their aggressors could bring even greater retaliation.","lifestyle":["Royal governance","Military oversight","Runic training"],"storyRole":"Vorlag serves as the tyrannical King of Shadowfen while unknowingly remaining a central piece in The Church''s long-term plan. His rule, runic inheritance, and manipulated prophecy connect him to the artifact that Elias Thorne will eventually seek to protect.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Deep fear of helplessness","Obsessed with control","Protection through power","Unresolved family grief","Trauma-driven vigilance","Righteous self-justification"],"motivations":["Protect his family","Prevent future helplessness","Maintain absolute control","Fulfill the Dominion prophecy","Preserve Shadowfen"],"personality":["Intelligent","Calculating","Protective","Driven","Controlling","Ruthless","Traumatized","Determined","Suspicious"],"voiceSpeech":["Commanding","Controlled","Authoritative"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Born into House Hochmeister\nFamily stripped of noble status\nFamily reduced to commoners\nWitnessed repeated family abuse\nAttempted to defend his family\nHochmeister home burned\nFamily killed in the fire\nRunic magic awakened\nTaken in by The Church\nTrained by The Church\nHunted the responsible nobles\nFalsely accused of killing his family\nPursued the Dominion prophecy\nMarried Isolde\nBecame King\nEstablished Shadowfen"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/3fd4e4a6-bb47-4ed5-9d1f-cae8636d7a3a/portrait/1790363520697-vorlag-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Count Vex\nLord Corvin Sterling\nLord Alistar Vane","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"Isolde","children":"Theron","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Shadowfen\nIronspire Hold\nLionheart Plains","relationshipNotes":"Vex, Corvin Sterling, and Alistar Vane were Vorlag''s closest childhood friends and remained central figures in his rise. Vex helped keep him level-headed through cynical distraction, Corvin brought humor during their childhood, and Alistar provided intellectual and physical motivation. The Church later positioned itself as Vorlag''s benefactor while secretly having engineered the destruction of his family."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":null,"realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"959ee89b-1d60-47e4-b017-93d8ade67726","faction_record_id":"74fb0163-f452-4f7e-a9ea-13c15bb960db"},{"id":"18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a","name":"King Kaelo","media":{"tbdFields":"","canonLocks":"Deep mahogany skin\nBlack 4c hair\nMedium-length dreads\nPowerful build\nPure Dire Wolf form\nBlack-and-gold palette\nGolden spiritual aura\nOgou-Style Martial Arts","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a/portrait/1790360382571-king-kaelo-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nAlternate / True Form — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve Kaelo''s deep mahogany skin, black medium-length 4c dreads, powerful build, regal black-and-gold presentation, and pure Dire Wolf transformation. His golden spiritual aura should remain the primary visual language of his combat abilities.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a/reference/1790360398954-king-kaelo-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a/alternate/1790360411311-king-kaelo-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"","name":"King Kaelo","race":"Werebeast","alias":"The Spiritual Anchor","gender":"Male","titles":"King","subrace":"Dire Wolf","summary":"King Kaelo is the independent ruler of Moonwood Vail and the father of seven formidable werebeast children. A pure Dire Wolf werebeast, he protects his realm through immense physical strength, spiritual discipline, and Ogou-Style Martial Arts. His rule has successfully kept King Vorlag''s tyranny outside Moonwood Vail''s borders.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"King","affiliation":"Moonwood Vail","apparentAge":"","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Extreme physical strength\nSpiritual discipline\nClose-range combat\nHigh durability\nBattlefield disruption","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Ogou-Style Martial Arts","Close-quarters combat","Aura-enhanced striking"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Spiritual energy","Werebeast physiology"],"abilityNotes":"Kaelo''s golden aura reinforces his strikes with battering-ram force. His projected shockwave can level structures and scatter infantry formations.","combatProfile":"Kaelo fights through Ogou-Style Martial Arts, infusing his physical strikes with iron-hard golden spiritual energy. His blows carry tremendous concussive force, allowing him to overwhelm opponents through disciplined close-range combat rather than relying on conventional weapons. He can also project his accumulated spiritual force outward across the battlefield.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Pure Dire Wolf Form","primaryAbilities":"Golden Aura Manipulation\nSpiritual Energy Projection\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Durability","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Speed\nEnhanced Senses\nDire Wolf Transformation","signatureTechniques":"Golden Shockwave","transformationDetails":"Kaelo transforms into a pure Dire Wolf werebeast. The transformation greatly enhances his natural physical power, durability, speed, and predatory capabilities."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Powerful","Athletic"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":"","grooming":"Neatly groomed","skinTone":["Deep mahogany"],"wardrobe":"Royal robes\nCombat attire\nFur mantle","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Medium-length dreads","accessories":"Gold jewelry","faceDetails":["Sharp facial features","Strong jawline"],"hairTexture":["4c"],"colorPalette":"Black\nGold\nMahogany","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Black\nGold","alternateForm":["Pure Dire Wolf"],"clothingStyle":"Regal dark clothing combining royal authority with practical martial attire.","appearanceNotes":"Kaelo has a commanding royal presence with deep mahogany skin, sharp features, and medium-length 4c dreads. His physical design should communicate both disciplined martial strength and the authority of an independent ruler.","outfitMaterials":["Fabric","Leather","Fur","Metal"],"postureMovement":["Commanding","Regal","Grounded"],"signatureOutfit":"Regal black attire with gold detailing and a dark fur mantle.","distinguishingFeatures":""},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:33:11.861815+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:25:38.732179+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":["Maintain Moonwood Vail''s sovereignty"],"beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"","storyArc":"","backstory":"Kaelo became the independent king of Moonwood Vail and maintained the realm''s sovereignty against King Vorlag''s expansion and tyranny. He became the spiritual and martial anchor of his family while raising seven powerful werebeast children.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Royal leadership","Martial training"],"storyRole":"Kaelo serves as the spiritual anchor of the Moonwood Vail royal family and the ruler who keeps outside tyranny from consuming his homeland.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Strong sense of responsibility","Protective of his family","Protective of his realm"],"motivations":["Protect his children","Protect Moonwood Vail","Preserve independence"],"personality":["Independent","Protective","Disciplined","Commanding","Resolute"],"voiceSpeech":["Authoritative","Measured","Direct"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Became King of Moonwood Vail\nDefended Moonwood Vail from King Vorlag"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/18527db0-a1c0-4b40-875d-8d911067a94a/portrait/1790360382571-king-kaelo-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"King Vorlag","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"Cosmo\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nGemma\nPeregrine\nVenny’Claire\nVenny’Macon","siblings":"","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Kaelo is the father of seven werebeast children and serves as the central spiritual and martial authority of the royal family. His opposition to King Vorlag is rooted in protecting Moonwood Vail from Vorlag''s tyranny."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":"d