"referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/37c82673-519e-4ab9-bcea-ed600577eec0/reference/1790363867954-huxleigh-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/37c82673-519e-4ab9-bcea-ed600577eec0/alternate/1790363873642-huxleigh-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Mid 20s","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Huxleigh","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"","subrace":"Polar Bear / Dire Wolf Hybrid","summary":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children and a powerful werebeast of Moonwood Vail. Large, broad-shouldered, and physically imposing, he carries himself with intimidating confidence and controlled strength. His gruff exterior and frequent scowl conceal a mischievous sense of humor. His werebeast form combines the immense scale of a polar bear with the lean musculature and long snout of a dire wolf.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"","affiliation":"Moonwood Vail Royal Family","apparentAge":"Mid 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Immense physical power\nDense musculature\nControlled brute force\nPhysical intimidation\nStrong self-control","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Brute force","Direct attacks","Heavy strikes","Controlled aggression"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Werebeast physiology"],"abilityNotes":"No elemental magic, cryokinesis, magical weapons, or other supernatural abilities beyond his established werebeast traits have been confirmed.","combatProfile":"Huxleigh fights through overwhelming physical power and direct aggression while maintaining deliberate control. His tremendous weight and strength do not eliminate his grace or precision. His werebeast form greatly emphasizes close-range physical dominance.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Polar Bear / Dire Wolf Form","primaryAbilities":"Werebeast Transformation\nEnhanced Strength\nEnhanced Durability","secondaryAbilities":"Enhanced Senses","signatureTechniques":"","transformationDetails":"Huxleigh becomes a monstrous quadrupedal werebeast the size of an enormous polar bear. His form retains a lean, muscular dire wolf structure and long predatory snout beneath thick white, silver, and gray fur. His amber eyes remain prominent. His growl becomes a deep rumble, while his demeanor shifts toward controlled rage and immense brute force restrained by conscious will."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Large","Broad-shouldered","Dense","Powerful","Muscular"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Amber — #D88924"],"height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #11100F"],"skinHex":["Dark Brown — #4A2B20"],"eyeColor":["Amber"],"grooming":"","skinTone":["Rich dark brown"],"wardrobe":"","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Short dense curls with faded sides","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Rugged handsome features","Strong jawline","Straight nose","Deep-set eyes"],"hairTexture":["4C","Thick","Tightly curled"],"colorPalette":"Dark Brown — #4A2B20\nBlack — #11100F\nAmber — #D88924\nPolar White — #EEEDE8\nSilver — #BFC2C5\nWolf Gray — #777A7D","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":["Monstrous polar bear scale","Dire wolf physique","Long dire wolf snout","White fur","Silver fur","Gray undertones","Thick matted coat"],"clothingStyle":"","appearanceNotes":"Huxleigh''s human form should emphasize dense physical strength rather than exaggerated bulk. His werebeast form is enormous and quadrupedal, combining polar bear mass with the leaner muscular structure and elongated muzzle of a dire wolf. The hybrid silhouette must clearly communicate both bloodlines.","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Heavy","Direct","Controlled","Graceful","Self-assured"],"signatureOutfit":"","distinguishingFeatures":["Intimidating scowl","Powerful physique"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:35:44.284815+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:22.192744+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail"],"lineage":"King Kaelo''s bloodline","storyArc":"","backstory":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children and belongs to the royal family of Moonwood Vail. Further personal history has not yet been established.","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Huxleigh is a member of King Kaelo''s royal family and one of his seven children. His larger individual role remains unestablished.","birthplace":"Moonwood Vail","psychology":["Controlled aggression","Strong self-control","Hidden playful streak"],"motivations":"","personality":["Self-assured","Confident","Gruff","Intimidating","Controlled","Mischievous"],"voiceSpeech":["Deep","Gruff","Direct"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":""},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/37c82673-519e-4ab9-bcea-ed600577eec0/portrait/1790363860158-huxleigh-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Cosmo\nGemma\nCalliope\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":"Huxleigh is one of King Kaelo''s seven children. Individual relationship dynamics with his siblings have not yet been established."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"a13abf6d-6ff2-42f4-a082-2ab7de1c32d4","realm_record_id":"63782818-208e-4e9b-a57c-9c33daba0589","workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":"54d24391-3ed4-445b-8bfe-8dba238fc8e0","faction_record_id":"ec408c98-c948-442c-9c14-74dd07dde097"},{"id":"60e6b4b0-fa5e-46ed-b202-7d8cea244f87","name":"Gemma","media":{"tbdFields":"Mother''s name\nHuman eye color\nHuman height\nHuman weight\nDominant hand","canonLocks":"Deep rich ebony skin\n4C braided hair\nBone-rimmed spectacles\nCowrie shells\nWooden hair beads\nNatural linen clothing\nWere-gorilla transformation\nMidnight-black werebeast fur\nGolden-brown werebeast mane\nAmber werebeast eyes\nCrimson spiritual markings\nGolden tail-tuft\nAfrican drums\nGōurīrā Loa connection","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing visual references establish Gemma''s anime-inspired human appearance, were-gorilla form, and full gorilla mode.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/60e6b4b0-fa5e-46ed-b202-7d8cea244f87/portrait/1790364214194-gemma-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nWere-Gorilla Form — Done\nFull Gorilla Mode — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain a high-detail anime fantasy aesthetic. Her human design should emphasize her scholarly, spiritual presence, while her were-gorilla design should balance formidable physical power with feminine, playful expressiveness.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/60e6b4b0-fa5e-46ed-b202-7d8cea244f87/reference/1790364310030-gemma-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/60e6b4b0-fa5e-46ed-b202-7d8cea244f87/alternate/1790364230710-gemma-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Mid 20s","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Gemma","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Female","titles":"Princess of the Monkey Clan","subrace":"Were-Gorilla","summary":"Gemma is a princess of Moonwood Vail and the spiritual intermediary among King Kaelo''s children. A devoted scholar of Voodoo and the Loa, she combines ancestral spirituality, ritual drumming, and immense were-gorilla strength. She is destined to become the chosen human vessel of Gōurīrā Loa, the trickster spirit of the Monkey King.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Princess","affiliation":"Monkey Clan","apparentAge":"Mid 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"Moonwoodvail","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"African Drums","strengths":"Immense physical strength\nSpiritual versatility\nPowerful grappling\nAncestral assistance\nSensory deception\nHigh agility","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Spirit Brawler","Close-quarters combat","Grappling","Spiritual misdirection"],"limitations":"","powerSource":["Werebeast physiology","Ancestral spirits","Loa","Gōurīrā Loa"],"abilityNotes":"Gōurīrā Loa is the trickster spirit of the Monkey King and Gemma''s destined Loa. Their union grants wild, liberating chaos energy capable of shifting reality, manipulating perception through sensory illusions, and reinforcing Gemma''s physical attacks with spiritual force.","combatProfile":"Gemma combines the physical strength of her were-gorilla form with unpredictable spiritual intervention. Her deep rhythmic chest beats act as calls toward the spiritual plane. Gōurīrā Loa''s influence allows her to introduce chaos, sensory deception, and spiritual weight into otherwise direct physical combat.","weaponDetails":"Gemma uses African drums as spiritual instruments rather than conventional weapons. Rhythmic patterns can accompany her communion with spirits and ancestral forces.","transformations":"Were-Gorilla Form\nFull Gorilla Mode","primaryAbilities":"Ancestral Assistance\nSpirit Channeling\nEnhanced Strength\nSensory Illusions\nReality Shifting\nSpiritual Reinforcement","secondaryAbilities":"Ritual Drumming\nSpirit Communication\nEnhanced Agility\nEnhanced Durability","signatureTechniques":"Rhythmic Spirit Call\nSpiritual Chest Beat","transformationDetails":"Her were-gorilla form stands around five and a half feet tall with a compact, heavily muscled build, broad shoulders, deep chest, long powerful arms, and a tapered waist. Midnight-black fur carries subtle violet undertones, while longer golden-brown fur forms a mane around her face and neck. Her amber eyes remain expressive, crimson geometric spiritual markings glow beneath the fur along her collarbones and forearms, and a short golden tail-tuft reacts to her mood. Full Gorilla Mode becomes more completely gorilla-like while retaining her black coat, golden-brown mane, amber eyes, spiritual markings, and immense physical power."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Slender","Graceful"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":["Black — #141114"],"skinHex":["Deep Ebony — #321F1B"],"eyeColor":["Dark brown"],"grooming":"Neatly maintained braids","skinTone":["Deep rich ebony"],"wardrobe":"Wrapper skirts\nWide-sleeved blouses\nCeremonial attire","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Intricate tightly coiled braids","accessories":"Bone-rimmed spectacles\nCowrie shells\nPolished wooden beads\nWooden talisman necklace\nRiver stone necklace","faceDetails":["Soft features","Dreamy expression","Small upturned nose"],"hairTexture":["4C"],"colorPalette":"Ebony — #321F1B\nLinen — #E7DDC8\nWood Brown — #75543A\nRiver Stone — #68675F","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Natural linen\nEarth brown\nStone grey","alternateForm":["Were-Gorilla Form","Full Gorilla Mode"],"clothingStyle":"Period-appropriate African-inspired clothing emphasizing natural fabrics, flowing silhouettes, practical movement, and spiritual adornments.","appearanceNotes":"Gemma''s delicate, scholarly human appearance contrasts strongly with her powerful werebeast forms. Her visual design should maintain an ethereal, meditative quality without diminishing her underlying physical and spiritual strength.","outfitMaterials":["Linen","Cotton","Wood","River stone"],"postureMovement":["Quiet","Gliding","Grounded"],"signatureOutfit":"An undyed linen wrapper-and-blouse ensemble. The rectangular wrapper is tied at the waist as a flowing skirt, while the loose blouse has wide sleeves for comfort and movement.","distinguishingFeatures":["Bone-rimmed spectacles","Cowrie-adorned braids","Wooden hair beads"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:29:48.750134+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:18.283644+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":["Master spiritual practices","Deepen her Loa connection"],"beliefs":["Respect for ancestors","Respect for the Loa","Spiritual coexistence","Clan unity"],"culture":["Moonwoodvail","Monkey Clan","Voodoo traditions","Ancestral spirituality","African drumming traditions"],"lineage":"Royal Moonwoodvail lineage","storyArc":"Gemma''s growing understanding of Voodoo and the Loa prepares her for her destined union with Gōurīrā Loa. This bond expands her abilities from ancestral assistance into powerful spiritual chaos, illusion, and reality manipulation.","backstory":"Gemma was born into Moonwoodvail''s royal family as a daughter of King Kaelo and the Queen of the Monkey Clan. She developed a deep fascination with Voodoo, the Loa, ancestral spirits, and ritual practices. Her spiritual studies eventually became inseparable from her combat abilities and drumming.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Studies Voodoo","Studies the Loa","Plays African drums","Practices spiritual rituals"],"storyRole":"Gemma serves as a spiritual bridge between Moonwood Vail''s physical and spiritual worlds. Her scholarship and connection to Gōurīrā Loa give her a distinct role among King Kaelo''s children.",