diaNotes":"Established artwork includes character portraits, a full-body combat design, visual production material, Soul-Tether and Heart-Seeker references, combat imagery, and promotional artwork. Future artwork must preserve the established blonde-haired, green-eyed Herabelle design.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b317848b-4cba-46fa-8807-4c9ffd26392e/portrait/1790364033055-herabelle-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nFull-Body Front — Done\nBack View — Done\nLeft View — Needed\nRight View — Needed\nFace Reference — Done\nEye Reference — Done\nHair Reference — Needed\nOutfit Breakdown — Done\nWeapon Reference — Done\nExpression Sheet — Done\nCombat Reference — Done","productionNotes":"Preserve Herabelle''s established blonde hair, green eyes, fair complexion, feminine face, slender athletic build, and neutral medieval-fantasy combat clothing. Soul-Tether and Heart-Seeker must follow their established visual references. Her design should emphasize beauty and elegance while allowing her obsessive combat persona to create a dramatic visual contrast.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b317848b-4cba-46fa-8807-4c9ffd26392e/reference/1790364038492-herabelle-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b317848b-4cba-46fa-8807-4c9ffd26392e/alternate/1790364048033-herabelle-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"","era":"500–1300 AD-inspired","name":"Herabelle","race":"Human","alias":"","gender":"Female","titles":"The Shadow of the Forge\nDevoted Protector","subrace":"","summary":"Herabelle is a beautiful, highly devoted protector whose loyalty to Alistair borders on worship. She serves as the finesse beside his overwhelming force, using speed, precision, and chained weaponry to control threats around him. Her affection becomes dangerous when jealousy or perceived threats to Alistair overwhelm her judgment.","heritage":"","homeland":"","pronouns":"She/Her","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Protector","affiliation":"","apparentAge":"Young adult","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"Soul-Tether\nHeart-Seeker","strengths":"Speed\nAgility\nPrecision\nWeapon control\nBattlefield control\nProtective instinct","weaknesses":"Obsessive attachment\nJealousy\nEmotional instability\nPossessiveness","combatStyle":["Macabre Acrobat","Chain combat","Acrobatic movement","Precision strikes","Protective interception","Battlefield herding"],"limitations":["Emotion can override judgment","Overprotective of Alistair"],"powerSource":["Combat training","Alistair-forged weapons"],"abilityNotes":"Her combat choreography should appear graceful and rhythmic even at maximum aggression. Soul-Tether creates broad sweeping movements and unusual attack angles, while Heart-Seeker provides compact precision at close range.\n\nHerabelle is her canonical name. Do not use Lyra.","combatProfile":"Herabelle fights through finesse rather than overwhelming force. Soul-Tether controls distance and enemy movement while Heart-Seeker handles close-range precision attacks. She uses fluid acrobatics to herd enemies toward Alistair''s attacks and will physically intercept threats directed at him.","weaponDetails":"Soul-Tether is a long chained weapon crafted by Alistair for battlefield control. Its chain, crescent cutting head, and weighted component allow Herabelle to bind, trip, slow, and manipulate enemy movement. Heart-Seeker is a jagged, ultra-sharp serrated blade forged from Alistair''s kinetic-absorbing metal for close-range precision and dismantling. Herabelle carries both weapons with intense affection because Alistair made them.","transformations":"","primaryAbilities":"Chain Weapon Mastery\nBlade Mastery\nAcrobatic Combat\nEnemy Restraint\nPrecision Dismantling","secondaryAbilities":"Battlefield Control\nRapid Repositioning\nProtective Interception\nTarget Tracking","signatureTechniques":"Kinetic Synchronization\nSadist''s Grace\nHuman Shield","transformationDetails":""},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Slender","Athletic","Agile"],"nails":"","eyeHex":["Green — #6F8F65"],"height":"","makeup":["Subtle eye definition","Natural lips"],"weight":"","hairHex":["Blonde — #D8B985"],"skinHex":["Fair — #E8C9B8"],"eyeColor":["Green"],"grooming":"Feminine and carefully maintained","skinTone":["Fair"],"wardrobe":"Neutral combat attire\nDark leather armor\nIvory underlayers\nTall leather boots\nFingerless gloves","hairColor":["Blonde"],"hairStyle":"Long flowing blonde hair","accessories":"Forge-soot vial necklace\nLeather belts\nMetal chains\nForge-inspired jewelry","faceDetails":["Soft feminine features","Refined jawline","Delicate nose","Expressive eyes"],"hairTexture":["Soft","Lightly tousled"],"colorPalette":"Ivory — #E6DDD0\nCharcoal — #211F1E\nBlack — #0D0D0E\nLeather Brown — #49372C\nSteel — #A9B3BA\nRune Blue — #8DD9ED","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"Ivory\nCharcoal\nBlack\nDark brown\nSteel","alternateForm":"","clothingStyle":"Herabelle wears elegant medieval-fantasy combat clothing built around neutral colors and dark leather. Fitted protection, layered fabrics, belts, chains, and subtle gothic detailing complement her graceful fighting style without restricting movement.","appearanceNotes":"Herabelle initially looks like an exceptionally beautiful and seemingly ordinary blonde human woman. Her green eyes become noticeably softer and gain a subtle twinkle when she looks at Alistair. Her combat expressions create a sharp contrast with her otherwise graceful appearance.","outfitMaterials":["Leather","Linen","Metal","Chain","Lace"],"postureMovement":["Graceful","Fluid","Acrobatic","Predatory"],"signatureOutfit":"A fitted neutral-toned fantasy combat ensemble with an ivory underlayer, dark leather corsetry, layered fabric, belts, straps, gloves, and tall boots. The silhouette remains feminine and elegant while allowing unrestricted acrobatic movement.","distinguishingFeatures":["Intense sanpaku gaze","Softened gaze around Alistair","Elegant combat silhouette"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:32:15.632468+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:20.760561+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":["Losing Alistair","Separation from Alistair"],"goals":["Keep Alistair safe","Remain useful to Alistair","Fight beside Alistair"],"beliefs":["Alistair is extraordinary","His creations are sacred","Protection proves devotion"],"culture":"","lineage":"","storyArc":"Herabelle''s arc explores the dangerous boundary between devotion, possession, and protection. Her loyalty makes her an invaluable defender, but her distorted interpretation of Alistair''s affection can become unstable whenever she believes their bond is threatened.","backstory":"Herabelle became deeply devoted to Alistair and established herself as his protector. Her attachment developed beyond ordinary loyalty, causing her to treat his craftsmanship, words, and gifts with almost sacred reverence. She quietly handles perceived threats around him rather than burdening him with every confrontation.","childhood":"","lifestyle":["Stays near Alistair","Maintains her weapons","Watches for threats","Preserves forge keepsakes"],"storyRole":"Herabelle serves as the graceful but dangerous shadow beside Alistair. Where his forgecraft and kinetic force dominate openly, she uses speed, precision, chains, and close-range attacks to control threats before they can reach him.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Idealizes Alistair","Misreads affection","Possessive attachment","Threat fixation","Extreme devotion"],"motivations":["Protect Alistair","Remain beside Alistair","Preserve his creations","Eliminate threats"],"personality":["Devoted","Protective","Possessive","Obsessive","Elegant","Patient","Ruthless","Jealous"],"voiceSpeech":["Soft","Melodic","Tender with Alistair","Cold toward threats","Guttural when enraged"],"likesDislikes":["Alistair''s craftsmanship","Alistair''s attention","Forge keepsakes","Protecting Alistair","Disrespect toward Alistair","Threats toward Alistair"],"majorLifeEvents":"Became Alistair''s devoted protector\nReceived Soul-Tether\nReceived Heart-Seeker"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/b317848b-4cba-46fa-8807-4c9ffd26392e/portrait/1790364033055-herabelle-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"Alistair","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"","worldConnections":"","relationshipNotes":"Alistair is the center of Herabelle''s devotion. She views him and his forgecraft with almost religious reverence and frequently interprets practical praise or affection from him as something deeper. Soul-Tether and Heart-Seeker are especially precious to her because Alistair forged them."},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_id":"c68d60d1-883a-4683-8000-a9cd9d0d4d2a","realm_record_id":null,"workflow_status":"draft","family_record_id":null,"faction_record_id":null},{"id":"263952e8-6fc5-4a74-845f-374026eaf29d","name":"Cosmo","media":{"tbdFields":"Eye color\nHeight\nWeight\nBirth date\nMother\nPartner","canonLocks":"Deep warm mahogany skin\nBlack 4C hair\nNeatly kept tight coils\nStrong defined features\nChiseled jawline\nHigh cheekbones\nTall muscular build\nSerious unwavering gaze\nAfrican-inspired clothing\nWolf ancestral symbolism\nDire Wolf Form\nUpright Sudoform\nCrystal-hardened fur","galleryUrl":"","mediaNotes":"Existing visual references establish Cosmo''s human appearance, upright sudoform, dire wolf form, and multiple crystal transformations.","galleryUrls":[],"portraitUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/263952e8-6fc5-4a74-845f-374026eaf29d/portrait/1790363585841-cosmo-character-portrait.png","visualAssets":"Character Portrait — Done\nReference / Production Sheet — Done\nSudoform — Done\nBurmese Tourmaline Form — Done\nAmethyst Form — Done\nObsidian Form — Done\nRuby Form — Done\nEmerald Form — Done\nRaw Diamond Form — Done\nWulfenite Form — Done\nBlack Rainbow Titanium Quartz Form — Done\nSapphire Form — Done\nRose Quartz Form — Done\nCitrine Form — Done\nAura Quartz Form — Done\nMystic Topaz Form — Done\nDioptase Form — Done","productionNotes":"Maintain Cosmo''s established human design, African-inspired ancestral clothing, powerful physique, upright sudoform, dire wolf anatomy, and crystal-hardened fur across transformation references. Individual crystal forms should visually reflect the consumed material while preserving Cosmo''s recognizable silhouette and wolf anatomy.","referenceArtUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/263952e8-6fc5-4a74-845f-374026eaf29d/reference/1790363591989-cosmo-reference-production-sheet.png","alternateFormUrl":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/263952e8-6fc5-4a74-845f-374026eaf29d/alternate/1790363598396-cosmo-alternate-true-form.png"},"status":"complete","user_id":"db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745","identity":{"age":"Late 20s","era":"","name":"Cosmo","race":"Werebeast","alias":"","gender":"Male","titles":"Prince of Moonwood Vail\nHeir to Moonwood Vail","subrace":"Dire Wolf","summary":"Cosmo is King Kaelo''s eldest child and a disciplined royal heir of Moonwood Vail. Serious, resourceful, and intellectually minded, he carries responsibility with a controlled presence that reflects the immense dire wolf power beneath his calm exterior. Blessed by Terrax, he commands minerals and sand and can consume crystals to assume specialized crystalline forms.","heritage":"","homeland":"Moonwood Vail","pronouns":"He/Him","birthDate":"","nicknames":"","occupation":"Royal heir","affiliation":"Wolf Clan","apparentAge":"Late 20s","canonStatus":"Canon","nameMeaning":"","nationality":"","spoilerLevel":"","pronunciation":"","currentResidence":"Moonwood Vail","elementalHeritage":""},"abilities":{"weapons":"","strengths":"Physical strength\nDiscipline\nMineral control\nDefensive combat\nCombat adaptability\nCrystal versatility","weaknesses":"","combatStyle":["Shadow Boxing","Feints","Misdirection"],"limitations":["Crystal forms require consumed material"],"powerSource":["Dire Wolf physiology","Terrax''s blessing","Consumed crystals","Consumed gemstones"],"abilityNotes":"Cosmo can draw minerals from the earth and shape them into weapons and defensive crystal structures. He can manipulate sand into quicksand and animate it into duplicates of himself. His crystal assimilation ability lets him consume different crystals or gemstones and transform his body into corresponding crystalline forms.","combatProfile":"Cosmo combines disciplined physical combat with Shadow Boxing, smooth feints, and misdirection. His mineral and sand manipulation expands his battlefield control through weapons, crystalline defenses, quicksand, and animated sand duplicates. Crystal assimilation allows him to alter his body and dire wolf form according to the gemstone he has consumed.","weaponDetails":"","transformations":"Dire Wolf Form\nSudoform\nBurmese Tourmaline Form\nAmethyst Form\nObsidian Form\nRuby Form\nEmerald Form\nRaw Diamond Form\nWulfenite Form\nBlack Rainbow Titanium Quartz Form\nSapphire Form\nRose Quartz Form\nCitrine Form\nAura Quartz Form\nMystic Topaz Form\nDioptase Form","primaryAbilities":"Mineral Manipulation\nSand Manipulation\nCrystal Assimilation\nCrystal Transformation","secondaryAbilities":"Mineral Extraction\nMineral Weapon Creation\nCrystalline Defense\nQuicksand Creation\nSand Duplication","signatureTechniques":"Sand Duplicates\nCrystal Incasing","transformationDetails":"Cosmo possesses a dire wolf form and an upright humanoid sudoform. After consuming a compatible crystal or gemstone, he gains access to a transformation based on that material. His body becomes encased and hardened in the consumed crystal, including his dire wolf fur, which transforms into hardened crystalline fur. Each consumed material produces a visually distinct crystal form."},"is_public":true,"appearance":{"build":["Tall","Muscular","Powerful"],"nails":"","eyeHex":"","height":"","makeup":"","weight":"","hairHex":"","skinHex":"","eyeColor":"","grooming":"Neatly maintained","skinTone":["Deep warm mahogany"],"wardrobe":"African-inspired royal clothing\nWolf ancestral regalia","hairColor":["Black"],"hairStyle":"Neatly kept tight coils","accessories":"","faceDetails":["Chiseled jawline","High cheekbones","Strong defined features"],"hairTexture":["4C","Tightly coiled"],"colorPalette":"","dominantHand":"","outfitColors":"","alternateForm":["Dire Wolf Form","Sudoform","Burmese Tourmaline Form","Amethyst Form","Obsidian Form","Ruby Form","Emerald Form","Raw Diamond Form","Wulfenite Form","Black Rainbow Titanium Quartz Form","Sapphire Form","Rose Quartz Form","Citrine Form","Aura Quartz Form","Mystic Topaz Form","Dioptase Form"],"clothingStyle":"Traditional African-inspired royal attire incorporating ancestral wolf symbolism and designs suited to his position within Moonwood Vail.","appearanceNotes":"Cosmo''s human appearance emphasizes discipline and contained physical power. His dire wolf nature remains visually suggested through his commanding posture and ancestral clothing even before transformation.","outfitMaterials":"","postureMovement":["Controlled","Still","Commanding"],"signatureOutfit":"African-inspired royal clothing decorated with symbols honoring his wolf ancestors.","distinguishingFeatures":["Serious unwavering gaze","Rare grimace-like smile"]},"created_at":"2026-09-25T18:37:36.786627+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-25T19:27:24.907352+00:00","is_complete":true,"origin_lore":{"fears":"","goals":"","beliefs":"","culture":["Moonwood Vail","Wolf Clan"],"lineage":"Moonwood Vail royal family","storyArc":"","backstory":"Cosmo was born into King Kaelo''s royal family and raised beneath the responsibilities attached to Moonwood Vail''s Wolf Clan. He was blessed by Terrax, gaining control over minerals and sand. His supernatural physiology also allows him to consume crystals and gemstones and temporarily embody their crystalline properties.","childhood":"","lifestyle":"","storyRole":"Cosmo is the eldest royal child of King Kaelo and heir to Moonwood Vail, carrying the responsibilities of leadership while developing his inherited and bestowed powers.","birthplace":"","psychology":["Burdened by responsibility","Emotionally restrained"],"motivations":["Protect his people","Honor his ancestors"],"personality":["Serious","Disciplined","Resourceful","Intellectual","Reserved","Responsible"],"voiceSpeech":["Few words","Controlled"],"likesDislikes":"","majorLifeEvents":"Blessed by Terrax"},"canon_status":"concept","current_step":6,"portrait_url":"https://dblwgpiiwkjhdegsindx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/studio-character-media/db618e68-0656-4b9b-b308-81e071faf745/263952e8-6fc5-4a74-845f-374026eaf29d/portrait/1790363585841-cosmo-character-portrait.png","relationships":{"allies":"","rivals":"","enemies":"","mentors":"","parents":"King Kaelo","partner":"","children":"","siblings":"Gemma\nCalliope\nHuxleigh\nPeregrine\nVenny''Claire\nVenny''Macon","worldConnections":"Moonwood Vail","relationshipNotes":""},"spoiler_level":"private","race_record_